&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in designing, building, and scale AI and automation solutions that eliminate manual work, enhance decision-making, and improve operational efficiency across enterprise processes, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation Solution Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement automation solutions (RPA, workflow automation, low-code platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop AI use cases (agent assist, copilots, QA automation, document intelligence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prototypes and production-ready automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity Identification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify automation and AI opportunities across business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct feasibility assessments and ROI analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize automation pipeline in collaboration with business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Solution Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Process Excellence teams to redesign processes for automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure automation readiness of workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deployment &amp;amp; Lifecycle Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and maintain automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance, stability, and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize existing automation assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Responsible AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with AI governance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply responsible AI principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage risk and ethical considerations of AI solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying, designing, and implementing automation and AI solutions to improve business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and business analysis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of process mapping, process redesign, and continuous improvement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate business requirements into practical automation and AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to work across business and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity for emerging technologies and a continuous improvement mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems, Business, Data Analytics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Intelligent Automation, AI, Digital Transformation, Process Improvement, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying Generative AI tools to business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean certification or Lean Six Sigma Green Belt is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Agile methodologies and data visualization tools (e.g., Power BI) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BGC &lt;em&gt;(7th Floor, Inoza Tower, 40th Street, BGC, Taguig City)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#helloconnect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role – Wat zit er in de box?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Onderhoudsmonteur &lt;/strong&gt;binnen de &lt;strong&gt;Technische Dienst&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in &lt;strong&gt;Bleiswijk &lt;/strong&gt;zorg jij ervoor dat ons distributiecentrum elke dag veilig, betrouwbaar en soepel draait. Jij werkt met (elektro)technische installaties die essentieel zijn voor onze operatie en speelt een actieve rol in het voorkomen en oplossen van storingen. Samen met je team verbeter je processen, borg je kwaliteit en draag je bij aan een veilige werkomgeving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Werkdagen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Maandag tot vrijdag van 08.00 tot 17.00 uur.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standby-diensten&lt;/strong&gt;: 1 keer per maand neem je deel aan de standby-diensten buiten&amp;nbsp;de reguliere werktijden. Tijdens deze diensten ben je oproepbaar voor urgente&amp;nbsp;storingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do – Het recept&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Installeren, onderhouden en repareren van machines en technische installaties binnen het distributiecentrum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Signaleren en oplossen van storingen in het productie- en logistieke proces, samen met collega’s van Operations en Facility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uitvoeren van periodieke controles en inspecties om storingen en veiligheidsrisico’s te voorkomen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meedenken over verbeteringen aan technische installaties, processen en onderhoudsplannen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenteren van werkzaamheden en vastleggen van onderhoud en storingen in het Facility Management Systeem (Ultimo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ondersteunen van afdeling-overstijgende projecten, waaronder de transitie en verhuizing naar het nieuwe DC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draaien van standby-diensten (één week per maand) voor urgente technische storingen buiten reguliere werktijden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring – Jouw ingrediënten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een technische opleiding (MBO of hoger), bijvoorbeeld in mechatronica, elektrotechniek, werktuigbouwkunde of een vergelijkbare richting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praktische ervaring in een technische functie, zoals monteur, servicetechnicus of medewerker technische dienst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basiskennis van mechanische en elektrotechnische systemen en het kunnen lezen van technische tekeningen en schema’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een proactieve en oplossingsgerichte houding: je ziet werk liggen en pakt het op.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt zelfstandig én prettig samen in een team en blijft rustig onder druk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je spreekt bij voorkeur Nederlands en Engels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre’s (geen must):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met onderhoudssoftware (zoals Ultimo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VCA-certificaat (of bereid dit te behalen).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NEN 3140 (kan ook op locatie worden behaald).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rijbewijs B&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boven alles zijn we bij HelloFresh op zoek naar mensen die ons elke dag een beetje beter maken&lt;/strong&gt;. Er zijn veel manieren om vaardigheden te ontwikkelen en we waarderen diverse achtergronden en ervaringen. Voldoe je niet aan alle punten, maar denk je dat deze rol goed bij je past en dat je hierin kunt groeien? Dan horen we heel graag van je.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit is ons recept&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De vrijheid en ruimte voor eigen ideeën en initiatieven én de kans om deze zelf te ontwikkelen en implementeren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De mogelijkheid om samen te werken met collega’s over de hele wereld;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genoeg ontwikkelingsmogelijkheden en een persoonlijk budget om verder te groeien binnen HelloFresh;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 vakantiedagen per jaar, plus 1 extra vakantiedag per jaar dat je bij ons werkt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reiskostenvergoeding naar ons kantoor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wekelijkse korting op jouw HelloFresh of factor_box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Korting op je ClassPass abonnement, en korting op je fitness abonnement via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ons FreshEnergy programma inclusief Headspace lidmaatschap, een samenwerking met OpenUp voor je mentale welbevinden, webinars en andere evenementen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gezonde lunches en fruit op kantoor;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meerdere opties om naar een werk gerelateerde afspraak te reizen, bijvoorbeeld door gebruik te maken van onze HelloFresh auto’s of een MyWheels auto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Korting op je aanvullende zorgverzekering bij Zilveren Kruis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pensioenopbouw&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungry for more?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verstuur je sollicitatie met cv en motivatiebrief;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zien wij een match? Dan volgt er een videocall met een van onze recruiters om te kijken&amp;nbsp; wat jij voor het team kan betekenen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zijn we allebei positief?&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Dan volgt een persoonlijk gesprek met twee collega&#39;s binnen het team in ons distributiecentrum om je beter te leren kennen en je nog meer inzichten te geven in de rol en de impact die je gaat maken;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tot slot heb je een gesprek met iemand uit ons Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phoenix, AZ&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Area Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift: Must be flexible to work any shift&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Description:&lt;br&gt;You will ...&lt;br&gt;● Respectfully communicate with all employees and leads.&lt;br&gt;● Provide coaching and development to shift hourly associates.&lt;br&gt;● Provide all employees with necessary tools, proper training and corrective direction.&lt;br&gt;● Report information and update managers throughout every shift with knowledge of that day’s&lt;br&gt;production.&lt;br&gt;● Resolve employee issues through appropriate problem resolution.&lt;br&gt;● Check and respond to emails in a timely manner.&lt;br&gt;● Balance quality, productivity, cost, safety and morale to achieve positive results in all areas.&lt;br&gt;● Work to continuously improve processes.&lt;br&gt;● Manage departmental performance measures, including visual controls and provides regular progress&lt;br&gt;reports to Associate Production Manager/Manager during the shift.&lt;br&gt;● Submit paperwork at the end of the shift.&lt;br&gt;● Conduct daily shift meetings and safety meetings with employees.&lt;br&gt;● Conduct interviews for nonexempt shifts within the department.&lt;br&gt;● Perform accident investigations.&lt;br&gt;● Manage department priorities as situations arise.&lt;br&gt;● Track absenteeism and timekeeping daily.&lt;br&gt;● Perform accident investigations and notify management as appropriate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are...&lt;br&gt;● Leadership: Able to train and develop a large group of employees and manage multiple&lt;br&gt;production lines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● A problem solver &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Results Driven&lt;br&gt;● Able speak to employees with tact and diplomacy &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Able to multitask: tracking/monitoring production and maintaining productivity&lt;br&gt;● Computer literate to input information into the computer&lt;br&gt;● Able to take direction and relay information to employees&lt;br&gt;● Comfortability in being exposed to cool and/or cold environment (10º - 40º)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;br&gt;● Required: High School Diploma or GED or related work experience&lt;br&gt;● Preferred: At least 1-3 years of supervisory experience in a production environment&lt;br&gt;You’ll get…&lt;br&gt;● Competitive Salary &amp;amp;amp; 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;br&gt;● Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp;amp; PTO policy&lt;br&gt;● $0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans effective first day of employment&lt;br&gt;● 75% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives)&lt;br&gt;● Snacks, coffee &amp;amp;amp; catered meals&lt;br&gt;● Company sponsored outings &amp;amp;amp; Employee Resource Groups&lt;br&gt;● Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Area Manager, Phoenix, AZ&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift- Must be flexible to work any shift&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Description:&lt;br&gt;You will ...&lt;br&gt;● Respectfully communicate with all employees and leads.&lt;br&gt;● Provide coaching and development to shift hourly associates.&lt;br&gt;● Provide all employees with necessary tools, proper training and corrective direction.&lt;br&gt;● Report information and update managers throughout every shift with knowledge of that day’s&lt;br&gt;production.&lt;br&gt;● Resolve employee issues through appropriate problem resolution.&lt;br&gt;● Check and respond to emails in a timely manner.&lt;br&gt;● Balance quality, productivity, cost, safety and morale to achieve positive results in all areas.&lt;br&gt;● Work to continuously improve processes.&lt;br&gt;● Manage departmental performance measures, including visual controls and provides regular progress&lt;br&gt;reports to Associate Production Manager/Manager during the shift.&lt;br&gt;● Submit paperwork at the end of the shift.&lt;br&gt;● Conduct daily shift meetings and safety meetings with employees.&lt;br&gt;● Conduct interviews for nonexempt shifts within the department.&lt;br&gt;● Perform accident investigations.&lt;br&gt;● Manage department priorities as situations arise.&lt;br&gt;● Track absenteeism and timekeeping daily.&lt;br&gt;● Perform accident investigations and notify management as appropriate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are...&lt;br&gt;● Leadership: Able to train and develop a large group of employees and manage multiple&lt;br&gt;production lines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● A problem solver &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Results Driven&lt;br&gt;● Able speak to employees with tact and diplomacy &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Able to multitask: tracking/monitoring production and maintaining productivity&lt;br&gt;● Computer literate to input information into the computer&lt;br&gt;● Able to take direction and relay information to employees&lt;br&gt;● Comfortability in being exposed to cool and/or cold environment (10º - 40º)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;br&gt;● Required: High School Diploma or GED or related work experience&lt;br&gt;● Preferred: At least 1-3 years of supervisory experience in a production environment&lt;br&gt;You’ll get…&lt;br&gt;● Competitive Salary &amp;amp;amp; 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;br&gt;● Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp;amp; PTO policy&lt;br&gt;● $0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans effective first day of employment&lt;br&gt;● 75% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives)&lt;br&gt;● Snacks, coffee &amp;amp;amp; catered meals&lt;br&gt;● Company sponsored outings &amp;amp;amp; Employee Resource Groups&lt;br&gt;● Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Area Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Quality Area Manager will lead our QA and Sanitation teams to ensure Good Manufacturing Practices (GMPs) and sanitation meet our high-quality standards to provide the best service to our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Respectfully communicate with all co-workers. Ensure effective employee relations with all departments in the facility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide employee instructions to provide advice on how to properly perform their task (QA checks, cleaning equipment, expectations, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Respectfully support and follow direction from all managers about line product integrity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work towards continuous improvement in all areas. Ensure all actions better the business of HelloFresh and do not break any company policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Maintaining accurate documentation regarding GMPs, HACCP, processing analysis and environmental monitoring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Coach QA &amp;amp; Sanitation employees to follow company policies and procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Train new employees on standard operating procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Performs duties of workers supervised, as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensure that the daily workload is equally distributed based priority and ability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reports defective materials or questionable conditions QA Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Follows prescribed safety policies and regulations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Completes tasks as directed with minimum supervision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Occasionally required to inspect products or surfaces using tools such as thermometer, gas analyzers, food scales, gas analyzer, etc., as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Update quality numbers in the computer system; must be able to use a computer and type/data entry using computer programs (Microsoft Office, Google Sheets)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Report food safety and quality problems to personnel with authority to initiate action&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Report on any discrepancies pertaining to current week ingredients or packaging&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervisory Responsibility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position provides guidance to employees by coordinating work and resolving problems. The FSQA Supervisor’s performance is evaluated by their leadership of the QA employees, productivity and prioritization of their designated team, quality/quantity of information reported each shift, and ability to guide employee performance on the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;While performing the duties of this job, the employee is in a manufacturing and assembly environment and is regularly exposed to cool and/or cold temperatures (30°F - 40°F). The employee is frequently exposed to fumes or airborne particles, moving mechanical parts and vibration. The noise level in the work environment and job sites can be loud.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
