&lt;p&gt;The Physical Security Senior Specialist is responsible for supporting and coordinating all aspects of the&amp;nbsp; organization&#39;s physical security program. This role helps protect employees, visitors, facilities, assets, and information by implementing security procedures, managing access control systems, and ensuring compliance with company SOPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and manage Asset Protection Support Request Log&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and triage reported security system issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action reporting and system change requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate complex issues to level 2 support as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and respond to Lenel S2 Netbox System issues, triage and escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and respond to system alerts in the Exacqvision video network, triage and escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review current training documents, updating versions as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with IT on equipment outages and other network issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and provide remote support for urgent system issues as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage security vendors by scheduling service, monitoring service calls, and certifying completion of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with team as needed to physically install, replace and or remove cameras, S2 Nodes and other equipment as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with all areas of the business in a clear and concise manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hands-on and solve problems on the spot&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Resilient and comfortable with occasional re-prioritization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Not interested in playing politics. You know that the best idea wins&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ready to learn on the job and realize that in every task there lies a personal growth opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Consistently tracking KPI’s and metrics in as close to real-time as possible to move fast, spot trends, and react to them early&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Clear on who your team’s customer is and how you can best create value for them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Someone who prefers sustainable growth over shortcuts and frequently asks yourself if what we build today will serve us well in the long-run&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel approximately 25%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years as a Security or AP Supervisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with maintaining Lenel S2 Netbox&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Exacqvision or other Video Management Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience servicing multiple sites remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of IT Network Infrastructure protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years managing systems for multiple locations, i.e. card access, video system, incident/risk management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
