&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Associate Director of Culinary Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fully onsite position: Shift (Monday - Friday 7:00am - 4:30pm) SHIFT FLEXIBILITY REQUIRED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor &lt;/strong&gt;a brand of HelloFresh is seeking an Associate Director, Culinary Operations.&amp;nbsp; The Associate Director of Culinary is a dynamic leader overseeing all chef success and advising activities, providing strategic vision, and directing culinary operations. In this key leadership role, the candidate will lead cross-functional teams, ensuring the highest standards of culinary execution, quality, and operational efficiency. With a strong background in culinary arts, strategic thinking, and management skills, the successful candidate contributes to strategic planning and offers broad administrative direction for overall operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire a dynamic culinary team, providing guidance and mentorship to chefs and staff members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the strategic planning process, offering insights and expertise to enhance culinary operations and overall organizational success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the execution of culinary activities, ensuring adherence to the highest standards of quality, innovation, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to achieve organizational goals, fostering a collaborative and inclusive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and improve culinary processes, implementing best practices to optimize performance and enhance the overall dining experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide broad administrative direction, shaping the vision for culinary activities and playing a key role in the planning, implementing, and evaluating of operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative thinker with a passion for culinary arts and a flair for creative approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational leader capable of motivating and guiding a diverse culinary team to achieve excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic planner who contributes valuable insights to organizational planning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player adept at working with cross-functional teams to achieve common goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven individual with a commitment to maintaining the highest standards of culinary execution and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and solution-oriented, thriving in a dynamic environment and driving continuous improvement in culinary processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive background in culinary arts and a proven track record of successful culinary leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strategic thinking and planning skills to contribute to organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong managerial skills with experience leading and inspiring culinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain and uphold the highest standards of culinary execution and quality on a consistent basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven collaboration and communication skills, working effectively with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven mindset, with a focus on optimizing operational efficiency and continuous improvement in culinary processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy, as well as paid holidays off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing discounts, including up to 75% off HelloFresh subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emergency child and adult care services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; monthly catered lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
