&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Automation Engineer brings technical experience in implementing and improving Automated Material Handling Systems and Technology within the fulfillment network. This role works closely with functional stakeholders, vendors, and other engineers to solve problems and reduce fulfillment costs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with external vendors and system integrators to design automated order fulfillment solutions. Work with top industry technology such as AMRs, Robotics, ASRS, sortation systems, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the lead on designing distribution facilities, including new facilities, facility retrofits, conveyor changes, and other material handling equipment (MHE) changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, define and implement process improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional team members to ensure their business needs are met by new system designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Technical Subject Matter Expert (SME) for all engineering processes and technology within the fulfillment network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Distribution Center layouts, material flows, Automation equipment, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business case justification for new technology, CapEx purchases and process enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage GenAI to automate time consuming tasks and improve internal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-oriented and able to gather data to guide decision making and find opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in equipment selection, design, standards, performance improvement, statistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work as part of a team and interact effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to analyze and provide solutions for cost reduction through automation implementation and cost/benefit analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A superior multi-tasker, and have the ability to meet concurrent project deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Known for delivering polished, high quality presentations and reports that influence and accelerate business decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel up to 25%, peaking up to 50% during project implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
