&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our New Ventures team is focused on growing our global footprint by launching our core products in new markets and expanding across multiple brands and verticals. We’re a globally distributed team operating across 7+ brands in 15+ countries, building desirable products and seamless, engaging experiences that customers haven’t seen before. With many exciting projects underway, we’re driven to generate the next billion-dollar business—so if you’re passionate about tackling bold challenges, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a close-knit group of engineers of different stripes - developers, designers, and product owners - who are working together to solve interesting e-commerce and supply chain problems around how people eat. Sometimes, this involves implementing features to improve the user&amp;nbsp;journey and making it easier for our customers to buy amazing food. Other times, this means creating stable software solutions that keep our distribution centers running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an engineer to help implement solutions &amp;amp; write beautiful code, working with various team members as we build out our consumer facing applications &amp;amp; the infrastructure that supports them. As a member of our Toronto team, you’ll work with highly-skilled engineers, who in collaboration with our other global teams, have turned HelloFresh into the #1 meal delivery service in the world!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable and reliable back-end services, focusing on distributed architecture and microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the migration of critical services from a monolithic architecture to a microservices framework, ensuring seamless integration and high availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct code reviews and provide mentorship to junior engineers, promoting best practices in software development, testing, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze system performance, identify bottlenecks, and implement optimizations to ensure optimal efficiency and reliability of services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry trends and emerging technologies, applying relevant advancements to improve the team’s technology stack and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural discussions and decisions, providing technical guidance and insights to shape the overall direction of solution design.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in full-stack software engineering, with a strong focus on back-end development and system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in back-end technologies and programming languages (e.g., Go, Python) and a deep understanding of distributed systems and microservices architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migration Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience in migrating applications from monolithic architectures to microservices, demonstrating problem-solving capabilities and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with cloud computing platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP) and container orchestration tools (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes) for deploying and managing services at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid experience in Agile development practices, with an ability to adapt to changing priorities and deliver high-quality results on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong mentorship abilities, with a passion for guiding and developing junior/senior engineers while fostering a collaborative team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent analytical and troubleshooting skills, with a proactive approach to identifying and resolving technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Effective verbal and written communication skills, capable of articulating complex technical concepts to diverse audiences and collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid hands-on experience working with AI coding agents (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents as thought partners to onboard on unfamiliar codebases and navigate new areas of the code with confidence. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools - specifications, constraints, examples - shapes output quality, and a developing awareness of how agentic outputs can fail, with growing habits around verifying, testing, and setting boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 3 days in office per week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role (What’s In The Box)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Over the years, we&#39;ve seen this mission spread around the world and beyond our wildest dreams, with HelloFresh now serving customers across markets around the globe. Our weekly boxes full of exciting recipes and high-quality, fresh ingredients have blossomed into a community of customers looking for delicious, healthy, and sustainable options.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Brand and Media Manager, you&#39;ll lead key brand activities for the Nordic markets, covering Norway, Sweden and Denmark as well as manage our demand generation media strategy and plan to grow consideration for the Brand. By leading comprehensive analysis of consumer insights and brand performance as well as driving and managing our media planning you will lead the development of future brand strategies and key initiatives aligned with our Global vision to grow the brand further in the Nordic markets. You will be based out of our Nordic head office in Island Brygge, Copenhagen and report to the&lt;strong&gt; Associate Director of Brand.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do (The Recipe)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll take the lead on major brand initiatives in the Nordic markets:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive brand media strategy and planning (Meta, Online Video. ATL) in partnership with our central media team and agency partners to grow brand consideration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of integrated omnichannel brand campaigns and partnerships (online and offline) that speak to Nordic audiences and address key consumer barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance and consumer insights to continuously improve media efficiency, brand engagement, and overall impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support planning and execution of the local Nordic brand strategy, ensuring alignment with global direction and local market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive organic social media strategy and retainers to develop culturally relevant content across our social platforms to increase brand engagement and sharability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage budgets and KPIs, using data to inform decisions and ensure a high return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee 360° campaign project management, from creative development to media rollout, ensuring flawless execution and collaboration across teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring (Your Ingredients)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in brand marketing and media planning, preferably in FMCG, D2C, media agencies or lifestyle sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of leading demand generating media planning and cross-channel campaign execution incl. managing annual media budgets (allocation, tracking, and reconciliation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creative and (social) media agencies, with a deep understanding of how to brief, manage, and evaluate partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp analytical and project management skills, with the ability to juggle multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye for market trends, consumer behavior, and brand positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Nordic media and consumer landscape, particularly in food, health, and sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; native in either Danish, Norwegian or Swedish is a plus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer (The Toppings)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Discounts – Enjoy 65% off your HelloFresh Meal Box and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development – Benefit from dedicated support for your professional development, along with the HelloMint mentorship program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 25 days of paid vacation per year, + 5 days of feriefridage. Paid leave also provided for your child’s first sick day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Benefits – Benefit from a Parental Leave policy supporting your family needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation and Perks – Includes a 5% company-paid pension and insurance package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health – Access to Spill online therapy, available within 24 hours of request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Comforts – Office perks include drinks and snacks, subsidized catered lunches, and breakfast every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness and Well-being – Discounts at SATS gym, plus access to sports and exercise clubs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are You the Missing Ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. Apply with your CV (In English please)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we see a match, you’ll have a call with one of our recruiters to share more about what you can bring to the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are both sides still positive? Then we proceed to the assessment stage to assess key skills required for the job&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be conducting interviews on an ongoing basis and will close down the position once the successful candidate has been found&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Chippendale and reporting to our Procurement Operations Lead, this high-impact role places you right at the core of our supply chain. As a Buyer, you’ll take full ownership of the Grocery category balancing speed, cost efficiency, and risk mitigation to keep our operations running seamlessly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll be the key connector across the business, collaborating daily with external suppliers alongside our Strategic Procurement, Production, Menu Planning, Warehouse, and Logistics teams. We are looking for a thoughtful, organized, and collaborative problem-solver who is excited to jump in, bring fresh ideas, and help build smarter end-to-end buying processes and tools as we continue to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Planning &amp;amp; Operational Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Own supply planning for the Grocery category, including auditing purchase orders for accuracy, executing emergency POs,&amp;nbsp; and managing stock-on-hand and ordering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Performance &amp;amp; Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead Weekly, Monthly,&amp;nbsp; and Quarterly Business Reviews with key suppliers. Track On-Time In-Full metrics, error rates, and quality issues to ensure high supplier performance and delivery precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Resolution &amp;amp; SME Contact: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the Subject Matter Expert and primary operational contact for category product or supplier issues, resolving supply-related incidents before they impact production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Lifecycle Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Balance forecasted demand with supply capacity to maintain optimal inventory. Implement buffer management to prevent shortages, lead SKU rationalization, and manage Stock Rundown Planning for phasing out ingredients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Integrity &amp;amp; Invoice Validation: &lt;/strong&gt;Assist with cost reporting and resolve invoice discrepancies regarding price or quantity mismatches in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Regularly visit production sites, communicate with production teams to drive continuous improvement, and provide supply chain viability advice on new ingredients to Culinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root Cause Analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Investigate major supply chain failures or waste incidents to implement preventative measures and drive permanent process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have/are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, some experience in procurement, operations or supply chain working in a comparable role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An organised approach to work and have the ability to think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good analytical skills, strong command of Excel/Google Sheets is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A “whatever it takes” mentality that drives you to find solutions quickly and whenever needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, confident in manner and are able to deal with a large and complex network of suppliers delivering a large quantity and variety of perishable ingredients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about our business: a foodie or an operations and problem-solving zealot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;12 Month Fixed Term Contract&amp;nbsp; - You must have the right to work full-time in Australia/New Zealand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
