&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience working within and scaling a fast-growth business or consultancy in a progressively senior role, up to the management / director level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional analyst and systems thinker: proficient in leveraging data architectures, workflow mapping, and process improvement frameworks to build compelling, data-driven answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a highly adaptable, empathetic individual who enjoys working in a fast-moving, uncertain environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead by example in your organisation, where you are admired and respected&lt;/li&gt;
