&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;On top of base salary and amazing benefits, this role is also eligible for the HelloFresh equity program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;For our ambitious and fast-growing team in London, we are looking for a Commercial Analytics Manager. In this exciting role you will be supporting with setting the analytical direction for the team, building &amp;amp; maintaining our BI infrastructure, and driving key analytical projects. Within this you will be looking to improve data quality &amp;amp; tooling across teams, bringing our analytical&amp;nbsp;capabilities to the next level. This will form the foundation from which you will produce insightful and&amp;nbsp;actionable dashboards, datasets &amp;amp; analysis, which in turn will be used to underpin key decisions and&amp;nbsp;recommendations, informing future developments and improvement of our product (the meal kits we send our customers every week!)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this hands on role you will be leading on the scoping, building and managing of our Commercial&lt;br&gt;BI infrastructure, ensuring we are providing highly insightful/actionable Tableau dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused on improving our data quality &amp;amp; tooling across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing a strong data culture across the business, influencing how teams adopt and act on&amp;nbsp;analytical insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideating, scoping and leading key strategic analytical projects focused on driving improvements in&amp;nbsp;our core product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep diving large datasets and pulling out key insights which will underpin core product&amp;nbsp;improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and obtain approval on any recommendations from Senior Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, develop and implement new approaches and processes across the business, whilst&amp;nbsp;mapping out recurring processes, and finding ways of simplifying/optimising them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with teams such as Culinary, Menu Planning, Analytics, Procurement &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Operations and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with International HelloFresh geographies ensuring synergies are found and&amp;nbsp;leveraged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural leader who can inspire and influence teams without formal authority, driving alignment&amp;nbsp;across stakeholders and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Tableau, with a strong working knowledge of data visualisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL is essential; experience with Python a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong Microsoft Excel/Google Sheets skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including the ability to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format that is easy to understand and communicate to all levels of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in a high performance and culture environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage priorities simultaneously and meet time-sensitive deadlines in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead interactions with senior stakeholders and to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management competencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys working cross-functionally, across teams and departments to achieve a joint objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to have a genuine interest in using data - something we love at HelloFresh! As well as an ability to use the data and information gathered to solve real business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have strong analytical abilities, and a keen interest to make a big impact on a fast-growing organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_, a HelloFresh brand, is looking for a Commercialization Chef (all genders)!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our newest brand, &lt;strong&gt;Factor&lt;/strong&gt;, and help bring chef-crafted, ready-to-heat meals from concept to customers&#39; tables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Commercialization Chef (all genders)&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a key role in turning innovative recipes into scalable, high-quality products. Acting as the bridge between Product Development and Kitchen Operations, you&#39;ll ensure every new meal is optimized for commercial production, delivering exceptional quality, consistency, and efficiency. From establishing yields and validating production processes to driving weekly menu launches, you&#39;ll be at the heart of Factor&#39;s culinary innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re an entrepreneurial culinary professional who thrives in a fast-paced environment, enjoys solving complex challenges, and is passionate about shaping the future of the food industry, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive culinary excellence by leading recipe scale-ups, refining production processes, and ensuring successful commercialization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end scale-up of new recipes, ensuring every meal meets quality, consistency, and food safety standards before full-scale production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and execute R&amp;amp;D recipes at production scale, including ingredient planning, equipment coordination, production execution, plating, and organoleptic evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish initial production yields based on equipment capacity and operational requirements, partnering with R&amp;amp;D Chefs to optimize recipes where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate recipe methods and production processes to ensure seamless integration into kitchen operations, documenting findings and recommending process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with the Culinary Team to bridge the gap between recipe development and commercial production, translating creative concepts into scalable operational solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Kitchen Operations, Sous Chefs, and Executive Sous Chefs to improve product quality, production efficiency, and operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure all recipes meet quality standards, specifications, and production requirements before launch, supporting successful new product introductions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate production equipment and workflows by conducting capacity studies, recommending new equipment where appropriate, and identifying opportunities to standardize processes and increase efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor production performance and investigate quality issues, identifying root causes and implementing corrective actions to improve customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own yield validation by conducting follow-up testing, analyzing production data, and partnering with Operations to optimize yields and ensure consistency between expected and actual production results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead regular reviews with the Culinary Lead to share insights, resolve challenges, and drive continuous improvements across recipes, processes, and production readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Degree or diploma in Culinary Arts, Culinary Science, Food Science, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience in corporate food R&amp;amp;D, food manufacturing, or high-volume restaurant, catering, or banquet operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, with a proven ability to manage multiple priorities, execute against deadlines, and deliver high-quality results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process-driven, with a passion for developing scalable production processes and ensuring operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity, solving complex problems independently, and making data-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong ownership mindset with an entrepreneurial approach—you proactively identify opportunities, take initiative, and drive projects through to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Naturally curious and continuously seeking opportunities to innovate, optimize processes, and improve products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer-focused, with a strong understanding of how decisions impact both internal stakeholders and the end customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to build strong partnerships across Culinary, R&amp;amp;D, and Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptable and energized by working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where priorities evolve quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to internal training programs and an annual budget to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ Meals:&lt;/strong&gt; Exclusive employee discounts on our delicious and nutritious Factor_ meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and 30 days of paid annual leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to a variety of wellbeing initiatives, with additional fitness and wellness benefits being introduced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We continuously expand our benefits portfolio, including mobility support and retirement benefits, to provide even greater flexibility and long-term security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents. We welcome applications without a photo and without information regarding nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics. You are also welcome to include language certificates and documentation confirming your right to live and work in the respective country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
