&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-6aa02ea2-6370-83ed-968f-5102ede4f937-129&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-6aa02ea2-6370-83ed-968f-5102ede4f937-129&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-160&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;Join a French foodtech superstar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re changing the way people in France eat and cook with our meal kits!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition? To revolutionize our subscribers’ everyday lives by promoting a more sustainable way of cooking while helping them discover delicious, creative and balanced recipes. The perfect combination of technology and gastronomy, for maximum enjoyment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh operates in more than 15 countries. France is a young market, launched in 2019, and has experienced tremendous growth: we have already been the market leader since 2021. It’s the perfect time to join our team and make a real impact in one of France’s most promising scale-ups!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we make all this possible? Through a talented and dynamic team, strong values centered around kindness and diversity, and an inspiring and stimulating work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2023, we opened a production site in France. If you’d like to be part of this incredible human, international and entrepreneurial adventure, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Junior Supply Chain Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll help ensure our production always receives the right ingredients and materials on time, in full, and with the required quality. You&#39;ll be the main point of contact for suppliers whenever deliveries don&#39;t go as planned and work closely with internal teams to find quick and effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines communication, coordination, and data analysis. You&#39;ll investigate issues, identify root causes, and support continuous process improvements. Your work has a direct impact on ensuring our customers receive their HelloFresh boxes exactly as expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor inbound deliveries and ensure production is supplied on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for suppliers regarding delivery delays, shortages, or quality deviations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead confident and solution-oriented conversations with suppliers, following up until issues are resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Procurement, Production, Warehouse, FSQA, and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse delivery issues and perform root cause analyses to identify improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare reports and communicate insights clearly to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support continuous improvement initiatives across our supply chain processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce food waste while maintaining excellent supplier performance and service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Supply Chain Management, Logistics, Business Administration, or a related field, or an equivalent qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical experience through internships, working student positions, or an entry-level role in Supply Chain, Logistics, or Manufacturing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both &lt;strong&gt;French and English (minimum B2 level)&lt;/strong&gt;, as you&#39;ll communicate daily with suppliers and internal stakeholders in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the confidence to manage challenging supplier conversations professionally and assertively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured way of working with the ability to prioritise tasks and stay calm under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset with&amp;nbsp; experience using Excel or Google Sheets. Experience with ERP, WMS, or BI tools is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The days off are Monday and Sunday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;fully onsite position&lt;/strong&gt; at our production site. Remote work is not available for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work weekends when required is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group is looking for a mid-level copywriter to join our in-house creative studio in Berlin, writing everything from punchy headlines to tactical CTAs that turn the curious into customers. Duties will have a strong digial media component, emphasizing bold, attention-grabbing assets aimed at smashing existing perceptions of our brands and reframing them for future growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll spend most of your time on mid- and lower-funnel assets across several channels (including CRM, paid social, organic social, display, flyers, packaging, and landing pages), with some lighter brand work mixed in to keep things interesting. You understand how to use copy to build credibility, spark interest, and move people to act. You sweat the details, sharpen every line and know that a well-placed verb beats a stack of adjectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within the Global Creative team, reporting to the Associate Director of International Content Strategy and working closely with stakeholders across local and global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to briefs and write impactful, creative copy across multiple touchpoints, in line with our brands’ strategies and business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose striking, edgy copy directions that will grab attention and spark brand consideration –&amp;nbsp;especially on social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring our brands’ tones of voice to life across every asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with stakeholders on the key messages, benefits, and proof points that need to land&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with designers to build marketing assets for online and offline channels, from static banners to dynamic video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorously proofread your copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage content via Google Suite, Jira, and other platforms so it flows smoothly to stakeholders and transcreators&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on-site in our Creative Studio in Moabit a minimum of three days per week (Monday-Wednesday)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A full-time copywriter based in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS from a top-tier university in Communications, Marketing, Creative Writing, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum three years of copywriting or communications experience, ideally in food or tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding English copywriting skills – clean, confident, clutter-free&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at leveraging AI platforms to ideate concepts, generate copy, and tailor messaging to channel best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience writing for paid social (Instagram, Facebook, TikTok), digital display (Google Ads, YouTube), CRM, landing pages, and GEO/SEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with brand toolkits and tone of voice guides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to write for multiple projects and brands simultaneously, shifting tone and tactics as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of time management and the ability to juggle a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to deliver on goals while managing scope, time, quality, and risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about food and cooking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of German, French, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, or Dutch is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;HelloFresh is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Creative Operations team in New York. This role will serve as the operational lead for our fast-growing brands, partnering closely with Marketing, Creative, Production, and cross-functional stakeholders to deliver high-impact campaigns, product launches, and always-on marketing initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Creative Operations Lead, North America&lt;/strong&gt;, this role serves as the Creative Operations partner for the HelloFresh portfolio of brands, ensuring successful execution of the brand&#39;s strategic marketing initiatives while collaborating with the broader North American Creative Operations organization. The ideal candidate is an exceptional operator who thrives in a fast-paced environment, brings structure to complex initiatives, and continuously identifies opportunities to improve processes, increase efficiency, and enable creative teams to do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own Creative Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end operational management across integrated marketing initiatives, overseeing project planning, execution, and delivery from intake through final asset release across digital, print, packaging, video, photography, CRM, and lifecycle marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Strategic Marketing Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage operational delivery for major business priorities including Peak campaigns, product launches, refreshed meal photography, strategic partnerships, packaging initiatives, brand campaigns, and cross-channel marketing programs, ensuring milestones are met and deliverables are executed on time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary Creative Operations partner for Brand Marketing, Creative, Production, Lifecycle Marketing, Product Marketing, Packaging, and external agency partners, ensuring alignment on priorities, timelines, deliverables, and business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource &amp;amp; Capacity Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Creative Resource Manager and Creative Operations Lead to forecast upcoming work, balance team capacity, identify resourcing risks, and recommend freelance or agency support as business needs evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee the end-to-end creative lifecycle across multiple concurrent initiatives while continuously improving workflows, intake processes, project governance, and ways of working to increase speed-to-market and operational efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Production Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage complex integrated project plans, coordinating cross-functional teams through creative development, production, reviews, approvals, and final asset delivery while proactively identifying risks and removing blockers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow &amp;amp; Systems Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Champion best practices across project management systems and operational tools, driving adoption of standardized processes while identifying opportunities for automation and scalable operational improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain reporting that provides visibility into project health, team capacity, delivery performance, and operational metrics, enabling informed decision-making across Creative Operations and Marketing leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead retrospectives following major campaigns, productions, and launches, documenting learnings and implementing scalable process improvements that strengthen creative operations across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You have...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in Creative Operations, Creative Project Management, or integrated marketing operations, including direct experience managing creative workflows within an in-house creative team, agency, or studio environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional marketing initiatives from planning through execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of integrated creative workflows across digital, print, packaging, photography and video production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with Marketing, Creative, Production, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong project planning, organizational, prioritization, and risk management skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working within project management platforms such as Airtable, Jira, Asana, Monday.com, Workfront, or similar tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience using reporting and resource planning tools to support operational decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and relationship-building skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Passion for process improvement, operational excellence, and building scalable ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$101,430&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$117,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is seeking a sharp, systems-minded Creative Systems &amp;amp; Optimization Manager to own the operating model behind our XPOD studio. As the single intake owner across Paid Social, Organic Social, Brand Partnerships and localization, this role turns a complex, multi-brand production slate into one prioritized, efficient engine — ensuring the highest-impact work moves first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;XPOD Creative Studio is focused on delivering a high output of creative assets to drive growth across paid channels. Day-to-day, that still means hands-on project management - scoping, scheduling, resourcing, and driving projects through to completion across TikTok, Reels, Snap, Pinterest, YouTube and beyond. We move fast, flex with business needs and operate at the intersection of creative and performance. The right candidate is fluent in Growth, obsessed with efficiency and skilled at building systems that help creative teams move faster and smarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional Creative Operations/PM role. You’ll proactively build AI-powered workflows, automate manual processes and keep stakeholders across Growth, Brand, Influencer and markets aligned and moving. In close partnership with Growth Ops, you’ll continuously test and embed smarter ways of working into the studio’s day-to-day operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design and evolution of the studio&#39;s operational workflows - building frameworks flexible enough to move with shifting business needs, yet structured enough to scale and stay easy for others to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong project management fundamentals - setting milestones and deadlines from a brief, driving the decisions needed to execute within time constraints, and pushing every project through to completion, even when things are ambiguous or change at the last minute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own all studio intake as the single point of contact for every video brief across brands and channels: scoping, prioritizing, and routing every request against total studio capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, evaluate, and implement automations, AI tools, and templates that lift the studio&#39;s operating efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the studio&#39;s performance data and reporting - trends, production velocity, and project-level status - keeping the Head of Creative Production, project teams, and other stakeholders ahead of timelines and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate schedules and workflows with the wider creative operations team and Growth Operations, keeping cross-studio campaigns and the paid social content pipeline in sync.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close enough to every project in the pipeline that creatives always have what they need to keep moving, and that no question sits unanswered long enough to cause a delay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders and creative teams to shape expectations and define project scope, and manage those relationships day to day - including negotiating, and where necessary pushing back on, channel requests against budget and priority so the studio&#39;s limited creative capacity goes toward what the business actually needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own resourcing and allocation across the creative team - assessing priority, balancing workload and timelines, and adjusting on the fly so creatives can sustain their pace without projects slipping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard, train, and manage freelance creatives and creative partners or vendors, flexing the team&#39;s capacity up or down against demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global stakeholders on localization, translation and versioning of assets, ensuring creative holds up at both a product and creative level in every local market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects launch on time and to expectation, and drive the post-campaign assessments that follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring critical thinking to competing business interests, cross-functional friction, and risk resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccably organized, with an eye for detail that doesn&#39;t slow you down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in paid social media channels, growth funnels, and performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An empowered self-starter with strong time, people, and stakeholder management instincts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident negotiator on time, scope, budget, and resources - comfortable pushing back when a request doesn&#39;t match the studio&#39;s capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker who&#39;d rather design the framework than just manage what runs through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI power-user: you build and maximize automation proactively, a self-starter obsessed with efficiency rather than waiting to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural coach, comfortable onboarding, training, and developing freelance creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to run high volumes of concurrent projects through prioritization and organization under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to follow through, own, and guide a project from infancy to execution - even when very little is known at the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fan of working in an ultra-fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative thinker who uses non-linear approaches and critical thinking to proactively problem-solve and steer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to challenge assumptions and the status quo in favor of iterative, adaptive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-oriented - you flag and fix problems as they arise, not after the fact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Advertising, Business, Management, Communications, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of creative/marketing project management or creative operations experience at an in-house agency or studio, in a high-volume, high-efficiency, fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or evolving operational workflows and resourcing frameworks, not just executing within existing ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a project management system (e.g. Jira, Airtable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing, training, or onboarding freelance or contract creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity evaluating or implementing automation, AI tools, or templated workflows within a creative production context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appreciation for creative and production workflows and experience working closely with creative teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills, including experience negotiating scope and budget with non-creative stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing 360 campaigns spanning multiple deliverables (e.g. digital, photo, and video production).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international/localization workflows is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3780&quot; data-end=&quot;3791&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and 401(k) with company match (vesting immediately upon participation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO policy and 4 weeks of parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;$0 monthly premium and flexible health plans starting on day one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;85% discount on your HelloFresh subscription and other product offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
