&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Instandhaltungstechniker*In reparierst und wartest Du unsere Fördertechnischen Anlagen und bist involviert in einem Arbeitsumfeld, welches kontinuierlich das System verbessern möchte. Hier bringst Du Dich mit Deinen Ideen und Know-How ein und findest im Team die beste Lösung für das Unternehmen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Werde Teil der Tagschicht mit Arbeitszeiten von Montag bis Freitag!&lt;/strong&gt; Dann bewirb Dich bei uns!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist zuständig für die Ausführung der präventiven (PM), prädiktiven (PdM) und korrektiven (CM) Instandhaltung unserer automatisierten und pneumatischen Anlagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst die Wartung und Fehlerbehebung an Fördertechnik, pneumatischen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anlagen, Robotersystemen und Hochregalsystemen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt bei Root Cause Analyses (RCAs), um Ursachen auf den Grund zu gehen und nachhaltige „100-Jahre-Lösungen“ zu entwickeln, statt nur kurzfristige Flicken zu setzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Im Falle von kritischen Ereignissen oder Systemnotfällen unterstützt du das reaktive Team vor Ort bei der Entstörung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst Verbesserungsmöglichkeiten und hilfst bei der Optimierung unserer Prozesse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest den Ausbau und die Modernisierung bestehender Anlagen im gesamten Cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine abgeschlossene Ausbildung im Bereich Elektrotechnik, Mechanik oder Mechatronik (oder eine artverwandte technische Ausbildung).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst erste Erfahrungen in der Instandhaltung von automatisierten und pneumatischen Systemen mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über fließende Deutschkenntnisse, Englischkenntnisse auf einem B1-B2 Niveau von Vorteil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine ausgeprägte Hands-on-Mentalität, lernst schnell und agierst stets lösungsorientiert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein echter Teamplayer mit Tatendrang und hoher Motivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz &lt;/strong&gt;mit tollen Kolleg*innen in Barleben (Magdeburg)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte &lt;/strong&gt;auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten &lt;/strong&gt;durch interne Trainings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote &lt;/strong&gt;bei Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt; durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;As a Data Engineer in Supply Chain Operations, you will take technical ownership of the end-to-end data lifecycle—spanning system architecture, pipeline design, production development, and continuous operations. You will build and scale high-throughput batch and real-time streaming data pipelines that harmonize data streams across menu planning, forecasting, procurement, fulfillment, and logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;In this role, you play a critical part in driving operational efficiency, cost optimization, and supply chain scalability by ensuring our global data infrastructure is performant, resilient, and mission-critical. Partnering closely with Data Scientists, Operations Analysts, and SCM stakeholders, you will model complex physical domain entities and engineer robust data assets that power real-time tracking, analytics, and automated decision-making across HelloFresh&#39;s operational business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain robust batch and streaming data pipelines connecting procurement systems, warehouse management systems (WMS), logistics, fulfillment, forecasting, and customer feedback data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;Develop real-time data integrations for tracking ingredient inventory levels, order assembly status, and carrier shipment tracking across distribution centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Scientists and Operations Analysts to operationalize demand forecasting models, track inventory accuracy, and monitor key business metrics like cost per box or fulfillment error rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;Ensure high data quality, freshness, and lineage tracking for operational dashboards, executive KPIs, and automated alertsWork with modern cloud data technologies such as AWS (S3, EMR, Glue), Databricks, Snowflake, Apache Spark/PySpark, Kafka, and Airflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,5,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional stakeholders in Procurement, Fulfillment Operations, Logistics, and Product to translate physical workflow requirements into robust data infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,6,0&quot;&gt;Contribute to a collaborative knowledge-sharing environment by providing technical guidance and coaching to team members and operational partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record of scientific or engineering work (Bachelor&#39;s, Master&#39;s, or PhD in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional experience as a Data Engineer delivering high-impact production pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;Fluency in Python, SQL, dbt, and PySpark for building scalable data pipelines on modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong data modeling expertise (dimensional modeling, relational architecture, event-driven streams) applied to physical supply chain or logistics operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with software engineering best practices, including Git, CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and cloud platforms like AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot;&gt;Expertise leveraging Generative AI tools (e.g., Claude, GitHub Copilot) to accelerate development, debugging, performance tuning, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6,0&quot;&gt;Exceptional communication skills to bridge technical implementation details with warehouse operators, logistics planners, and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#Engineering&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$104,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$119,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Supply Chain Data Engineering team powers the end-to-end operational backbone of HelloFresh across our global markets. Our core mission is to harmonize supply chain data to enable seamless, data-driven decision-making across enterprise domains - including menu planning, procurement, fulfillment, logistics. We build, scale, and maintain the foundational data assets that power critical operational processes and telemetry. Bringing together Data Engineers, Data Scientists, Operations Analysts, and Product Managers, our autonomous, cross-functional team transforms massive operational data streams into actionable intelligence to optimize forecasting, logistics, kitting, inventory, minimize food waste, and ensure the timely delivery of fresh ingredients to millions of customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Engineer in Supply Chain Operations, you will take technical ownership of the end-to-end data lifecycle—spanning system architecture, pipeline design, production development, and continuous operations. You will build and scale high-throughput batch and real-time streaming data pipelines that harmonize data streams across menu planning, forecasting, procurement, fulfillment and logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you play a critical part in driving operational efficiency, cost optimization, and supply chain scalability by ensuring our global data infrastructure is performant, resilient, and mission-critical. Partnering closely with Data Scientists, Operations Analysts, and SCM stakeholders, you will model complex physical domain entities and engineer robust data assets that power real-time tracking,&amp;nbsp; analytics, and automated decision-making across HelloFresh&#39;s operational business process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an integral part of a high-impact engineering team supporting global supply chain, procurement, and logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain robust batch and streaming data pipelines connecting procurement systems, warehouse management systems (WMS), and logistics networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model complex supply chain domains—including recipe component sourcing, inventory turnover, fulfillment batching, and route optimization—into clean, scalable analytical datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop real-time data integrations for tracking ingredient inventory levels, order assembly status, and carrier shipment tracking across distribution centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Scientists and Operations Analysts to operationalize demand forecasting models, waste reduction algorithms, and safety stock optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high data quality, freshness, and lineage tracking for operational dashboards, executive KPIs, and automated logistics alerts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with modern cloud data technologies such as AWS (S3, EMR, Glue, Redshift), Apache Spark/PySpark, Kafka, Airflow, Snowflake, and Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional stakeholders in Procurement, Fulfillment Operations, Logistics, and Product to turn physical workflow requirements into data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a collaborative and knowledge-sharing environment, providing technical guidance and coaching to team members and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record of scientific or engineering work &lt;/strong&gt;(Bachelor&#39;s, Master&#39;s, or PhD) in computer science, software engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of work experience as a Data Engineer,&lt;/strong&gt; including delivery of production data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in Python, SQL, and PySpark for building scalable ETL/ELT &lt;/strong&gt;data pipelines on a modern cloud data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data modeling expertise&lt;/strong&gt; (dimensional modeling, relational architecture, event-driven data streams) applied to physical supply chain or logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with software development &lt;/strong&gt;practices and tools such as Git, CI/CD, Docker, and AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication capabilities &lt;/strong&gt;to bridge technical implementation details with warehouse operators, logistics planners, and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take full ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have product sense &lt;/strong&gt;and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;attachment-container unknown&quot;&gt;#DATA&lt;/div&gt;
