&lt;h3&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Delivery Coordinator, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring the smooth and efficient execution of day-to-day home delivery operations across multiple Delivery Service Partners (DSPs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role involves managing a wide range of operational variables, from ensuring route coverage and delivery performance to maintaining service quality in line with our customer promise. You will use a variety of systems and tools, including live tracking, EPOD (Electronic Proof of Delivery) monitoring, and data analysis platforms, to identify trends, resolve issues, and continuously improve operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build strong relationships with DSPs, internal Logistics teams, and key stakeholders across the business, always keeping our customers at the heart of what we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone with a hands-on, problem-solving mindset, a genuine commitment to learning, and an egoless, collaborative approach—someone who can prioritise effectively and remain focused on long-term operational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee daily delivery operations, ensuring all routes are efficiently covered by DSPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor live delivery systems and proactively address operational challenges in real time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review EPOD images and performance data to ensure service quality consistently meets customer expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Escalate unresolved or critical issues to the relevant DSPs or internal management teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify recurring operational challenges, analyse root causes, and implement effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use data analysis tools such as Excel and SQL to identify trends, detect errors, and uncover opportunities for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and present regular performance reports, highlighting key insights and actionable recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain strong cost awareness when making operational decisions and implementing improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in home delivery operations, logistics, or a similar operational environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to manage day-to-day operations involving multiple variables and competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent organisational and time-management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in data analysis tools such as Excel and Google Sheets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a structured and data-driven approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to build and maintain effective relationships with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience in team management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
