&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Global Compensation Strategy &amp;amp; Engine Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategic vision for how HelloFresh categorizes customer errors and determines compensation across all markets, brands, and contact channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and continuous evolution of the compensation engine: along with Tech, you’ll define the the rules, thresholds, segmentation logic, and automation frameworks that govern recovery decisions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the principles that govern trade-offs between customer generosity and cost discipline and translate those principles into operational rules that hold across market complexity and brand variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology to ensure the compensation engine is scalable, auditable, and capable of supporting dynamic, AI-assisted decisioning as the product evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Behavioral Economics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the global roadmap for compensation experimentation: A/B testing across offer types, value levels, channel timing, and segmentation variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply behavioral economics frameworks to compensation design understanding how recovery offers shape long-term retention, repurchase behavior, and brand perception, not just immediate satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement framework for experimentation: what constitutes a successful test, what confidence warrants global rollout, and how results are synthesized into durable policy change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics &amp;amp; Insights to ensure test design, sample integrity, and rollout analysis meet a rigorous standard of evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Stewardship &amp;amp; Cost Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global compensation P&amp;amp;L line: tracking spend by market, error category, customer segment, and channel — and holding yourself accountable to defined cost-per-incident and avoidable-contact targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close financial leakage: cases where compensation is being issued without policy justification, at incorrect values, or at the wrong frequency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting infrastructure that makes compensation economics visible to GCX leadership, market GMs, and Finance — with the granularity and context needed to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the right balance between cost optimization and customer lifetime value investment: not just &#39;spend less&#39; but &#39;spend where it earns back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Policy &amp;amp; Global Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global fraud and abuse prevention framework: the policies, detection logic, thresholds, and escalation paths that protect the business without creating friction for genuine customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the governance rhythm for policy: quarterly reviews, market exception management, escalation adjudication, and framework versioning across a multi-brand, multi-market environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final authority on complex, cross-market policy gaps — resolving ambiguity with speed, consistency, and strategic clarity rather than routing decisions upward by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain global standards while creating principled space for market-level adaptation where local context genuinely requires it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the compensation function in senior forums translating customer economics into requirements that peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market GMs must respond to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold cross-functional partners accountable for the upstream data quality, operational accuracy, and system reliability that the compensation engine depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of policy changes across markets and brands, building communication and change management plans that make new frameworks land — not just launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence at VP and Director level across multiple functions; escalate only strategic blockers, not routine alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or equivalent postgraduate qualification required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Economics, Business, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12 years of progressive experience in customer strategy, pricing, operations, or a directly adjacent domain with meaningful exposure to global, multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of owning a financially significant operational lever and managing it with both analytical precision and strategic judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading and developing teams; comfort operating as a senior individual contributor and a people leader simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in subscription commerce, logistics, or consumer-facing operations strongly preferred. Familiarity with the economics of customer recovery in high-volume, low-margin environments is a distinct advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data analysis; able to build and pressure-test the analytical models that underpin policy decisions without delegating the logic to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with experimentation methodology: test design, statistical significance, holdout analysis, and the translation of results into policy not just reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or alongside engineering teams to define product and system requirements for rules-based or AI-assisted decisioning tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with financial modeling: building the business case for compensation investment, forecasting spend impact, and tracking actuals against plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior executive presence: able to walk into a GM, COO, or CFO conversation with a clear point of view, defend it under pressure, and leave with alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible voice with peers and upward stakeholders not because of title, but because of the quality of analysis and clarity of communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and decisive under ambiguity: able to make a defensible call with incomplete information and adjust as evidence develops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely collaborative across markets and functions able to hold people to standards without damaging the relationships needed to sustain them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Warsaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a new R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Poland and are looking for people who want to make a real impact from day one. You’ll be part of a globally connected team, helping to shape the culture and ways of working at our new location. This is a hands-on role in a supportive environment, where collaboration, learning, and adaptability are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value practical problem-solving, diverse perspectives, and people who take ownership. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to meaningful projects and help lay the foundation for a growing team, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is searching for an action-oriented servant leader&amp;nbsp; for our warehouse management system (WMS) Software Engineering and Product functions. This leader owns the full software delivery lifecycle for HelloFresh&#39;s global&amp;nbsp; warehouse fulfillment and inventory control domain — from architecture and product design through engineering execution, quality assurance, and operational reliability. You will drive a culture of product &amp;amp; engineering excellence, leveraging modern agentic tooling and AI-assisted workflows to increase team velocity, reduce defect escape rates, and accelerate deployment confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with stakeholders across technology, operations, automation/production technology, procurement, and finance to deliver innovative solutions on our strategic WMS platform — Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) — while balancing competing priorities and technical resource demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director of WMS Engineering and Product will&lt;/strong&gt; work with key technology and product leaders across HelloFresh to enable the inventory management and control domain strategy, evaluate technology-related priorities, and translate stakeholder needs into actionable roadmaps. The ideal candidate combines impeccable management and communication skills with a practitioner&#39;s instinct for modern software delivery — knowing how to build high-performing teams, establish engineering health metrics, and integrate AI-assisted tooling that meaningfully accelerates quality and velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WMS Solution Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction, development oversight, and performance accountability for HelloFresh&#39;s deployment of Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform across all global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Architecture &amp;amp; Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive WMS application layer Integration architecture to upstream tooling and host systems via CI/CD pipelines [Debezium/Kafka to Snowflake/Databricks]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner/ support as needed the Hosting Architecture team in the optimal sizing and performance of WMS Architecture in AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering &amp;amp; Developer Productivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and drive adoption of agentic engineering practices across the team: automated code review tooling (e.g., AI-assisted PR analysis, static analysis agents, LLM-powered code quality gates), AI-augmented test generation and execution, and intelligent deployment pipelines. Measure and report the impact of these practices on delivery velocity and defect escape rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Deployment Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the maturity roadmap for CI/CD pipelines. Establish automated deployment workflows with robust rollback strategies, feature flagging, environment-specific gate checks, and infrastructure-as-code practices — enabling high-confidence, low-friction releases across all WMS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering &amp;amp; Test Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with WMS Services and Support leadership to build a world-class QA function. Drive adoption of automated regression suites, AI-assisted edge case generation, and contract testing for integrations. Push teams beyond happy-path coverage toward comprehensive scenario validation, including automated performance and load testing for peak fulfillment periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Metrics &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish DORA metrics (deployment frequency, lead time for change, change failure rate, and mean time to restore) as the foundation of engineering health reporting for the WMS organization. Set baselines, publish improvement targets, and use metric trends to identify bottlenecks, prioritize tooling and process investments, and communicate engineering performance to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Roadmap &amp;amp; Architecture Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with peers and senior leadership on architectural decision-making for WMS platform evolution, integration patterns, and technology transitions. Champion the use of structured design reviews to maintain coherent, scalable technical direction. Lead evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including risk mitigation and transition planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Capacity Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with department leadership to source and partner with 3rd-party vendors to augment internal engineering capacity and expertise. Maintain vendor performance accountability and ensure structured knowledge transfer to build durable internal capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Coach, develop, and retain high-performing engineers, product managers, and team leads. Partner with HR and Talent Acquisition to build organizational depth — playing an active role in recruiting, onboarding, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Standardization/ Release Consolidation. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with departmental leadership, peer domains,&amp;nbsp; and executive leadership to own the long term roadmap for product consolidation to a single application release version administered globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;Serve on both the Fulfillment Technology and overall Automation &amp;amp; Technology leadership teams, reinforcing HelloFresh DNA values, establishing KPIs, and prioritizing strategic initiatives at a departmental level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Engineering Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of warehouse management system (WMS) software engineering and implementation experience with a tier-one WMS in an RF-based distribution, manufacturing, or e-commerce fulfillment environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of direct hands-on experience with Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform with SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing application integrations via microservices and associated toolsets, including REST APIs, event-driven architectures, and ETL pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience implementing or scaling CI/CD pipelines, including automated testing gates, deployment automation, and infrastructure-as-code (IaC) practices across multi-environment WMS or fulfillment technology stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with agentic and AI-assisted engineering tools — including automated code review platforms, AI-assisted test generation, and LLM-powered developer productivity tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, CodeRabbit, SonarQube AI, or equivalent) — with a track record of driving meaningful team-wide adoption and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and tracking engineering delivery and quality metrics (DORA metrics or equivalent) and using data to drive process improvement and leadership reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including developing and executing technology transition plans with appropriate risk mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a design and product process that scales a digital technology operations ecosystem across volume growth, multiple brands, and new digital properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to build and execute innovative digital product strategy while executing tactically against multiple competing priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate business requirements into technical specifications, roadmaps, and delivery plans — and to communicate progress and tradeoffs clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build leadership support for proactive technology investments, making the business case for engineering quality, automation, and platform modernization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh Group better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health - &lt;/strong&gt;You’re covered from your first day with&amp;nbsp; private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working - &lt;/strong&gt;We work in-office 3 days a week to align on goals, with flexible hours to support work-life balance and personal needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off - &lt;/strong&gt;You receive 26 days of paid vacation each year, providing you time to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development - &lt;/strong&gt;An annual Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and a Mentoring Program to support your ongoing professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Referral Program - &lt;/strong&gt;Our team members can take part in our internal employee referral program and receive a bonus for recommending successful candidates to open roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Comforts - &lt;/strong&gt;Free coffee, drinks, and fresh fruit are available to keep you refreshed throughout the day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations Data and Decisions Tribe at HelloFresh is responsible for driving operations planning by creating high quality, reusable data assets, data science models, and algorithmic solutions. Additionally, the tribe. This team has a direct impact on the customer experience and is constantly optimising for various Business KPIs. They build in-house products using modern technologies to handle a massive scale of transactions (&amp;gt;8.5 million active customers) and continuously improve the SDLC for fast flow and continuous delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director of Operations Planning Engineering, you will lead engineering teams (Data Science, Data Engineering, Software Engineering, &amp;amp; Analytics) and Staff Engineers across the mid-term planning domain, supporting their technical decision-making processes. Your responsibilities will include spearheading initiatives that traverse multiple teams and domains, such as those focused on network planning, demand planning, and production planning. Drawing upon your comprehensive understanding of the domain, you will own the planning architecture strategy and drive the long-term vision for how our planning systems should be integrated and scaled.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &lt;/strong&gt;an engineering squad comprising 10-15 engineers, managing Engineering Managers and Staff Engineers across Warsaw, Berlin, &amp;amp; USA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &lt;/strong&gt;the GenAI transformation — define and drive a concrete roadmap for becoming a genuinely AI-native engineering organisation: from AI-assisted development and automated incident response, to agentic workflows and LLM-powered tooling embedded in day-to-day operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &lt;/strong&gt;the availability and reliability of HelloFresh&#39;s planning infrastructure — drive SRE practices, incident management, SLOs/SLIs, and on-call maturity across high-throughput systems serving multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set technical direction across&lt;/strong&gt; Python, GoLang, PostgreSQL, Kafka, React, and React Native services on AWS, ensuring systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &lt;/strong&gt;with Product, Operations, Marketing, and Procurement providers to align engineering priorities with business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt;, coach, and develop Engineering Managers &amp;amp; Engineers — holding them accountable for team health, delivery, and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate &lt;/strong&gt;organisational change with maturity, keeping teams focused and motivated through evolving priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI proficiency and advocacy. &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on familiarity with AI technologies and a demonstrable track record of championing their adoption — whether through AI-assisted development workflows, LLM-powered tooling, or driving team-wide GenAI-native ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Technical Expertise. &lt;/strong&gt;Mastery of a broad range of technical skills relevant to Operations Planning — including planning systems, data science modeling, data engineering, database systems, distributed computing, and backend development frameworks. Hands-on familiarity with full stack application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Thinking. &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to understand complex systems holistically, recognising how components interact and impact each other, and leveraging this to design scalable, resilient solutions in a high-throughput environment where downtime means direct revenue loss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Leadership at Scale. &lt;/strong&gt;10+ years in software engineering with 4+ years managing Engineering Managers — not just individual contributors. Demonstrated ability to lead distributed teams across multiple offices, building trust and maintaining high engineering standards without daily co-location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence Mindset. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong grounding in SRE practices — SLOs/SLIs, incident management, on-call culture, and observability tooling (Grafana or similar). Experience owning payments infrastructure in regulated, multi-market environments is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration. &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional ability to work across engineering disciplines, Product, business stakeholders, and external service providers — fostering alignment towards common goals and translating business outcomes into engineering priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication Across Disciplines. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong ability to articulate complex technical concepts clearly to diverse audiences, from engineers to senior business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low ego, high ownership, and a bias toward clarity over complexity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy amazing discounts: 75% off weekly HelloFresh/Chefs Plate meal kits plus 50% off weekly Factor meal boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: Benefit from health and dental coverage from day one, a Health Spending Account, unlimited Headspace access, and 25% off GoodLife fitness memberships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive generous vacation and PTO offerings.&amp;nbsp;Benefit from a parental leave top-up program designed to support expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Grow with dedicated L&amp;amp;D initiatives and career support, aligning with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$184,300 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Rejoins une superstar de la foodtech française&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez HelloFresh, nous bousculons les habitudes alimentaires des français grâce à nos Box à cuisiner !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition ?&amp;nbsp; Révolutionner le quotidien de nos abonnés, en promouvant une façon plus durable de cuisiner et en leur faisant découvrir de délicieuses recettes, créatives et équilibrées. L’alliance parfaite entre technologie et gastronomie, pour un maximum de gourmandise.s&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh est présent dans plus de 15 pays. La France, un jeune marché lancé en 2019, connaît une ascension fulgurante : nous y sommes déjà leaders depuis 2021. Le moment parfait pour rejoindre notre équipe et avoir un impact fort dans l&#39;une des scale-ups françaises les plus prometteuses !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comment rendre tout cela possible ? Grâce à une équipe talentueuse et dynamique, des valeurs fortes de bienveillance et de diversité, et un environnement de travail stimulant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu souhaites prendre part à cette incroyable aventure humaine, internationale et entrepreneuriale, rejoins-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L&#39;opportunité:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh France place le produit au cœur de sa croissance, et ce rôle en est le moteur. En tant que Directeur(rice) Produit, vous piloterez une équipe pluridisciplinaire couvrant le culinaire, le développement recettes, l&#39;innovation produit et l&#39;analytique, avec la responsabilité pleine et entière de ce qui se retrouve au menu chaque semaine : les ingrédients que nous sélectionnons, les concepts que nous créons, et les arbitrages commerciaux qui les sous-tendent. Cela implique la gestion directe du budget coût des marchandises et la responsabilité de son impact sur le compte de résultat. C&#39;est un rôle concret et exigeant, à la croisée de l&#39;alimentaire, de la stratégie et des opérations, là où la qualité du produit est ce qui fidélise nos clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Construire et développer une équipe produit performante&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fédérer, inspirer et manager une équipe pluridisciplinaire — en posant une vision claire, en instaurant des rythmes de travail qui permettent d&#39;avancer vite, et en investissant dans les personnes qui porteront le prochain chapitre de HelloFresh France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Définir et challenger la vision produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire une vision claire et ambitieuse de ce que doit devenir notre produit physique — ancrée dans la connaissance client, rigoureuse sur le plan commercial, et suffisamment différenciante pour gagner. Développer un point de vue propre et indépendant, nourri des insights de l&#39;équipe Produit globale, mais enraciné dans la réalité du marché français.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir l&#39;accès aux informations, analyses et données nécessaires pour prendre des décisions éclairées en matière de développement produit, et traduire la vision en actions concrètes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pousser l&#39;équipe et l&#39;entreprise à aller au-delà de la feuille de route actuelle — en remettant en question les hypothèses, en interrogeant les arbitrages, et en s&#39;assurant que nous travaillons toujours sur ce qui a le plus d&#39;impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Piloter la rétention client et la performance commerciale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire de la rétention client votre boussole. Construire une vision rigoureuse et fondée sur les données de ce qui la détermine, et mobiliser l&#39;équipe autour des actions qui font vraiment la différence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prendre des décisions produit en ayant pleinement conscience de leurs implications financières. Prendre des risques calculés, mesurer les résultats honnêtement, et ajuster rapidement quand un pari ne fonctionne pas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes Opérations (Achats, Qualité, Production, etc.) pour assurer une approche coordonnée des initiatives produit, à l&#39;échelle locale comme globale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Aligner produit et stratégie marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler main dans la main avec l&#39;équipe brand &amp;amp; marketing pour que la feuille de route produit et la stratégie marketing soient pleinement synchronisées — ce que nous construisons, comment nous en parlons et comment nous le vendons doivent former une proposition cohérente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être la voix du produit au sein du comité de direction, en portant une vision convaincante de là où le produit doit aller et pourquoi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 8 à 10 ans minimum dans le Produit, la Stratégie ou un rôle de leadership commercial similaire, idéalement dans l&#39;alimentaire, le FMCG, les meal kits ou l&#39;abonnement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise avancée d&#39;Excel / Google Sheets et de PowerPoint / Google Slides ; curiosité et aisance avec l&#39;IA indispensables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership :&lt;/strong&gt; Au moins 3 ans de management d&#39;équipes pluridisciplinaires à différents niveaux de carrière — avec un vrai sens du coaching, une direction claire et l&#39;envie de faire grandir les gens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un(e) leader qui passe à l&#39;action.&lt;/strong&gt; Vous donnez le cap, vous emmenez votre équipe avec vous, et vous mettez la main à la pâte pour que ça se concrétise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orienté(e) client et rigoureux(se) dans l&#39;analyse.&lt;/strong&gt; À l&#39;aise pour interroger vos propres données et challenger vos hypothèses. Capable d&#39;aller dans le détail, de faire le lien avec la vision d&#39;ensemble, et de restituer les insights avec clarté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orienté(e) business.&lt;/strong&gt; Vous comprenez comment les décisions produit se répercutent sur les coûts et les revenus — et vous vous tenez responsable des résultats, pas seulement des réalisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fédérateur(rice) transversal(e).&lt;/strong&gt; Vous installez rapidement la confiance, faites avancer les choses par l&#39;influence, et savez inscrire les bonnes priorités dans les agendas des autres équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bon(ne) résolveur(se) de problèmes&lt;/strong&gt; — à l&#39;aise dans l&#39;ambiguïté, déterminé(e) à trouver des solutions, avec un réflexe naturel pour l&#39;action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent(e) communicant(e).&lt;/strong&gt; Vous écrivez et présentez avec clarté et conviction — que ce soit pour un narratif stratégique, une mise à jour pour le leadership ou un brief produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisé(e) et structuré(e)&lt;/strong&gt;, avec de solides compétences en gestion de projet et la capacité à tenir des délais serrés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionné(e) de food&lt;/strong&gt;, avec la capacité à transformer les tendances et les signaux marché en offres produit attractives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous t’offrons :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement dynamique et international, avec une culture d&#39;entreprise forte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une courbe d’apprentissage rapide garantie !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe française bienveillante, passionnée, proactive et dynamique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des bureaux au cœur de Paris, dans le 1er arrondissement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nos avantages : de délicieuses réductions sur nos Box HelloFresh, tickets restaurant Swile, réduction sur le transport, un accès privilégié à Gymlib&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Le déroulé du processus de recrutement :&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous examinons ton CV et ta lettre de motivation. Si c’est un match, nous t’invitons à une série d’entretiens et à réaliser un case study. Nous nous engageons à organiser rapidement les entretiens, afin de t’accueillir chez HelloFresh au plus vite !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tes débuts chez HelloFresh :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A ton arrivée, nous te concoctons des sessions d’onboarding qui te permettront de rencontrer chaque manager et de t’imprégner ainsi du fonctionnement de HelloFresh.&amp;nbsp;Tu auras aussi du temps pour faire plus ample connaissance avec ton équipe avant de plonger dans le vif de tes missions !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Primary Manager: &lt;/strong&gt;COO and Co-MD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Dotted Line: &lt;/strong&gt;CMO and Co-MD&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;~10 people spanning Culinary, Product Innovation, Product Strategy, Product Operations, and Product Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor is a healthy, ready-to-heat meal delivery service that has built a category-defining business in the US and Canada. Now we&#39;re building &lt;strong&gt;Factor in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; — and although we have strong blueprints from North America, we have the opportunity to leverage the very rich multi-cultural environment in Europe to tailor both our physical and digital products to five different markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Director, Product&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the full product vision and execution for Factor Europe. You will lead a multi-layered team of ~10 people, sit on the Factor Europe leadership team, and maintain a close dotted-line relationship with our CMO to ensure product and marketing move as one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare kind of role: senior strategic ownership and real infrastructure, with the pace and ambition of an early-stage scale up. If you are a visionary builder who leads with curiosity, earns conviction through data, and holds your team to the same high standard you hold yourself — we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Lead and Develop a High-Performance Product Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build, inspire, and manage a multi-disciplinary team — setting a clear vision, establishing the operating rhythms that allow the team to move fast, and investing in the people who will drive Factor Europe&#39;s next chapter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own and Challenge the Product Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Define a clear and compelling vision for what Factor&#39;s physical product must become in Europe — grounded in customer insight, commercially rigorous, and differentiated enough to win. Develop a deep, independent point of view on where the North American model translates and where European markets demand something different.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Push the team and the business to think beyond the current roadmap — challenging assumptions, interrogating trade-offs, and ensuring we are always working on the highest-leverage version of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as the liaison to our global Digital Product team — representing Factor Europe&#39;s priorities in the feature roadmap and collaborating on shared global initiatives that benefit the wider business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Drive Customer Retention and Commercial Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own customer retention levers as your north star. Build a rigorous, evidence-based view of what drives it and rally the team around interventions that move the needle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Make product decisions with full awareness of their P&amp;amp;L implications. Take calculated risks, track outcomes honestly, and move quickly to learn and adjust when bets don&#39;t pay off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Build for Multiple European Markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead our effort to find product-market fit across five distinct markets — understanding how consumer preferences vary by culture, and building a proposition that resonates locally while scaling efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Share learnings across geographies and partner with peers across the HelloFresh Group to continuously raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support new channel strategies, understanding and adapting products for different customer bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Align Product and Marketing Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work closely with the brand &amp;amp; marketing team to ensure product roadmap and marketing strategies are fully synchronised — so what we build, how we talk about it, and how we sell it form one coherent proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as the product voice on the leadership team, articulating a compelling vision for where the product needs to go and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;A visionary leader who executes. &lt;/strong&gt;You set a compelling direction, bring your team with you, and roll up your sleeves to make it happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Customer-obsessed and analytically rigorous. &lt;/strong&gt;Sharp instincts backed by disciplined discovery. Comfortable querying your own data and stress-testing assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded. &lt;/strong&gt;You understand how product decisions flow through to the P&amp;amp;L — and hold yourself accountable to outcomes, not just outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;A cross-functional influencer. &lt;/strong&gt;You build trust quickly, drive execution through others, and get the right priorities onto other teams&#39; roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Internationally curious. &lt;/strong&gt;You find the complexity of building for multiple European cultures energising, and you seek out the nuances that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;An exceptional communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You write and present with clarity and conviction — from strategy narratives to leadership updates to product briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Food and/or nutrition obsessed!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8–10+ years in Product, Strategy, or a closely related commercial leadership role; 3+ years managing multi-disciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Technical toolkit: &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced Excel/Google Sheets; AI proficiency and curiosity required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Strong preference for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in D2C subscription businesses — retention, lifecycle, and recurring revenue models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Multi-market European experience and an understanding of how consumer preferences vary across the continent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in physical products or FMCG, especially food &amp;amp; beverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A track record of scaling a product in a new market and finding product-market fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2025 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 10% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2025.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work flexibly with our hybrid setup (50% office, 50% remote), plus a €2.40 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees can work from another country for up to 8 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset: participate in Pantry Staple trainings, access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly &lt;em&gt;vrij-mi-bo&lt;/em&gt; (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group reaches more than 6 million customers across 16 markets through a portfolio of 8 consumer brands — from meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to pet food and specialty products. HelloTech, our global technology division, builds the digital consumer experience across Berlin, Warsaw, and North America: the apps, the personalization, the discovery moments, and everything in between that turns food into something people genuinely look forward to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design is core to how we compete. Our Consumer UX team designs end-to-end experiences across all 8 brands, and we hold a high quality bar — internally, our “zest-appeal” framework defines design excellence from baseline usability through to best-in-class, surprise-and-delight craft. We are also moving fast to an AI-native way of working, where AI rethinks discovery, prototyping, and the path from design to code. Experience quality and innovation are leadership priorities all the way to the group president.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This year we are doubling down on craft, execution, and design leadership. In a world where it is easier than ever to get software to 75% built, it is the last 25% — the polish, the motion, the detail customers actually feel — that decides whether a consumer experience is merely useful or genuinely loved. Millions of people open our apps every week to feed themselves and their families; the final 10% is the difference between a transaction and a habit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a build-and-scale role, not a maintenance one. We are hiring a design leader to own a consumer experience domain within the Consumer mega alliance, raise the quality bar across it, grow a high-performing team, and build the design-technology and AI-native capability that turns ambitious ideas into beautifully executed, shipped products. We need a maker and a leader who leads through the work — not a strategy-only or people-management-only role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The level — Director or Senior Director — will be set by the candidate’s experience and the final scope of the domain. We are open to both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead from the front. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, coach, and inspire a multidisciplinary team — UX, UI, content, and localization — across multiple consumer surfaces. Stay hands-on in the work: review designs, jump into critiques, and drive clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ambiguity into clarity. &lt;/strong&gt;Solve problems from first principles, not templates. Help your team make hard decisions, focus on outcomes over process, and install just the right amount of structure and rigour to ship great work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and uphold an extremely high craft bar. &lt;/strong&gt;From UX flow to polished UI — layout, typography, motion, micro-interaction, and visual storytelling. Be the design-quality amplifier who notices the details others miss and pushes work to where it needs to be, coaching the team to our quality tenets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a consumer experience domain end-to-end. &lt;/strong&gt;Take accountability for the quality and delivery of experiences across the customer journey, from problem framing to shipped product across our brands and 16 markets. Drive design excellence through every detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build design-technology capability. &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and scale our design system (Zest) and modern UI foundations. Close the gap between design and engineering through prototyping, design-to-code workflows, and component quality — making design and engineering faster together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make us AI-native. &lt;/strong&gt;Treat AI as an active part of how design gets done — accelerating discovery, generating and validating prototypes, and shortening design-to-delivery. Define the quality bar AI-assisted workflows must meet, and help the company rewrite how consumer products get built in the AI era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Product and Engineering. &lt;/strong&gt;Align on priorities, make tradeoffs, unblock delivery, and move fast. Advocate clearly and persistently for the right experience, and raise the ambition of the partners around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of leading and growing high-performing design teams in product-first, consumer (B2C) companies — hiring, coaching, and developing designers at all levels, from IC to managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency. &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in ambiguous, fast-changing environments, push for the right solution rather than the convenient one, and lean in to make things happen without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bias to ship. &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated success driving teams to ship great software at scale, not just making decks about it — owning execution across a product line and a portfolio of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional craft and product taste. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong visual and interaction sensibility and a high personal bar for detail. You know what great looks like for a consumer audience, and you can help teams get there — across hierarchy, motion, and micro-interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design-technologist mindset. &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency at the design–engineering boundary: design systems, component architecture, prototyping in code or advanced tools, and a practical grasp of front-end constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native practice. &lt;/strong&gt;You already use AI across the design workflow — for insight synthesis, rapid prototyping, and design-to-code — and have a point of view on scaling it responsibly with a high quality bar. Fluency with tools like Figma, Claude, and similar is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and systems thinking. &lt;/strong&gt;Experience designing and maintaining quality across a multi-brand or multi-market consumer ecosystem, balancing consistency with brand-specific character.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently delivers high-quality consumer product work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hired exceptional talent and helped your existing team grow in craft and execution maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience quality in your domain is visibly higher — the last 10% is sweated, and it shows in what customers feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and engineering leaders love partnering with you because you unlock progress and raise the ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design systems and AI-native workflows in your domain make the whole team faster without sacrificing craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a key player in shaping how HelloFresh builds consumer product in the AI era — writing new playbooks, not following old ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and impact. &lt;/strong&gt;Shape experiences for 6+ million customers across 8 brands and 16 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A craft-and-AI-first culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Leadership that champions experience quality, innovation, and AI-native ways of working from the top of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership. &lt;/strong&gt;End-to-end accountability for your domain, with the autonomy to set and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth. &lt;/strong&gt;A defined leadership track and the chance to expand scope as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with experienced product, engineering, and design partners across HelloTech’s international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of UX, Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Toronto or New York&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;UX, Growth Mega-Alliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level: &lt;/strong&gt;Director (people leadership). For the right person there&#39;s a clear path to Senior Director as the alliance scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Global VP of UX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: to change the way people eat, forever. We&#39;re the world&#39;s leading meal-kit provider and a global digital-native FMCG company, reaching more than 6 million customers across 16 markets through a portfolio of brands, from HelloFresh and Factor to Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, YouFoodz, Good Chop, and The Pets Table. HelloTech, our global technology division, builds the digital consumer experience across Berlin, Warsaw, and North America. Experience quality and innovation are leadership priorities all the way to the group president.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director of UX to lead the Growth experience end to end, across the brands in our portfolio, with HelloFresh and Factor the biggest. This is the team that owns how people discover our brands, sign up, get to their first great box, and keep coming back. Most funnels are something people endure. We want ours to be something they remember. Your job is to turn each step into a moment worth having, so the journey feels effortless, true to each brand, and sticky enough that people want to stay, and to grow the business while you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report directly to the Global VP of UX and lead a team of 6 UX designers and collaborate closely with content design and research strategy. You set the quality bar for the alliance and work shoulder to shoulder with Growth product, marketing, lifecycle/CRM, and engineering across web and app, and across 16 markets. You care about the numbers and the experience, and you know the best growth work improves both at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role, and a build-and-scale one rather than a maintenance one. You are exceptional at craft and stay close enough to the work to lead with credibility. You&#39;re also a visionary: you bring our brands to life and express them clearly across every touchpoint, and you have a strong feel for content and how words shape an experience. You&#39;re happy in ambiguity, and you&#39;d rather write the playbook than follow one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A funnel worth remembering. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead the experience across the full customer journey: acquisition and activation, conversion, retention, and reactivation of lapsed customers. You do more than reduce drop-off and smooth out onboarding. You make each step sticky and memorable, so people feel something at sign-up, come back because they want to, and tell a friend. You give lapsed customers a real reason to return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and evidence. &lt;/strong&gt;You run a team that tests its way to the answer. You treat behavioral data as a primary design input, not just something to validate a decision after the fact. You set clear hypotheses, design experiments and A/B tests with statistical rigor alongside data science, read the results honestly, and balance quick wins with the changes that compound over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy before screens. &lt;/strong&gt;You decide which problems are worth solving and why, and you tie design choices to the business outcomes this role is measured on, like conversion, activation rate, and retention [confirm the exact KPIs for this role]. You set direction before design work begins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft and quality. &lt;/strong&gt;You define what excellent looks like for Growth and hold the bar. You set a high standard for craft yourself and raise it in others, and you build and evolve the systems and patterns that let the team ship consistent, high-quality work at speed across web and app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand expression. &lt;/strong&gt;You bring our portfolio of brands to life, from HelloFresh and Factor to the rest, and give each a clear, distinct voice and look in the experience. You know how to hold what makes a brand itself while keeping the funnel coherent across all of them. You have a strong understanding of content and how design and words work together to express who each brand is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make us AI-native. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead a team that treats AI as an active part of how the work gets done, from insight synthesis to rapid prototyping to the path from design to code. You define the quality bar AI-assisted work has to meet, and you help rewrite how growth experiences get built in the AI era. You are a driving force in this transformation, not a passenger, and you help your team see the shift as opportunity rather than threat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team of generalists. &lt;/strong&gt;You lead a team of UX Designers with a generalist profile that move across design, content, research and code. You attract, develop, and retain strong talent, coach through feedback and influence rather than authority, and build a place where people do the best work of their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in product design, including experience leading and growing teams in a consumer (B2C) or product-led environment with a track record of moving metrics like activation, conversion, retention, and reactivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional craft. You are a top-tier designer who sets and holds a high bar, and you stay hands-on enough to lead with credibility and a&amp;nbsp; visionary eye for the brand. You can bring distinct brands to life and express them clearly and consistently across an experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency. You push for the right solution over the convenient one and make things happen without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native practice. You already use AI across the design workflow, for insight synthesis, rapid prototyping, and design to code, and you have a clear point of view on scaling it responsibly at a high quality bar. Fluency with tools like Figma and Claude is expected, and you can show your team what excellent AI-assisted work looks like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data fluency. You read behavioral data and experiment results well, know what they are and aren&#39;t telling you, and use them to sharpen design, not just defend it. You&#39;re comfortable partnering with data science on experimentation quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Command of experimentation: hypothesis design, A/B testing, and funnel analysis as a connected system rather than isolated moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A partnership mindset with Growth product, marketing, lifecycle/CRM, and engineering. You navigate constraints with engineers and shape research and synthesis with researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People leadership experience: building teams, coaching designers, and setting a quality bar others rally around.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping cross-channel communication strategy across app, email, push, and web, so the message a customer gets is consistent and well-timed wherever they meet us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with pricing, packaging, or monetization design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record building 0-to-1 growth systems, or fixing broken acquisition and retention loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently ships high-quality growth work at speed, and the metrics move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve hired exceptional talent and helped your existing team grow in craft and judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience quality across the funnel is visibly higher, and customers feel it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and engineering leaders love partnering with you because you unlock progress and raise the ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native ways of working in your domain make the whole team faster without giving up craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each brand feels distinctly itself in the experience, while the funnel stays coherent across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and impact. Shape experiences for millions of customers across our brands and 16 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A craft-and-AI-first culture, championed from the top of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership of your domain, with the autonomy to set and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined leadership track and the chance to grow your scope as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global collaboration with experienced product, engineering, and design partners across HelloTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy amazing discounts: 75% off weekly HelloFresh/Chefs Plate meal kits plus 50% off weekly Factor meal boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from health and dental coverage from day one, a Health Spending Account, unlimited Headspace access, and 25% off GoodLife fitness memberships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access wellness resources including fitness discounts and mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive generous vacation and PTO offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a parental leave top-up program designed to support expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with dedicated L&amp;amp;D initiatives and career support, aligning with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re moving UX to work AI-native, and we expect our leaders to help drive that shift. You&#39;ll report directly to the Global VP of UX and partner closely with Product and Engineering leaders in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that sharing a meal brings people of all identities, backgrounds, and cultures together, and we&#39;re committed to celebrating every dimension of diversity in the workplace. We&#39;re an equal-opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, national origin, color, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, marital status, or any other protected characteristic. We provide reasonable accommodations to candidates at any stage of the process. If you need one, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that for this position employees are eligible to equity on top of the base pay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,850 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Manufacturing Value Stream&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Value Stream As a Director on the Global Value Stream team, you will &lt;em&gt;lead &lt;/em&gt;our Manufacturing value stream within HelloFresh&#39;s global supply chain, shaping the strategy and execution model for how we standardize, improve, and scale our operations worldwide. You will lead a team, set the department&#39;s operational agenda, and serve as a senior voice of operations across the organization. This is a high-impact leadership role that sits at the intersection of operations, technology, and global strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the strategic direction for the portfolio of Manufacturing processes, owning the multi-year capability roadmap and global template.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and build a high-performing, accountable department with clear OKRs aligned to company strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the governance framework and operating model for how the Global Value Stream team designs, validates, and deploys process and technology standards internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner at the executive level with Operations, Product, Engineering, and others to align on global priorities, technology investments, and performance benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the final decision authority on process deviation requests, capability exceptions, and cross-market design trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the organization&#39;s approach to continuous improvement, value stream analysis, and waste elimination at scale — setting the standard for how the company approaches process maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team functions as an effective internal consultancy — providing rigorous expert support to regional operations, quality teams, and technology partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15+ years of progressive experience in supply chain, operations, or manufacturing — including significant senior leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading multi-functional teams across multiple geographies, with full accountability for operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across multiple supply chain functional domains, with a breadth of experience that enables credible leadership across the full Value Stream portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and experience managing department budgets and delivering measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with global process standardization, operational technology ecosystems (WMS/WES/WCS/automation), and large-scale transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing senior talent and building high-performance organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating as a senior stakeholder in cross-functional governance and product/technology lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 25%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bold, strategic leader with the operational depth to earn the trust of both warehouse teams and the C-suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity at the department level while maintaining clarity and pace for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A talent multiplier — known for developing strong leaders and creating organizations that outlast any individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rigorous, data-driven decision maker who moves fast without sacrificing quality or thoroughness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about building world-class operations at scale — energized by the complexity and impact of a global mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An outstanding communicator and influencer who can drive alignment across diverse cultures, functions, and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additionally With This Role, You will have....&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape global operations at a leading food technology company with significant reach and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-ownership, low-bureaucracy environment where your work is visible and your decisions matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements to support your work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous development through HelloFresh Academies and access to internal mobility across 18 countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An egoless, collaborative culture focused on learning, growth, and building something exceptional together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CO POSTINGS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our company is committed to fair hiring practices and complies with all applicable laws, including the Colorado Job Application Fairness Act (JAFA). In accordance with JAFA, we will not request your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution on your initial application for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;When submitting supporting documents such as a resume, curriculum vitae (CV), or educational transcripts, you may voluntarily redact or omit any information that would identify your age. This includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of birth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of attendance at educational institutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of graduation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Texas Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$199,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$174,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$179,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is searching for an action-oriented servant leader&amp;nbsp; for our warehouse management system (WMS) Product Design and Software Engineering functions. This leader owns the full software delivery lifecycle for HelloFresh&#39;s global&amp;nbsp; warehouse fulfillment and inventory control domain — from architecture and product design through engineering execution, quality assurance, and operational reliability. You will drive a culture of product &amp;amp; engineering excellence, leveraging modern agentic tooling and AI-assisted workflows to increase team velocity, reduce defect escape rates, and accelerate deployment confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with stakeholders across operations, automation/production technology, procurement, and finance to deliver innovative solutions on our strategic WMS platform — Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) — while balancing competing priorities and technical resource demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This location-flexible position can be physically based in any of our North America corporate offices or fulfillment centers with a hybrid working model, but must be flexible with work hour scheduling as teams and solutions are dispersed globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of WMS Product Design and Software Engineering will work with key technology and product leaders across HelloFresh to enable the inventory management and control domain strategy, evaluate technology-related priorities, and translate stakeholder needs into actionable roadmaps. The ideal candidate combines impeccable management and communication skills with a practitioner&#39;s instinct for modern software delivery — knowing how to build high-performing teams, establish engineering health metrics, and integrate AI-assisted tooling that meaningfully accelerates quality and velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WMS Solution Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction, development oversight, and performance accountability for HelloFresh&#39;s deployment of Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform across all global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Architecture &amp;amp; Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;Own WMS layer Integrations to host systems and CDC pipelines (Debezium/kafka) to Snowflake/Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner/ support as needed the Hosting Architecture team in the optimal sizing and performance of WMS Architecture in AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering &amp;amp; Developer Productivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and drive adoption of agentic engineering practices across the team: automated code review tooling (e.g., AI-assisted PR analysis, static analysis agents, LLM-powered code quality gates), AI-augmented test generation and execution, and intelligent deployment pipelines. Measure and report the impact of these practices on delivery velocity and defect escape rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Deployment Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the maturity roadmap for CI/CD pipelines. Establish automated deployment workflows with robust rollback strategies, feature flagging, environment-specific gate checks, and infrastructure-as-code practices — enabling high-confidence, low-friction releases across all WMS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering &amp;amp; Test Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with WMS Services and Support leadership to build a world-class QA function. Drive adoption of automated regression suites, AI-assisted edge case generation, and contract testing for integrations. Push teams beyond happy-path coverage toward comprehensive scenario validation, including automated performance and load testing for peak fulfillment periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Metrics &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish DORA metrics (deployment frequency, lead time for change, change failure rate, and mean time to restore) as the foundation of engineering health reporting for the WMS organization. Set baselines, publish improvement targets, and use metric trends to identify bottlenecks, prioritize tooling and process investments, and communicate engineering performance to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Roadmap &amp;amp; Architecture Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with peers and senior leadership on architectural decision-making for WMS platform evolution, integration patterns, and technology transitions. Champion the use of structured design reviews to maintain coherent, scalable technical direction. Lead evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including risk mitigation and transition planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Capacity Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with department leadership to source and partner with 3rd-party vendors to augment internal engineering capacity and expertise. Maintain vendor performance accountability and ensure structured knowledge transfer to build durable internal capability&lt;/li&gt;
