&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in maintaining the integrity, synchronization, and archiving of all technical construction documentation, project registers, and real estate lease records across HelloFresh&#39;s international portfolio, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-869&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Synchronize External Platforms &amp;amp; Internal Folders:&lt;/strong&gt; Routinely download, mirror, and organize current drawings, specs, and permits from external CDE platforms (e.g., DALUX, AutoDesk Construction Cloud, PlanRadar, OpenSpace, ProStream) into HelloFresh’s internal Google Drive / SharePoint structures using strict version control and naming conventions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-870&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage Internal Archiving &amp;amp; Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain live project folders, track document revisions, archive superseded files, and execute thorough end-of-project file audits (as-builts, permits, test certificates, handover packs) to ensure full deliverable compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-871&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enforce Quality &amp;amp; Flag Discrepancies:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and manage comprehensive document registers and transmittal logs, proactively identifying and escalating missing, outdated, or inconsistent documentation to Project Managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-872&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support Lease Management Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist with data entry and lease abstracting in systems such as VisualLease and AssetWize, extracting key dates, rent terms, and costs, ensuring records remain accurate through lease renewals and amendments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-873&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide General PMO &amp;amp; Administrative Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support project management operations by maintaining action logs, drafting meeting minutes, and preparing status reports and presentations for the international Property Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-874&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; External Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain clear, professional communication with internal stakeholders (Legal, Finance, PMs) as well as external general contractors, architects, and landlords across European and international markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-875&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven Document Control Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior background handling document registers, revision tracking, and structural archiving, ideally within construction, real estate development, architectural, or facilities management environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-876&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;CDE &amp;amp; Cloud Platform Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on exposure to Common Data Environments (e.g., DALUX, AutoDesk Construction Cloud, PlanRadar, OpenSpace) along with strong competence in Google Workspace (Drive, Sheets, Docs) and Microsoft Office 365&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_b701cf092b1d8578-877&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Meticulous Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional accuracy and thoroughness in data entry, file organization, auditing deliverables, and identifying document inconsistencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
