&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance Manager in Moss&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own maintenance and facility operations for our production site, ensuring high technical availability of equipment, facilities, and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, site-focused role&lt;/strong&gt; where you’ll work closely with Operations, technical partners, and external contractors to improve equipment reliability, coordinate preventive maintenance, solve technical challenges, and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have real ownership of the site while also contributing to technical projects and longer-term improvements. We’re looking for someone with a strong maintenance or technical background who enjoys being close to operations and is ready to take broader responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own maintenance and facility operations for the Moss site, ensuring equipment reliability and operational continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and coordinate preventive maintenance activities, maintenance schedules, and technical priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor KPIs across safety, quality, cost, productivity, and machinery availability and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the maintenance and facility budget, ensuring effective cost control and resource planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate technical projects, including equipment installations, commissioning, and site improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external contractors and suppliers, ensuring work is delivered safely, on time, and to agreed standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Operations to troubleshoot technical issues, reduce downtime, and improve equipment performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with Occupational Health &amp;amp; Safety, fire safety, HACCP, and internal quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage MRO spare parts, consumables, and tools required to maintain asset performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for maintenance and facility topics at the Moss site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience in &lt;strong&gt;maintenance, engineering, or technical operations&lt;/strong&gt; within production, manufacturing, FMCG, automated logistics, or a similar industrial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of preventive maintenance, technical troubleshooting, and equipment reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hands-on approach&lt;/strong&gt; and confidence working close to day-to-day site operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or coordinating technicians, contractors, suppliers, or technical service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing budgets, costs, and supplier agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with health &amp;amp; safety, compliance standards, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a practical, data-driven approach to decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating with both local and international stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to take real ownership of maintenance and facilities at our Moss production site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role where your work has a direct impact on day-to-day operations and equipment reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;95&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;The opportunity to contribute to and influence one of Europe’s fastest-growing technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;239&quot;&gt;Employee discounts on HelloFresh boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;282&quot;&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;285&quot; data-end=&quot;328&quot;&gt;Access to digital mental health resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;Apply with your CV (in English, please).&amp;nbsp; If we see a match, you’ll have a call with one of our recruiters to share more about what you can bring to the team.&amp;nbsp; If both sides are still positive, we’ll proceed to the assessment stage to evaluate key skills required for the role. We will conduct interviews on an ongoing basis and close the position once a successful candidate has been found.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Factor_, a HelloFresh brand, is looking for you as an Operational Excellence Lead (m/f/d). As Operational Excellence Lead, you will lead the OpEx team at our food production site and drive the continuous improvement of our production and business processes. With a strong focus on efficiency, quality, and sustainability, you’ll apply Lean and WCM methodologies to deliver measurable improvements — both strategically and operationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive impactful Operational Excellence initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across the site, identifying opportunities to improve efficiency, quality, productivity, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional improvement projects from idea to implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, using Lean Six Sigma and structured problem-solving to deliver sustainable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with teams across Production, Quality, Engineering, and Supply Chain&lt;/strong&gt; to challenge existing processes, develop solutions, and turn improvement opportunities into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use data and operational insights to identify root causes, track performance, and make improvement opportunities visible&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting fact-based decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted Operational Excellence expert and sparring partner&lt;/strong&gt; for operational teams and senior stakeholders, bringing new ideas and best practices to the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and scale a culture of continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; by facilitating workshops, sharing knowledge, and enabling teams to solve problems effectively and sustainably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and shape your improvement agenda&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing strategic projects with emerging opportunities in a dynamic, fast-paced production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree in Engineering, Operations Management, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Operational Excellence, Continuous Improvement, Process Engineering, or a similar role, ideally within a manufacturing or food production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience driving cross-functional improvement projects and turning ideas into sustainable, measurable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Lean Six Sigma methodologies and structured problem-solving; Green Belt certification is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and drive change across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English, with a proactive, hands-on mindset and a passion for continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development: Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: Discounts on Factor_-boxes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Benefits: We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
