&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;4951 - 110 Avenue SE, Calgary, Alberta&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule: &lt;/strong&gt;This position will provide a schedule covering 12pm to 8:30pm, Monday to Friday. Subject to change based on operational and business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance Supervisor who will take a hands-on approach to the maintenance and continuous improvement of our food safety management system. Reporting to the FSQA Manager, you will supervise a high-functioning team of FSQA Technicians, providing them guidance and acting as a key decision maker when food safety issues arise.. As part of the Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance team, you will play a key role in ensuring our customers receive high quality and safe meal kits they feel excited about serving to their families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assign and monitor food safety related programs, including but not limited to pre-op inspections, environmental monitoring, pest control and GMP monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform trend analysis on monitoring data; utilize results to drive improvements and close gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct root cause analysis and implement corrective action plans for product and process non-conformances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Quality &amp;amp; Technical Team on product and packaging testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for HACCP reassessment and new process development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage FSQA-related on-boarding, ad hoc and annual re-training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with internal, CFIA and third-party audits and inspection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as primary escalation point and back-up to FSQA Manager in their absence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage team scheduling, attend team meetings, assist in complaint investigations and other tasks as assigned by the FSQA Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a food safety or quality assurance role in the food or other regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of supervisory experience is considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-secondary education in Biological, Chemical or Food Sciences or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of HACCP principles, the Safe Food for Canadians Regulations and GFSI schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and time management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with MS Office, Google Apps and comfortable learning and using new technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a deadline-driven and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible with working hours for business requirements, including early morning and late-night shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
