&lt;h2&gt;Gestalte den neuen Factor_-Standort in Verden mit.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_, eine Marke von HelloFresh, sucht dich als Gebäudetechniker (all genders)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Unser neuer Produktionsstandort in &lt;strong&gt;Verden&lt;/strong&gt; ist erst seit diesem Frühjahr in Betrieb – und genau jetzt ist der richtige Zeitpunkt, Teil unserer Erfolgsgeschichte zu werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Gemeinsam sorgen wir dafür, dass unsere frischen Factor_-Mahlzeiten jeden Tag zuverlässig produziert werden. Dafür suchen wir Menschen, die gerne anpacken, technische Herausforderungen mögen und Verantwortung übernehmen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Bei uns erwartet dich kein eintöniger Arbeitsalltag. Du arbeitest an modernen Produktionsanlagen, Fördertechnik und Gebäudetechnik und bist Teil eines kleinen, eingespielten Team, das den Standort aktiv weiterentwickelt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wartung, Reparatur und Instandhaltung unserer Produktionsanlagen und technischen Einrichtungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fehler analysieren und Störungen schnell und nachhaltig beheben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produktionsanlagen, Fördertechnik sowie Gebäudetechnik betreuen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit externen Dienstleistern und Handwerksfirmen zusammenarbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wartungsarbeiten dokumentieren und Verbesserungen im technischen Bereich einbringen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gemeinsam mit dem Team für eine sichere und zuverlässige Produktion sorgen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine abgeschlossene technische oder handwerkliche Ausbildung, z. B. als Elektroniker, Mechatroniker, Industriemechaniker oder vergleichbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude daran, praktisch zu arbeiten und technische Probleme zu lösen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (mindestens B2)&lt;/strong&gt;, da die Kommunikation mit externen Dienstleistern und Handwerksfirmen Teil des Arbeitsalltags ist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft zur Arbeit im Schichtsystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Englischkenntnisse sind von Vorteil, aber keine Voraussetzung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Interne Schulungen und ein jährliches Budget für deine persönliche und berufliche Weiterbildung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_-Boxen:&lt;/strong&gt; Exklusive Mitarbeiterrabatte auf unsere leckeren Factor_-Mahlzeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt; Wettbewerbsfähiges Gehalt sowie 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage pro Jahr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&lt;/strong&gt; Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen – bald ergänzt durch attraktive Fitnessangebote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zukunft &amp;amp; Flexibilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir arbeiten kontinuierlich daran, unser Benefit-Portfolio zu erweitern – u. a. mit Mobilitätsunterstützung und betrieblicher Altersvorsorge, um dir noch mehr Sicherheit und Flexibilität zu bieten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#basecampwarehouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join one of France’s fastest-growing foodtech scale-ups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re transforming the way people cook and eat. Through our meal-kit boxes, we help thousands of customers cook delicious, balanced meals at home while reducing food waste and simplifying everyday life.&amp;nbsp;Operating in 15+ countries, HelloFresh is one of the world’s leading foodtech companies. The French market, launched in 2020, has experienced hyper growth and became market leader in 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Behind this growth is a simple formula: technology, data, and a team of ambitious people working together to reinvent food at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of data, strategy, and growth, and have a tangible impact on a fast-scaling business, this internship is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Strategy Data Analyst Intern, you will join the Analytics &amp;amp; Performance team and work closely with the Growth Marketing team to help drive HelloFresh’s growth in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a data partner to business stakeholders, turning complex data into actionable insights that influence key strategic decisions, marketing investment decisions, and customer lifecycle optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly impact critical growth levers such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, and website optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines business analysis, experimentation, and data modeling, giving you end-to-end exposure to how data drives decisions in a growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who want to apply rigorous analytics to real business problems and see their insights translated into concrete growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with modern analytics tools including SQL, Tableau, and Google Sheets, as well as internal data pipelines to analyze large-scale datasets and support data-driven decision-making across the Growth team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive business-impacting analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on key growth topics such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, discount optimization, and marketing channel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, marketing efficiency, and customer lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations for business stakeholders&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Growth Marketing managers and team leads to support strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations that influence budget allocation and growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support experimentation and A/B testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and growth experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of new initiatives and help scale successful strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data products and dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that enable the marketing team to make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, reporting pipelines, and analysis frameworks that help teams scale their decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone curious, analytical, and eager to tackle complex business problems using data.&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable navigating large datasets, structuring ambiguous questions, and translating analyses into insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and ability to structure complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets, and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate data into clear and actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gap-year or final-year student from a top engineering or business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in data, consulting, strategy, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve in one of Europe’s fastest-growing scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to real business decisions driven by data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on HelloFresh boxes, Swile meal vouchers, and Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in the heart of Paris (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invitation to Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with your future managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first days will include dedicated onboarding sessions with key managers across teams to help you understand HelloFresh’s organization and business model.&amp;nbsp;You’ll then quickly dive into your projects and start contributing to the team’s impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh Group, we are on a mission to revolutionize the way people &lt;em&gt;and pets &lt;/em&gt;eat. The Pets Table is passionate about providing every dog—the long-haired, the short-legged, and the spotted alike—a seat at the table, with healthy recipes developed with vets and made from wholesome ingredients that humans trust. We’re incubated within the HelloFresh Group, which provides us the agility of a startup with the resources and support of a global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic and hands-on Associate Director, Growth Marketing to own our acquisition engine end to end. Reporting to the CMO, it’s a unique opportunity to be a key part of one of the fastest growing pet brands while getting the infrastructure and support of HelloFresh Group (a leader in human food commerce).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the bottoms-up marketing budget and plan, steer spend across a diversified channel portfolio, and be directly accountable for growth outcomes (ROI, CAC, Acquisition volume, etc.). You’ll manage a small team as well as external agencies and partners, and work cross-functionally to make sure our growth strategy is aligned with the broader business. If you’re a builder who’s equally comfortable steering a budget model and getting into the weeds of a campaign, this is the perfect role for you.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a large DTC marketing budget and steer spend allocation across channels to hit growth and efficiency targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for core growth outcomes (ROI, CAC, and conversion volume) across key acquisition channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit across and manage strategy and execution for a diversified mix of channels including paid social, search, display, affiliate, influencer, direct mail, CTV and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relationships with external vendors, agencies, freelancers, affiliates, setting expectations and holding partners accountable for performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, test, and scale new/emerging channels and growth opportunities to diversify acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run tests across creative, discounts, and landing pages — clearly documenting results and building business cases that quantify impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Creative, Tech, Analytics, and CRM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting that tracks performance against targets, surfacing key trends and strategic opportunities to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present performance, plans, and recommendations to senior leadership on a regular cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jump in hands-on where needed, whether that’s digging into a performance anomaly, onboarding a new vendor, creating Meta ads yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate: &lt;/strong&gt;you get excited by driving growth and scaling up brands (and you love pets!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Marketing Generalist: &lt;/strong&gt;you know what works and what doesn’t. You’ve scaled brands’ budgets and know how to structure ad accounts to achieve profitable growth. You’ve managed 3 or more paid marketing channels with profitable unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Paid Social Wizard: &lt;/strong&gt;You live and breathe Meta Ads Manager and know how to scale brands through Paid Social ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical: &lt;/strong&gt;data is your friend; you’re able to translate numbers into decisions and strategy. You naturally frame ideas and initiatives in terms of core marketing metrics, not just gut feel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-centric: &lt;/strong&gt;you understand our customer and can put yourself in their shoes. You consume media with a marketing mindset and apply inspiration to your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable: &lt;/strong&gt;you can context-switch quickly without losing quality or momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourceful: you work well both in a team setting and autonomously. You don’t need to wait for clear instructions before you can take action and launch successful initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;you can build structure and process where it doesn’t exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurially Minded:&lt;/strong&gt; you have vision, passion, and imagination; you are not afraid to challenge the status quo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love for dogs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in growth/performance marketing, including experience owning a marketing budget; background in D2C (subscription a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing a multi-channel acquisition mix (hands-on-keyboard paid social and search experience required; affiliate, display, podcast, influencer, direct mail a strong plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting funnel diagnostics and running CRO and landing page testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running incrementality tests and a general interest in marketing measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative intuition — you know what ads work; you can form sound hypotheses for why an ad performed or underperformed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing people and/or external agencies or partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of performance marketing metrics (ROI, CAC, CPM, CVR, LTV) and how to translate them into budget decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel/Google Sheets mastery, GA4 proficiency; Tableau proficiency and basic SQL knowledge are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are AI native and have Claude Code, Codex and/or agentic marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, writing, and presentation skills, with experience presenting to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An obsession with growth and building things, and a positive mindset toward challenges and new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$151,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$183,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;‘&lt;em&gt;De Kas&lt;/em&gt;’ in Bleiswijk is HelloFresh&#39;s flagship fulfilment site in the Netherlands, and everything that happens here directly determines whether thousands of meal boxes leave on time, complete, and at cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Head of Warehouse Operations&lt;/strong&gt; (internally called &#39;&lt;em&gt;Warehouse Manager&lt;/em&gt;&#39;), you own the pre-production operation: the critical phase that makes assembly possible. Your three teams (expedition, internal transport and reverse logistics) ensure the right products are in the right place at the right time, so that production can start on schedule and run without interruption. You&#39;ll be part of the &lt;strong&gt;Production Leadership Team (PLT)&lt;/strong&gt;, which brings together multiple teams that collectively shape the strategy and direction of the fulfilment centre, giving you a genuine seat at the table and a direct line of influence on how this site evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the full pre-production operation&lt;/strong&gt; across three departments: expedition (inbound receiving), internal transport and reverse logistics; keeping product flow smooth, stock accurate and the yard running like clockwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive performance through KPIs&lt;/strong&gt;, using minutes-per-box as your primary lens, and translate operational data into fast, grounded decisions your team can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach, challenge and develop a team&lt;/strong&gt; of team leads and ~100 warehouse staff, building a culture of ownership, accountability and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hold the line on safety&lt;/strong&gt; by ensuring compliance is lived on the floor, not just documented, and that every team member goes home safe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own WMS governance and data quality&lt;/strong&gt;, so that every handover to the production and assembly teams rests on a reliable foundation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to site strategy &lt;/strong&gt;as an active member of the Production Leadership Team, collaborating with PLT colleagues across FSQA, HSE, HR, and Production to set direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the lead on site-level projects&lt;/strong&gt; (transitions, WMS developments, process redesigns) &amp;nbsp;when the business needs someone who can both think and execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing warehouse or logistics operations at scale: you&#39;ve been accountable for real volume and know what it takes to keep a high-throughput site running&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership: you build teams, not just headcounts, and you&#39;re comfortable setting high standards and having honest conversations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with a Warehouse Management System: you know how to get the most out of it and where its blind spots are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset with the ability to spot patterns quickly and move from insight to action without losing momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both Dutch and English&lt;/strong&gt;, with the communication skills to lead diverse teams and collaborate across international stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in e-commerce, food or FMCG is a genuine advantage: fast-moving environments are where you do your best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Above all&lt;/strong&gt;, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your future with a pension plan through Aegon Cappital (age-based rates, 50/50 split).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis (2026), plus free access to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start with 24 days of annual leave (pro-rata), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, and €0.23 per km for car/bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access internal/external opportunities aligned with our Job Framework, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€20/month), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please apply with your cv and cover letter (required)&lt;/strong&gt;. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; 920&amp;nbsp; 36 Avenue, Unit 100,Nisku, T9E 1C6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;: Monday to Friday (9am to 5pm) - may vary based on business needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Health and Safety Manager &amp;nbsp;is responsible for building a safety culture and strong engagement on site, developing and implementing safety programs in partnership site leadership &amp;amp; facilitating safety training. The Health and Safety Manager reports directly to the Senior Manager, National Health and Safety, and will collaborate closely with the Site Director. The Health and Safety Manager oversees a Health and Safety Coordinator; and works directly with Production Supervisors and Managers to ensure workplace safety is top priority. The size of the team overseen depends on the specific site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong, continuously improving, safety-first culture through employee engagement, strong health and safety management programs, and training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Leadership to develop health and safety management systems and the associated rollout and facilitated training to ensure continued growth opportunities for the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead health and safety audits, routine site checks, and closing of compliance gaps to establish high safety standards and compliance with HelloFresh and OHS requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with site management to proactively identify, assess, analyze, and mitigate job hazards; and establish high effectiveness of controls and processes to eliminate safety risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage, motivate, and train employees on safety roles and responsibilities, accountabilities, and processes to maintain a safe workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee incident investigations, reporting, and management, develop root cause analysis and mentor operational personnel in its processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee injury management, WCB claim management, and Return-to-Work (RTW) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead safety reporting; ensure high transparency and visibility to safety metrics and alerts on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee onboarding and on the job safety training programs for employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with operations to develop and mentor an effective Joint Health and Safety Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor existing and incoming relevant legislation and regulations to ensure the site meets requirements and that health and safety management programs are up to date with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with Provincial OH&amp;amp;S acts, regulations, and legislation, Industry best practice, and internal Policy and Procedure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties and responsibilities as assigned by the Senior Manager, National Health and Safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed post-secondary education&amp;nbsp; in&amp;nbsp; Health and Safety (Certificate, Diploma, Degree), or related field or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Health and Safety Designation (CRSP, CRST, CSP, ASP, CMIOSH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience required in Health and Safety including 3 years of verifiable leadership progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in providing high quality customer experience, building a safety culture, communicating to get team member buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with ability to perform administrative tasks with high degree of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (written and verbal), including active listening and proofreading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform at a high level in a fast paced and dynamic work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demonstrate good, sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work weekend schedules and in temperature controlled (it’s food, so it’s cold!) facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Suite (Calendar, Gmail, Docs, Sheets), and video conferencing (Hangouts Meet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
