&lt;h2&gt;The Role (What’s in the Box)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Health &amp;amp; Safety Specialist is an expert-level contributor who owns the H&amp;amp;S function operationally. This role goes beyond administration and compliance to drive meaningful cultural and systemic change across the Cloudberry site. The ideal candidate brings deep technical expertise, strong regulatory knowledge, and the experience to independently lead complex initiatives — acting as a trusted authority for site management, operational leaders, and the HQ H&amp;amp;S team alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do (The Recipe)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and independently conduct thorough incident investigations with robust root cause analysis; own corrective action follow-through with site stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, implement and continuously improve the site H&amp;amp;S management system in alignment with ISO 45001 and HelloFresh global standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and own site-level H&amp;amp;S policies, risk assessment frameworks and safe work procedures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively identify systemic risks and drive preventive initiatives before incidents occur — not solely in response to them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and facilitate workplace risk assessments in partnership with the Joint Health &amp;amp; Safety Committee (JHSC)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and develop safety capability across operational leaders — coaching supervisors to own safety conversations and daily huddles rather than simply delivering prescribed content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track, analyse and report on H&amp;amp;S KPIs (LTI, Near Miss, audit results); translate data into actionable insights for senior management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead internal and external audit preparation (including BSI/ISO); conduct spot checks and compliance reviews&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administer, train and continuously improve the site H&amp;amp;S reporting system&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support and challenge HQ H&amp;amp;S strategy based on operational insights from the site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure compliance with Swedish AML, SAM regulations, and all applicable OH&amp;amp;S legislation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Bring (Your Ingredients)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Competency Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, current knowledge of Swedish OH&amp;amp;S legislation and ideally ISO 45001. Able to interpret and apply regulatory requirements independently and advise management with authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigation &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to lead complex incident investigations and identify systemic root causes — not surface-level fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experienced in designing and leading risk assessment processes, not just completing templates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Capable of building safety capability in others without relying on formal authority — a trusted expert who makes leaders better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable with KPI analysis, trend identification and presenting data-driven recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in Swedish and English. Able to communicate clearly and credibly at all levels — from production floor to senior management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivity &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; Operates with a prevention mindset and takes initiative without needing direction. Brings ideas and owns them through to implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident working with H&amp;amp;S reporting systems, data tools, and standard office applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 5 years of relevant experience in an H&amp;amp;S specialist or senior H&amp;amp;S role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience from production, food manufacturing, logistics or similarly regulated operational environment strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience building or significantly improving H&amp;amp;S management systems — not just maintaining them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NEBOSH Certificate or Diploma, ISO 45001 Lead Auditor, or equivalent certification preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with regulatory authority contact (Arbetsmiljöverket or equivalent) and external audit processes (BSI, ISO)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Degree in Occupational Health &amp;amp; Safety, Engineering or related discipline, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer (The Toppings)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3e891q&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;201&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;124&quot;&gt;HelloFresh Discounts&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy 65% off your HelloFresh Meal Box and 40% off Factor subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;grewcb&quot; data-start=&quot;202&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;231&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt; – Access learning and development opportunities, including the HelloMint mentorship program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vnkff4&quot; data-start=&quot;327&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;330&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Time Off&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy 30 days of paid vacation per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8wvins&quot; data-start=&quot;388&quot; data-end=&quot;518&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;Parental Leave &amp;amp; Pension&lt;/strong&gt; – Benefits are provided in accordance with the applicable Collective Bargaining Agreement (CBA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u5rwfn&quot; data-start=&quot;519&quot; data-end=&quot;598&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;522&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;Fitness &amp;amp; Well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Benefit from discounts at Nordic Wellness gyms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9hif29&quot; data-start=&quot;599&quot; data-end=&quot;712&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;625&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Access Spill online therapy, with support available within 24 hours of your request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in &lt;strong&gt;Inoza Tower, BGC&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in &lt;strong&gt;Customer Care Specialist – French Bilingual &lt;/strong&gt;are responsible for delivering a high level of courteous and efficient customer service in response to customer enquiries across multiple contact channels. You will be resilient and adaptable and have a natural passion for making people happy. You will be supported every day by a strong support network of Team Leaders and Trainers.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being the first point of contact for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing general support and building engaging relationships on each and every customer call or interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively offer all HelloFresh products and benefits to our customers on all interactions in line with current demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and resolving customer complaints and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work towards the Customer Care team KPIs and targets set by the management team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report and document any kinds of issues to the responsible departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively suggest ways to improve internal procedures and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run internal projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make every effort to support and positively reflect the HelloFresh brand to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being an expert regarding company policies, tools, and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6 months Customer Service Representative BPO Experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amenable to work onsite in BGC, Taguig city and Bridgetowne, Quezon city.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills both verbal and written with the ability to convey information clearly and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service orientation with well-developed interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in customer service, sales, or technical support roles is highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated active listening and comprehension skills to effectively address customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to prioritize, manage time, and multitask in a high-volume, fast-paced setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of adaptability and flexibility to changes in processes, tools, or client requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen attention to detail with a focus on accuracy, compliance, and adherence to process excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;BGC &lt;em&gt;(7th Floor, Inoza Tower, 40th Street, BGC, Taguig City)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in ensuring that customer orders are processed accurately, efficiently, and on time. You will own the daily end-to-end execution of customer orders, from preparing and validating order files through system upload, fulfillment release, and final confirmation.&amp;nbsp;The role combines order management, logistics coordination, operational reporting, and data analysis. The ideal candidate is highly analytical and detail-oriented, with a strong focus on data accuracy and operational excellence. They will manage daily exceptions, investigate discrepancies, proactively identify operational risks and improvement opportunities, and translate data-driven insights into effective actions, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate daily order processing and fulfillment&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring customer orders are handled accurately and within established timelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review, validate, and maintain order data&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure completeness, accuracy, and alignment with operational requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage order updates, inventory exceptions, and fulfillment changes&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring issues are accurately documented and resolved in a timely manner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze operational data&lt;/strong&gt; to identify discrepancies, recurring issues, trends, and opportunities for process improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain accurate operational trackers and reports&lt;/strong&gt;, providing clear and actionable summaries to support team visibility and decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with internal teams and external partners&lt;/strong&gt; to investigate and resolve order, inventory, and fulfillment-related issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor order progress and operational deadlines&lt;/strong&gt;, proactively identifying potential delays or risks and taking appropriate action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate risks, delays, discrepancies, and unresolved issues&lt;/strong&gt; clearly and proactively to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date process documentation&lt;/strong&gt;, including trackers, procedures, and other operational resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify opportunities to improve operational accuracy, efficiency, and automation&lt;/strong&gt;, leveraging data and process insights to support continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support data-driven and operational projects&lt;/strong&gt; as needed, contributing to broader team initiatives and business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With 2 years professional experience&lt;/strong&gt; in fulfillment, logistics, supply chain, e-commerce, data operations, or a related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to assess data, identify trends and discrepancies, and develop effective solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets&lt;/strong&gt;, including lookups, pivot tables, formulas, data validation, and the management of large datasets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to review information, identify anomalies, and translate findings into actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly when managing data and operational processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to manage time-sensitive and repetitive processes&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;while maintaining a high level of accuracy and consistency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proactive approach to sharing updates, raising concerns, and collaborating with stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong investigative and follow-through skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to identify discrepancies, determine root causes, and drive issues through to resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability and willingness to learn&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to quickly understand and navigate new tools, systems, and processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work independently&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;while effectively collaborating with cross-functional teams and broader business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
