&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-focused mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong commitment to operational accuracy, service quality, and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
