&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance &amp;amp; SLA Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to implement, assess, and exceed service level agreements (SLAs) through rigorous quality metrics and workload optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
