&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
