&lt;h2&gt;The Role (What’s in the Box)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sourcing Manager – Nordics is responsible for providing the strategic and operational bridge between Product and Procurement teams, managing end-to-end communications between local and international stakeholders. The role sits within local/regional teams and owns the process from new ingredient requests through supplier onboarding and scaling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in close collaboration with Category Managers and local business leaders, you will support the local Product team in driving the local product agenda in full alignment with global/regional category strategies. You will navigate complex operational limitations and requirements unique to the Nordics market (Denmark, Sweden, and Norway), ensuring that new ingredient introductions (NID SKUs) enhance customer experience while maintaining operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports to the International Team Lead Sourcing, with a dotted line into the local Head of Culinary, maintaining regular interaction with international stakeholders and peer Sourcing Managers across HelloFresh markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do (The Recipe)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Agenda &amp;amp; Strategy Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the local Product team to drive and execute the local product agenda while keeping initiatives aligned with overall category strategy and operational guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nordics Operational Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage complex operational constraints, supply chain limitations, and local quality/regulatory requirements specific to the Denmark, Sweden, and Norway markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Gatekeeping:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead project management for new ingredient requests (NID) between Culinary, Product, Supply Chain, and Procurement teams. Act as the primary gatekeeper to ensure strict adherence to standardized onboarding processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive optimal stakeholder management across local, regional, and international leadership, ensuring transparent communications and aligned priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Market Synergy &amp;amp; Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Review new ingredient proposals to identify existing cross-market sourcing opportunities, supporting Category Managers in SKU consolidation, rationalization, and cost-saving initiatives across catalogs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Onboarding Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage requisition proposals and local supplier interactions in the Nordics, coordinating tender processes with Category Managers when multi-market sourcing is involved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specification &amp;amp; Quality Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Culinary, FSQA (Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance), and Supply Chain teams to tweak ingredient specifications or formulations to optimize cost, quality, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Bring (Your Ingredients)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum &lt;strong&gt;5–6 years of proven experience&lt;/strong&gt; in procurement, sourcing, category management, or a similar role specifically within the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Nordics food market and supply chain dynamics&lt;/strong&gt; across Denmark, Sweden, and Norway, including vendor landscapes, quality standards, and operational nuances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;English AND at least one Nordic language&lt;/strong&gt; — Danish, Swedish, or Norwegian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Degree in Business, Supply Chain, Engineering, Food Science, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to manage complex operational trade-offs and deliver consistent results under tight timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and process-improvement mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder-management and influencing skills, with a track record of bridging local product needs with regional procurement strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication, collaboration, and change-management skills in a multicultural, international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel &lt;strong&gt;up to 20% of the time&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer (The Toppings)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Discounts – Enjoy 65% off your HelloFresh Meal Box and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development – Make the most of a dedicated Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and the HelloMint mentorship program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 25 days of paid vacation per year, + 5 days of&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;feriefridage&lt;/em&gt;. Paid leave also provided for your child’s first sick day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Benefits – Benefit from a Parental Leave policy supporting your family needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation and Perks – Includes a 5% company-paid pension and insurance package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health – Access to Spill online therapy, available within 24 hours of request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Comforts – Office perks include drinks and snacks, subsidized catered lunches, and breakfast every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness and Well-being – Discounts at SATS gym, plus access to sports and exercise clubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Are You the Missing Ingredient?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the opportunity you’ve been looking for, we’d love to hear from you. Apply today and join us in changing the way people eat forever!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our HelloTech organisation is HelloFresh Group&#39;s global technology backbone — more than 1,000 people building the digital products and internal platforms that power our end-to-end food experience. As part of the IT team in Warsaw, you&#39;ll be the go-to person for keeping our Google Workspace environment running smoothly for employees across the Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll act as the escalation point for tricky Workspace issues, help colleagues get the most out of the tools they use every day (including the AI features built into Workspace), and continuously look for ways to make support faster and more self-service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary escalation point for L2 Google Workspace queries — Gmail, Drive, Calendar, Sites, Meet, and related core services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex, non-standard user issues, ensuring fast and clear communication back to the requester.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employees in adopting &lt;strong&gt;Gemini for Google Workspace&lt;/strong&gt; — answering questions, sharing best practices, and helping teams get productivity value out of AI-assisted features in Gmail, Docs, Slides, and Meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle day-to-day data support tasks: restoring files and folders, and transferring file ownership when employees leave or change teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse recurring ticket trends and propose improvements to support processes, SOPs, and self-service documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain clear internal documentation and knowledge base articles for both end users and fellow IT staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with Google support and other third-party vendors on issues that need escalation beyond L2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4+ years of hands-on experience administering Google Workspace in a production environment, ideally at mid-level scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of Google Workspace&#39;s core apps (Gmail, Drive, Calendar, Sites, Meet) and their admin-side configuration, sharing settings, and IAM controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with user- and group-level administration — provisioning, org units, and account lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working understanding of email fundamentals: DNS records (SPF, DKIM, DMARC), routing, and IMAP/SMTP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Google Workspace Administrator Certification (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in and hands-on familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Gemini and other AI features in Google Workspace&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;re comfortable exploring new AI tooling and helping others adopt it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Problem-Solving: Demonstrates strong analytical skills to diagnose and resolve complex technical issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Communication: Fluent in English with the ability to explain complex technical information clearly and concisely to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Collaboration: Ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams, including developers, product managers, and other IT personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Management: Proven ability to manage time effectively, prioritizing tasks based on urgency and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global collaboration at scale: Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech&#39;s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology with real-world impact: Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership: Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development/delivery: Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw centre. The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility in managing, securing, and optimizing Customer Care technologies such as Genesys Cloud CX and Twilio, owning technical issues and changes end-to-end, providing technical leadership, leveraging AI and automation, and ensuring strong security, governance, and operational reliability, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Care Technology Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineer, administer, and optimize Customer Care technologies that enable customer service and revenue-supporting operations. Manage telephony, including voice, callbacks, and outbound dialers, alongside messaging, SMS, social media, email, chatbots, and external platform integrations. Manage routing, IVRs, phone numbers, operational configurations, platform health, releases, and vendor coordination across Genesys Cloud CX, Twilio, Mindful Feedback, and other platforms and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction across Customer Care IT and lead assigned projects and initiatives through solution design, technical decision-making, stakeholder coordination, dependency management, testing, implementation, operational handover, and resolution of complex or high-impact technical issues.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ticket and Incident Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own technical requests and incidents through resolution, including investigation, root cause analysis, escalation, corrective actions, and SLA tracking. Ensure requests received outside standard channels are logged.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User and Access Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage onboarding, offboarding, licences, roles, queues, MFA, access reviews, and bulk user changes following approved access controls and least-privilege principles.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply security, privacy, access, data handling, credential management, and change controls across Customer Care technologies. Identify and escalate security risks, vulnerabilities, or control gaps through established processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and automate repetitive or inefficient processes. Build, test, document, maintain, and improve approved automations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Use approved AI capabilities to improve daily tasks, including investigation, analysis, documentation, knowledge retrieval, ticket handling, and other operational activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and Automation Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; Administer approved AI and automation capabilities, including configuration, access, integrations, monitoring, and governance controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting and Audit:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain reports and dashboards, fulfil data requests, and provide audit evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Enable seasonal ramps, new-hire cohorts, peak periods, and platform changes within a 24/7 Customer Care operating environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge and Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain technical documentation, educate and enable Customer Care and partner sites, and collaborate with stakeholders, internal teams, vendors, and security teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;English Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Excellent written and spoken English communication skills for working effectively across cultures, global teams, and business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction, make informed technical decisions, coordinate stakeholders, and lead complex initiatives and issues through resolution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently investigate and resolve complex issues across applications, networks, access, APIs, integrations, and cloud systems, coordinating escalation when required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicate technical decisions, risks, dependencies, and priorities effectively with stakeholders, vendors, technical teams, and senior leadership.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply security, privacy, least-privilege access, credential handling, and data protection principles to daily technical activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive and prioritize improvements across technologies, processes, workflows, and operational practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply AI and automation to improve technical and operational work while validating outputs and following security and governance controls.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of total IT experience across Technical Operations, Systems Administration, Application Management, IT Engineering, or comparable technical roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Care Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience engineering or administering Customer Care technologies, including CCaaS and SaaS platforms, identity and access management, and authentication. Genesys Cloud CX experience is preferred. Candidates without Genesys experience must be willing to learn the platform and pursue relevant certifications.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations, Tools, and Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with APIs, webhooks, integrations, scripting, workflow automation, AI, low-code platforms, and Jira, Confluence, or equivalent ticketing and knowledge management tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in &lt;strong&gt;Inoza tower, BGC&lt;/strong&gt; that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;IT Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will take on a key responsibility in driving the expansion of our IT services in Manila by architecting scalable systems and leading a multi-tiered engineering team (Jr. to Senior). In this pivotal role, you will oversee day-to-day desk-side support, ensure network and infrastructure stability, maintain strict PEZA regulatory compliance, and elevate end-user satisfaction across the organization., contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit, mentor, and manage a multi-tiered IT support team (L1–L3), overseeing daily operations, performance evaluations, continuous technical upskilling, and schedule management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;IT Service Delivery &amp;amp; SLA Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and optimize L1/L2+ service procedures, runbooks, and workflows; manage the full user lifecycle, conduct ticket quality audits (DSATs), and ensure team SLA targets are met.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Asset Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with global and facilities teams to manage local network infrastructure, endpoint security (Intune/Jamf, ZScaler, SentinelOne), AV systems, asset lifecycles (Snipe-IT), and hardware procurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;PEZA Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct all Philippine Economic Zone Authority (PEZA) compliance activities, including IT asset registration, movement tracking, import/export documentation, disposition, and audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security, Risk &amp;amp; Business Continuity:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce ITIL/ISO security standards and access controls, conduct software license and operational audits, and lead disaster recovery (DR) and site continuity planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Project, Vendor &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead office IT expansions and infrastructure projects, manage vendor contracts and ISP relationships, control IT budgets, and deliver performance reporting to global leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education &amp;amp; Professional Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Holds a Bachelor&#39;s degree in IT, Computer Science, or a related field, backed by 5+ years in IT infrastructure/support and 3+ years in a supervisory or management role within global organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrates strong capabilities in coaching, team building, and project management, paired with high autonomy, critical thinking, customer-centricity, and full English proficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Technical &amp;amp; Systems Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in managing multi-OS environments (Windows, macOS), MDM tools (Intune, Jamf), endpoint security (ZScaler, SentinelOne), and asset tracking (Snipe-IT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Operations Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid grounding in network management (LAN, WiFi, PABX), modern SaaS tools (Google Workspace, Jira, Slack), and ITIL frameworks (Agile is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledgeable in PEZA compliance guidelines and IT asset management protocols specific to Philippine economic zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Stakeholder Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled at managing high-level stakeholder communications, navigating procurement pipelines, and handling vendor contracts and negotiations.\\&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Setup&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule: Monday to Friday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift time: 12:00pm - 9:00am MNL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully Onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
