&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Photographer in the HelloFresh Studio, you are part of our Photography team, working across food, product, lifestyle, and marketing productions. You are first and foremost an exceptional photographer with deep technical and visual expertise, setting the benchmark for photographic quality, craft, and production excellence across the Studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead through expertise, influence, and example, helping elevate the capabilities of the photography team while maintaining high standards across large-scale asset production. You play a key role in developing photographic talent, evolving ways of working, and driving continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You collaborate closely with Producers, Styling, Culinary, Post-production, and Creative teams to deliver high-quality and scalable visual production across multiple brands. You stay up to date with industry developments and actively support AI direction, experimentation, and content generation initiatives within the Studio and broader organization, helping translate new technologies into practical production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example &lt;/strong&gt;and continuously raise the bar for photographic quality and execution across the Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute and oversee&lt;/strong&gt; food, product, lifestyle, and marketing photography to the highest commercial standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach, mentor, and support photographers &lt;/strong&gt;through feedback, knowledge sharing, and hands-on guidance to elevate overall team capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define, maintain, and continuously improve &lt;/strong&gt;photographic standards, shooting guidelines, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work together with Studio leadership&lt;/strong&gt; to improve production quality, studio efficiency, and scalable ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &lt;/strong&gt;closely with Art Direction, Styling, Culinary, Post-production, and Creative teams to ensure strong and consistent visual execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support complex productions &lt;/strong&gt;and solve creative and technical and production challenges on set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive consistency &lt;/strong&gt;across large asset volumes while maintaining visual excellence and operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actively contribute to Studio and company AI initiatives &lt;/strong&gt;by supporting experimentation, developing practical use cases, and helping integrate AI-supported and hybrid content creation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted expert &lt;/strong&gt;and escalation point for photographic quality, technical decision-making, and production excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a seasoned photography professional with 7+ years of experience in commercial photography, ideally including food, lifestyle, product, and high-volume e-commerce content production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate exceptional photography craft and technical excellence. Providing a portfolio is mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep expertise in lighting, composition, camera systems, color, production environments, and visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience operating in fast-paced production environments and collaborating across multiple disciplines and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You naturally elevate others through coaching, feedback, mentorship, and sharing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading photographers or creative production teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly influential, collaborative, and comfortable aligning stakeholders without relying on hierarchy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong production mindset and continuously look for opportunities to improve workflows, quality, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay current with developments in photography, visual production, and AI-supported content creation, and understand how to apply new technologies in a practical production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have expert knowledge of Capture One and strong understanding of color grading and image editing. Experience with additional photography, automation, or AI-supported production tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can interpret and deconstruct creative briefs and translate them into practical photographic approaches, balancing creative intent, production realities, and visual quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong verbal and written communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;_________________&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please include a portfolio of your recent and relevant work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-calibre Lead - Menu Strategy to drive strategic, global improvements in our value-added products portfolio, focusing on premium offerings and recipe customization that leads to higher retention and improved monetization performance. In this role, reporting to the Director of Product Strategy - Menu within the Global Product Strategy and Operations team, you will work closely with Product Development Managers across our global business units to expand our customization capabilities and coverage, introduce new premium concepts that excite our customers, and increase basket sizes through more food items ordered. This is an exciting opportunity for Product Managers with strong analytical abilities to drive the Global team’s future product strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the value-added products roadmap, ensuring alignment with stakeholders across HelloFresh Group&#39;s meal kits business and driving monetization (AOV) performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive our &lt;strong&gt;customization&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to support expanding our customization assortment in 10+ markets, delivering on ambitious growth and profitability objectives:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement mid-term multi-market customization opportunities based on commercial potential and consumer relevance, such as tailoring recipes to different dietary needs or enabling multi-ingredient customization at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems for efficient sharing and scaling of best-performing customization types across our different business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze the performance of existing customization types and create business cases and improvement plans to drive commercial growth within our current offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redefine our &lt;strong&gt;surcharge recipes strategy &lt;/strong&gt;to define a clear value proposition and grow average order value:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review existing portfolio and current positioning and create a new strategy to reposition our surcharge recipe portfolio that feels premium and customers engage with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop hypotheses and testing frameworks to validate new premium concepts, pricing sensitivity, and menu composition changes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze the performance of different surcharge recipe initiatives such as pricing changes, assortment expansion and new premium ingredients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Tech on &lt;strong&gt;upselling initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; through improved UI, better discovery of value-added product portfolio, and cross-selling products that lead to incremental improvements in average order value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree with a strong academic record.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant 5+ years of working experience in product management, analytics, and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High calibre profile: you are a fast learner, a top performer and want to take on a new exciting challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset: you are great with numbers and have strong analytical logic and rigor, with knowledge of experimentation methodologies and statistics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top notch ways of working: you set the bar really high in terms of collaboration and what good looks like with strong people and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership: You can rally teams around common objectives and set up teams for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset and a “learning never stops” attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work through tough problems with a rigorous and pragmatic approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Sorter &lt;/strong&gt;will&amp;nbsp; be responsible for assisting in the receiving of freight,&amp;nbsp; breakdown of pallets, scanning, and sortation of boxes by driver routes, loading of vehicles, and helping to direct traffic in the facility. They’ll report to the Delivery Station Supervisor and be responsible for completing all sort activities safely within the shift. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Occasionally&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; the Lead Warehouse Associate will be required to provide on-shift leadership by overseeing the logistics package sort operations and coordinating the team on site (all Hub activities and volume, including the unloading, sorting, and allocation of freight for drivers).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule: Sat-Wed / 1am-8am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a team of associates to safely receive and sort all volume for the shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures that incoming volume is directed to the correct destination on time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate delays or any issues to the Sort Supervisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend pre-sort meetings, working towards daily goals and safe operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing the TSR process to ensure trailers are safely docked to the building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to results on safety, productivity, cost, quality, and on-time delivery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our internal technology and systems to conduct operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the warehouse areas as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce and follow all safety, GMP, and SQF policies/procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to meet productivity targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have good attendance and punctuality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Occasionally&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll be asked to coordinate a team of Warehouse Associates, use HelloFresh tech and systems to make operational decisions and ensure a culture of safety for operations inside facilities, ensure the security of all HelloFresh assets (hub facilities, vehicles, inventory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Occasionally&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll be asked to perform dispatching functions for drivers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using computers and scanning devices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team and safety focused&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to use hands to move packages and operate electronic devices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to regularly lift/move up to 50 lbs and participate in a highly physical job through standing,&amp;nbsp; walking, crouching, pulling, and pushing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to stand, walk, stoop, reach, and lift for a minimum of 10 to 12 hours with or without&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; reasonable accommodation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating a manual and electric pallet jack (training will be provided) &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and write English, follow verbal instructions, and use simple math&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be at least 22 years old and legally authorized to work in the US and possess and maintain a valid driver&#39;s license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to pass all pre-employment screens (including drug, MVR, background, and criminal checks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use scanning devices and other basic computer skills preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific vision abilities required by this job include close vision and peripheral vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic proficiency in manipulating data and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet schedules/timelines and organize your own work. Can reliably work alternative and flexible work schedules including nights, Sundays, and Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Hourly Wage &amp;amp; 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 4 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible health plans effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;75% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is the policy of HelloFresh not to discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, marital status, genetic information, disability, because they are a protected veteran, or any other protected classification under federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$19 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Lead Stylist (m/f/x)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Lead Stylist&lt;/strong&gt; at HelloFresh, you will play a key leadership role in shaping the visual identity of our food content across recipe photography, brand campaigns, and multimedia channels. You’ll lead a team of talented food and set stylists, fostering a collaborative, high-performing studio environment that balances creativity, quality, and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is both a strategic and people-focused role. You&#39;ll be responsible for managing the day-to-day operations of the styling team, mentoring individuals in their growth, and driving forward the creative vision and standards of the studio in close partnership with Art Direction, Photography teams and Production. Your focus will be on empowering your team and ensuring our content remains visually compelling and consistently on-brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we value diverse experiences and encourage candidates from a range of creative backgrounds to apply — even if you don’t meet every listed requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, manage, and develop a team of stylists, providing regular feedback, coaching, and clear growth pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the styling function across all studio productions, ensuring team resourcing, performance, and creative standards are aligned with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the studio’s styling vision, processes, and best practices, ensuring consistency and innovation across all content formats and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams — including Art Directors, photographers, culinary teams, and producers — to deliver exceptional, on-brand content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance hands-on involvement with strategic leadership, stepping into high-visibility shoots when needed and guiding the team on complex or evolving projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead trend research and visual ideation, helping to drive the creative direction of our food styling while staying ahead of industry movements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure team performance against creative, operational, and delivery targets, while fostering a positive, inclusive, and solutions-oriented studio culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in food styling, creative direction, or studio production — with at least 2+ years in a leadership or people management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of leading styling teams and delivering high-quality, brand-aligned content in a fast-paced creative or production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio showcasing high-level styling skills, conceptual thinking, and an ability to elevate content through design and detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in food styling techniques, with a strong understanding of composition, texture, and color in visual storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent people management and leadership skills, with experience in mentoring, conflict resolution, and team development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, calm, and proactive approach — with strong communication and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food, photography, seasonal trends, and brand-building through visual identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset focused on scaling teams and workflows sustainably, while continuously improving creative quality and studio output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is on a mission to change the way people eat, forever!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since our 2011 founding in Europe’s vibrant tech hub, Berlin, we’ve become the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, delivering to over 4.2 million households worldwide in 15 countries across 3 continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will encourage you to make an immediate impact in your area of work as well as empower you to grow your career with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor_, eine Marke von HelloFresh, sucht Dich als Learning Business Partner (all genders). Als Learning Business Partner bist du die zentrale Ansprechperson für alle Trainings- und Entwicklungsmaßnahmen am Standort. Dein Fokus liegt auf der operativen Umsetzung von Onboarding-Programmen, der Organisation und Koordination von Trainings sowie der Sicherstellung, dass unsere Mitarbeitenden alle notwendigen Kenntnisse und Fähigkeiten erhalten, um erfolgreich im Tagesgeschäft zu arbeiten. Gemeinsam mit Führungskräften und Stakeholdern sorgst du für praxisnahe Trainings, die Standards sichern und die Effizienz in unseren Prozessen steigern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;22n33l&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;239&quot;&gt;Du übernimmst die Organisation, Koordination und kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung von Onboarding-Programmen und Trainingsmaßnahmen und stellst eine reibungslose und konsistente Lernerfahrung für neue und bestehende Mitarbeitende sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ivb8c&quot; data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Die zuverlässige Durchführung und Koordination aller Pflichttrainings, insbesondere in den Bereichen Health &amp;amp; Safety und Food Safety, liegt in deiner Verantwortung. Dabei stellst du sicher, dass alle relevanten Trainings am Standort termingerecht und in hoher Qualität umgesetzt werden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bkl3p7&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;In enger Zusammenarbeit mit Führungskräften und Fachbereichen identifizierst du Schulungsbedarfe und Entwicklungspotenziale und leitest daraus passende und praxisnahe Lernmaßnahmen ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8ykiuj&quot; data-start=&quot;719&quot; data-end=&quot;949&quot;&gt;Die Erstellung, Aktualisierung und Pflege von Trainingsmaterialien sowie die Dokumentation von Trainingsfortschritten gehören ebenso zu deinem Verantwortungsbereich wie die kontinuierliche Verbesserung der Trainingseffektivität.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5jgssg&quot; data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;Als fachliche und disziplinarische Führungskraft des Learning Teams am Standort unterstützt und coachst du die Teammitglieder und stellst eine einheitlich hohe Qualität in der Trainingsumsetzung sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tud8xp&quot; data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1333&quot;&gt;Mit einem analytischen Blick auf die Trainingseffizienz identifizierst du konkrete Verbesserungspotenziale im Tagesgeschäft und setzt entsprechende Maßnahmen eigenständig um.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;142fa9x&quot; data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Darüber hinaus wirkst du an operativen Learning-&amp;amp;-Development-Projekten auf Standort- und standortübergreifender Ebene mit und trägst aktiv zur Weiterentwicklung und Umsetzung von L&amp;amp;D-Initiativen in der gesamten Organisation bei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
