&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mit einem tollen Team in Verden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt;- Interne Schulungsmöglichkeiten sowie ein jährliches Budget für Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf Factor_-Boxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Kompetitives Gehalt und 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen, mit zusätzlichen Fitnessangeboten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001 #factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Intern in our Benelux Legal team, you&#39;ll be the first point of contact for day-to-day legal questions across the business. You&#39;ll support our legal counsels by taking ownership of routine contract reviews and compliance tasks, so commercial projects keep moving without delay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Marketing, HR, Operations and Procurement to help HelloFresh grow while managing risk in a fast-moving, regulated food and e-commerce environment. This is your chance to see how in-house legal work directly enables the business, and to build hands-on experience you won&#39;t get in a lecture hall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review and process standard commercial agreements such as NDAs, Terms &amp;amp; Conditions and vendor contracts, in collaboration with our legal counsels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first filter for legal questions from teams like Marketing and HR, giving practical answers and escalating complex matters to the right counsel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team in keeping our compliance and regulatory obligations up to date, including record-keeping and basic regulatory checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and maintain our legal databases and templates so colleagues can quickly find what they need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research legal topics relevant to our industry and turn your findings into clear, concise summaries for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve our legal processes by spotting recurring questions and suggesting templates, FAQs or smarter ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Currently enrolled in a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Law at a university or hogeschool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;A basic understanding of contract law and corporate compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and spoken English and Dutch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;A pragmatic, problem-solving mindset: you see legal as a partner that helps the business move forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills and the ability to work independently on high-volume tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;A proactive attitude and eagerness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a paid internship designed to offer hands-on experience in a fast-paced, international environment. As an intern, you will have structured guidance to support your learning and development. We aim to create an environment where you can build practical skills, gain exposure to how HelloFresh operates, and learn through doing. The internship is suitable for students or recent graduates whose educational requirements allow them to complete an internship during the proposed period. During the application process, we will ask required questions regarding internship eligibility and university requirements (such as duration, documentation, or approval criteria). Please ensure you are able to provide this information as part of your application.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free bootcamp classes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a flexible hybrid work setup with a €2.45 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll get 10 days of leave, based on 40 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, and €0.23 per km for car/bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access internal/external opportunities aligned with our Job Framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our global Mature Customer Marketing team in Berlin, we are looking for a Senior Lifecycle Marketing Manager to own the lifecycle strategy for one these topics: merchandising, or partnerships &amp;amp; retail media.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Mature Customer Marketing team sits within the HelloFresh Group’s Global Customer Lifecycle organization. Our mission is simple: keep active customers active, and make sure they get the most out of their subscription — across our 6 brands, 18 countries and 30 markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Lifecycle Marketing Manager, you’ll be a critical link between strategy and execution, partnering closely with CRM, Product Marketing, Physical Product, Tech and local marketing teams to design, brief and scale programs that keep our customers engaged with their subscription.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the lifecycle strategy deployment for your topic area and translate it into programs and campaigns that keep customers engaged with their subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Physical Product and Tech to spot opportunities that improve the customer experience and support your topic’s goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief campaigns end-to-end to CRM Operations and Creative teams, ensuring messaging, targeting and execution meet our lifecycle and brand standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with local market teams across our 30 markets to adapt and roll out global strategy, balancing consistency with local relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to test, measure and continuously optimize campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on the health of your topic area, flagging risks and opportunities to the wider Customer Engagement team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-topic initiatives across the team as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with experience managing complex campaigns across a high number of cross-functional stakeholders, including CRM Operations, Creative, Tech, and local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative briefing skills — experience translating marketing objectives, audience insights, and messaging needs into clear, inspiring briefs that give creative teams the direction and context needed to deliver strong work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen — experience operating in a commercial function (not necessarily CRM), with the ability to bridge lifecycle marketing thinking with commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A successful experience (3+ years) in CRM, lifecycle marketing, product marketing or a similar role, ideally in a subscription, e-commerce or FMCG environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset — comfortable using data to inform decisions and optimize campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities independently, across global and local stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; &lt;em&gt;notions of German, French, Dutch, Swedish, Norwegian or Danish is a plus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Loyalty and retention are two of the strongest levers we have for growing customer lifetime value and profit. As Lead, Loyalty &amp;amp; Customer Lifecycle, you own the strategy and end-to-end delivery of HelloFresh Group’s loyalty program across our global markets and brands. You decide how the program works and how it earns its keep, set the quarterly roadmap and OKRs, and own the CRM and lifecycle experience that runs across email, push and SMS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is customer-centric and data-driven. You’ll run experiments, build the financial models that quantify program cost and customer value, and analyze our data to find where the biggest gains are. You work hand-in-hand with tech and product as the commercial owner of the program, translating business questions into requirements and taking on the commercial work so engineering can stay focused on building. You also partner with Data, Product Marketing, Legal and CRM Operations to ship, and coordinate across markets with local growth and legal teams. Beyond the core program, you look after our legacy retention initiatives across markets and help local teams run their own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor leadership role. You’ll set direction and lead major initiatives through influence and cross-functional partnership, not through direct reports. Your work will shape how HelloFresh Group rewards and retains its customers for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own loyalty strategy &amp;amp; design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect and own&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the end-to-end loyalty program, from how it works (points, tiers, missions, rewards) to the financial models and business cases behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the reward economics and program roadmap, turning company strategy into quarterly OKRs and a clear path for how the program evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;multi-market rollouts, including legal compliance, customer communication and migration planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive CRM &amp;amp; the customer lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the CRM strategy for the program, covering journey design, segmentation and multi-channel campaigns across email, push and SMS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;lifecycle interventions tied to key milestones such as enrollment, points thresholds, redemption nudges and churn risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;CRM dependencies with platform and ops teams, catching eligibility, frequency and data issues before they reach customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run experimentation &amp;amp; analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and interpret&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;A/B experiments for program variants, CRM campaigns and feature launches, then turn the results into decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;financial models that quantify program cost, AOV impact and customer lifetime value, refining them as experiment data comes in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and track&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the KPIs that signal program health, including opt-in, redemption, engaged users, points burn and virality, and use them to spot untapped opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build partnerships &amp;amp; deliver operationally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and evaluate&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;brand partnership opportunities for the reward store, such as gift-with-purchase and co-branded rewards, building the business case by market and aligning with Corporate Partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate and manage&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;vendor relationships end to end, including reference calls and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;as the commercial partner to tech and product, owning the ad-hoc business work (scoping, analysis, requirements, trade-off calls) so delivery keeps moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resolve&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;program issues quickly and with little customer disruption, and support local teams running legacy retention initiatives with strategic and CRM input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who has the ability to shape the customer experience of our Loyalty program, including designing and merchandising strong and exciting gamified experiences, paired with a deep analytical strength, business acumen and (ideally) financial modeling experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years (or equivalent) of professional experience in a fast-paced environment, e.g. agency, tech scale-up, consulting, finance, or e-commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record in loyalty, CRM/Lifecycle Marketing, retention, or subscription business models, with a passion for designing excellent customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong analytical and conceptual problem-solving skills, strategic thinking, and sound business acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling skills and experience holding large models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and measuring business and pricing strategies through experimentation (incl. A/B testing) in data-rich environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mentality, with experience leading multiple parallel workstreams and prioritizing for highest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills and a proven ability to influence stakeholders at all levels, including senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, statistics, or a STEM-related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL or other querying languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern CRM, experimentation, and analytics tooling. Our stack includes Iterable, SFMC, Statsig, Talon.One, Tableau, and Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Machine Operator you will work within our Production and Maintenance Team to operate equipment, perform the automation and preventative maintenance programs at our facilities, and work to ensure operation downtime is kept to a minimum along with routine production activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all required efficiencies are achieved and maintained.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist and give guidance to a team of helpers to ensure production runs are being&amp;nbsp; completed on time, in full, while ensuring quality standards are being met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our Food Safety and Sanitation teams to ensure all automated equipment is meeting regulatory standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate machines to grind, extract, mix, blend, dry, freeze, cook or otherwise process food or beverage products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform&amp;nbsp; pre and post inspection of packaging equipment using the appropriate job plans, procedures, and manuals, in addition to machine calibration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately set up equipment and ensure proper and safe operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete required documentation and run production reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and repair equipment failures to ensure Production downtime is kept to a minimum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor and adjust the process based on upstream and downstream production needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and store department inventory, including consumables and keep accurate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for practicing and adhering to Food Safety, GMP’s (Good Manufacturing Practices) and Health and Safety policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for practicing and adhering to Hello Fresh policies and best practices, including ensuring best possible product quality for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-secondary Education in Mechanical or Electro-Mechanical Engineering Diploma or equivalent, or relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ProSeal( GTE/ GTR) and Loma Metal Detectors is an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6 months to 1 year experience operating machinery in a food processing, manufacturing or service industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MHE operation is a plus ((Material Handling Equipment&#39;s e.g walkie, forklift, stacker, reach etc. )&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to stand for prolonged periods of time including regular bending, twisting and walking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in a refrigerated environment (0°C to 4°C)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to push, pull, and lift up to 50lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of attention to detail and accuracy looking consistently for potential food safety or quality deviations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate in English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum requirement of basic computer skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
