&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or GED required, some college preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified to handle electrical components, controls, and HVAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret blueprints, manuals, and schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical and technical maintenance; able to operate power tools, PIT equipment, and service basic mechanical devices and functions safely and effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Versed in GMP/TPM/LEAN/OSHA with strong continuous improvement and project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ammonia, refrigeration, and/or PSM compliance systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in cold environments with some areas of facility at 40⠁F&lt;/li&gt;
