&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the Factor meals brand at a pivotal moment of growth. As one of Canada’s fastest growing and largest ready-to-eat meal brands, Factor is changing the way Canadians think about convenient, nutritious food. We’re looking for an experienced Brand Manager who’s ready to make a meaningful impact. You’ll play a key role in shaping the next chapter of the brand in Canada—working across bold campaigns, cultural moments and high profile partnerships to make Factor a household name.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the local market positioning and key messages for the Factor Meals brand, leveraging local insights and market context to translate the global positioning&amp;nbsp; for local relevance and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the strategy for how Canada goes to market amongst emerging trends in the food and health &amp;amp; wellness space guiding the organization how the brand plays in the context of messaging, partnerships, and retail media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the marketing campaign calendar in Canada including planning and developing both high impact local campaigns and partnering with central teams to scale global campaigns and marketing assets where there is a strong fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the champion for Canada in a matrixed global/local model influencing strategies, campaigns, and resourcing for local needs based on key insights, market nuances, and local performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product marketing strategy and plan to drive product education, build awareness and trial of new product launches and drive average order rate amongst active users. Partner with local product and dietitian teams to bring new product concepts to life grounded in consumer data, helping to position the product and key messages effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee local consumer insights. Execute research and tests to fill in knowledge gaps on the local growth consumer and create actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the media team in brand media channel planning including owning any media sponsorships or integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a seven figure marketing budget as well as track, report, and provide actionable insights on brand performance and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the leadership and coaching of a Sr. Specialist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree in Marketing, Business, or other related field of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of brand or product marketing experience in a Tech, CPG, or DTC business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing direct reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of developing and executing successful marketing campaigns and new product launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a matrixed organization navigating global and local stakeholders with proven ability to&amp;nbsp; influence buy-in to local strategies and needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external agency partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong learning agility and willingness to take on new challenges with resilience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and passion for sports marketing and health &amp;amp; wellness marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces AI and emerging technologies as tools to unlock new ideas, accelerate execution and drive impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Green Chef is the #1 Meal Kit for Eating Clean—and we have ambitious plans to grow. We&#39;re looking for a strategic, entrepreneurial Business Development Manager to build and scale a high-impact partnerships portfolio that drives brand growth, strengthens our premium positioning, and generates revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the full spectrum of partnerships for Green Chef: brand collaborations, influencer programs, joint promotional campaigns with like-minded brands, and revenue-generating initiatives ranging from in-box sampling to health &amp;amp; wellness ecosystem partnerships including health companies &amp;amp; professionals who actively recommend premium nutrition solutions to their patients. The ideal candidate is a self-starter with strong commercial instincts, a passion for brand-building, and the ability to close deals and execute end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports to the Marketing Director of Green Chef and involves close cross-functional collaboration with Marketing Channel Leads, Analytics, Brand Creative, Legal, and Product Marketing. Your work will directly impact customer acquisition, brand visibility, premium positioning, and revenue for HelloFresh&#39;s most premium meal kit offering.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Green Chef&#39;s partnerships strategy end-to-end - identifying, pitching, closing, and scaling brand partnerships, influencer programs, joint promotions, and revenue-generating collaborations that accelerate growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Build and manage an influencer program spanning paid partnerships, gifting, and ambassador relationships that authentically extend Green Chef&#39;s reach among health-conscious, premium audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Develop revenue-generating partnerships - including in-box sampling, co-marketing campaigns, and paid placements with aligned brands -- managing pipeline from prospecting through contract and campaign execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Cultivate health &amp;amp; wellness ecosystem partnerships with concierge health companies, RDs, functional medicine practitioners, and other medical professionals who recommend premium nutrition solutions to their patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Identify and pitch co-promotional opportunities with external brands that share Green Chef&#39;s premium, health-forward positioning to drive awareness, trial, and new customer acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Manage external partners and internal collaborators to deliver high-impact campaigns from concept through execution and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Develop, brief, and review creative assets and messaging, ensuring alignment with brand and performance goals across all partnership activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Track KPI performance across initiatives - revenue, new customer acquisition, brand lift—using data and insights to guide strategy and optimizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Stay informed on industry trends, competitor strategies, and emerging partnership models to fuel innovation and differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven closer: track record of independently identifying, pitching, and executing partnerships that delivered measurable commercial results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencer-fluent: hands-on experience building and managing influencer programs across tiers (nano through macro), with an understanding of what drives authentic, scalable content and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial: resourceful, self-directed, and energized by building from scratch—comfortable with ambiguity and quick to move from idea to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially sharp: you think in business cases, not just activations; you can model revenue potential and present a clear ROI rationale to internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator: you can autonomously prepare pitches and proposals for external partners and internal leadership alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven: you track and analyze partnership performance and use insights to optimize your portfolio continuously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative: you thrive in a cross-functional environment and can drive alignment across Marketing, Legal, Finance, and Creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented: you focus on outcomes—revenue generated, customers acquired, brand equity built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable: You thrive in fast-paced environments and stay flexible in the face of changing priorities, consistently delivering under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in business development, partnerships, influencer marketing, or growth marketing, preferably at a premium consumer brand or agency with a focus on D2C/eCommerce/subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,105&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,550 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy, you will shape the economics behind our global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit company, active in 17 countries across 3 continents. You will shape how millions of customers experience our product, driving one of the company’s most impactful levers of growth: pricing and discounts. Challenges you’ll solve include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is the right price positioning in each of our markets?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we acquire customers more cost-efficiently?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we design incentives that encourage customers to spend more with HelloFresh?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we leverage AI tooling to arrive at pricing insights and solutions faster than ever before?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be part of the Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy Team, shaping pricing and discount strategy across our full global portfolio which includes our core brand, HelloFresh, as well as: Factor, GreenChef, EveryPlate, Chef&#39;s Plate, and Youfoodz. You’ll work closely with stakeholders from multiple countries and teams such as Product, Marketing Analytics, and Paid Marketing — making this a unique opportunity to combine strategic thinking, analytical depth, and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape market strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor performance and competitor landscapes across our key markets, and translate insights into actionable price &amp;amp; discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run and scale experiments: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, align, and execute A/B tests that validate new pricing and promotional approaches, and ensure learnings are rigorously captured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own key initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end responsibility for selected projects — from framing the problem and aligning stakeholders, to delivering impact through execution and tracking results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build frameworks &amp;amp; playbooks: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop best practices, toolkits, and scalable approaches that improve how we set prices and run promotions across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize processes with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Pricing Analytics and Product to adapt AI use cases within our pricing and discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel (SQL is a plus) with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for exploring opportunities to leverage AI-based workflow tools to optimize internal processes and improve speed to insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
