&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–6 years of experience in supply chain operations, master data management, product or ingredient development, or a closely related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of owning and improving complex, cross-functional processes with multiple stakeholders across an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Excel and Google Sheets; familiarity with supply planning or ERP systems (e.g., Jira, or equivalent tools) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills and the ability to manage high-volume, detail-intensive work with a high degree of accuracy and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Supply Chain, Business, Operations, Food Science, or a related field — or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
