&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1002&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;5491 Timberlea Blvd. Mississauga, L4W 2T6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Monday to Friday from 3:00pm to 11:00pm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a full-time Manufacturing Supervisor at our Mississauaga Distribution Centre. You will report to the Manufacturing Manager and will be responsible for the products that we manufacture in-house, ensuring an on-time, in full, top-quality product, and a manufacturing process that is safe and efficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise a team of automation technicians and associates, running a 7 days operation, where you will focus on building a culture of safety and high performance through developing and coaching the team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for achieving the weekly production plan on time and in full while optimizing operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer experience through low error rates on product quality, and best-in-class product look &amp;amp; feel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high standards of Good Manufacturing Procedures and housekeeping in the production facility to ensure a safe work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the resident expert on our manufacturing processes and automated equipment, and drive adherence to standard operating procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to the manufacturing budget, as established with the Director of Production, Manufacturing Manager, and manufacturing Sr Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to review manufacturing performance, and seek out opportunities for operational improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate root-cause analysis and implement corrective actions to prevent recurring operational issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary escalation point for severe equipment malfunctions, guiding the team through complex troubleshooting and coordinating major repairs or component replacements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the technical competencies of your team and design targeted training programs to upskill Leads, Automation Technicians, and Operators on machine operation, troubleshooting, and safety protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the performance of direct reports by setting clear expectations and measurable KPIs, conducting regular 1-on-1s, and providing actionable feedback to support their career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent in business, engineering, or equivalent work experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience managing production in a manufacturing plant; preferably within the Food &amp;amp; Beverage industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven mindset, to collect and use data to drive sustainable improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, and a can-do attitude. Used to working in a high pressure, fast paced, and constantly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and self-motivation. We seek a leader who has the burning desire to make a meaningful difference in our business and lives of our employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An authentic leader, who’s able to build strong relationships, clearly communicate and motivate, and drive accountability in all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective collaborator, who empowers and enables others to share ideas, raises awareness, gets buy-in, and and delivers fast and well-rounded solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple projects and assignments. Able to prioritize and meet budgets deadlines and achieve objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications and/or licenses with Lean Six Sigma preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift, push, and pull up to 50 lbs and perform physically demanding work, including prolonged standing, walking, bending, squatting, and twisting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in refrigerated environments (0°C to 4°C)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Material Handling Equipment (MHE) certification considered an asset; ability to operate equipment as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible to work overtime, weekends, evenings, and holidays as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for food!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Mississauga, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$58,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$68,800 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;As a Marketing Business&amp;nbsp; Analyst in the Reactivation Analytics team, you will join the wider Global Marketing Analytics group. You will act as a strategic consultant, using data to understand customer behaviour, their journey and more importantly what motivates them to return. Your experience in CRM Analytics, combined with a knack for storytelling through data, will directly influence the ability to reduce churn impact and optimize our channels along with marketing spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Global Reactivations Marketing function: understand key business questions, translate them into analytical tasks, and deliver insights that inform strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve reporting and visualization assets that support day-to-day decision-making and enhance global performance oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure, benchmark, and monitor Global Reactivation performance, identifying trends and opportunities to improve key customer and business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve analytical processes by advocating for scalable, automated, and standardized solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilise various databases and querying/programming languages to access, manipulate and present the data needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will not only take responsibility of own projects, but also be a team player to collaborate and share knowledge with other analysts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A motivated, collaborative mindset with strong team-working skills and enthusiasm for solving business problems with data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in customer Engagement/ Retention metrics and how they contribute to overall business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, results-oriented approach with the ability to break down broad questions into clear analytical steps of experience in Customer Analytics, Marketing Analytics, A/B testing or in a quantitative field—ideally in a fast-paced B2C or subscription business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leveraging AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, etc.) to increase personal and team productivity in day-to-day analytical work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in technical skills, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL and Spreadsheets (required), Tableau or a similar visualisation tool (e.g. Looker, PowerBI), Python (a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp; in testing&amp;nbsp; (AB testing,&amp;nbsp; campaign analytics, channel efficiency )&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in statistical modeling, regression, clustering, time series etc is good to have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in performing analysis with large datasets and knowing what the common pitfalls are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and critical thinking combined with good presentation and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problems solving skills and hands-on &amp;amp; can-do attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Auckland, New Zealand, the Marketing Manager will report to the Associate Director Brand for Meal Kits ANZ, working as part of a team that is responsible for bringing the HelloFresh brand strategy and go-to-market plan to life in fresh, creative ways in New Zealand. Excitingly, frequent travel to Australia is required as part of this role, to work closely with our Sydney team. This is a full-time, permanent role, starting from Oct 1 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious and passionate marketer that wants to help shape and change the way people eat forever. Most of all, someone that will enrich our team at HelloFresh.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences. So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d love and thrive in this role, we would really like to hear from you and learn more about you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and hands-on execution of HelloFresh New Zealand marketing plans, becoming an expert on the local consumer, media, and food category landscape while balancing global stakeholder requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to an integrated brand calendar, working with local/global creative, brand, and product teams while integrating campaigns across marketing channels (SEO, influencer, paid social, direct sales, etc.) to drive wider goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the HelloFresh ANZ Product Marketing Lead to support, deliver, and seamlessly integrate product marketing as part of broader brand activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the HelloFresh customer at the heart of everything, supporting performance, CRM, direct sales, and CX teams with customer-focussed creative and comms briefing to reinforce the brand value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day agency relationships (creative, PR, media) and central ATL teams to write insight-led briefs, develop media strategies, and execute localized brand activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end creative production of campaigns and autonomously deliver locally- and globally-led brand partnerships, collaborating with central teams and local culinary, product, growth, and ops functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and track the HelloFresh New Zealand brand budget, maintaining accurate records and processing spend to deliver world-class activity on time and to budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver post-campaign analysis and reports, sharing the impact of marketing activity on business and brand KPIs alongside recommendations and hypotheses to test for future brand activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have/are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about food and the HelloFresh brand, immensely curious about future possibilities, and driven to bring an innovative, ambitious approach to brand marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive marketing knowledge (ideally brand/digital), with a solid understanding of tailoring cross-channel communication to increase brand salience, love, and consideration while balancing data to inform planning and decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding and track record in delivering end-to-end ATL activity, including media strategies, media plans, and executing creative and comms to deliver on plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with exceptional influencing skills (written/verbal) to navigate a global organisation across multiple functions, products, and local and central teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural talent for inspiring exceptional creativity, writing clear, simple, insight-driven briefs (often at pace for topical/trending opportunities), and making space for creatives to do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management skills and a highly organised approach to keep clear WIP and budget documentation, working cross-functionally to deliver on time and to budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously to drive an ambitious brand plan agenda, ensuring stakeholders are brought in at relevant stages, while remaining an accountable, proactive, solution-oriented team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data literate, analytical, and structured in problem solving—including problem definition, hypothesis development, testing, analysis, evaluation of results, and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; benefits - 70% off HelloFresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to ClassPass corporate membership - 33 credits per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;1st October 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role. You must have the right to work full-time in Australia/New Zealand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Penrose, Auckland - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(( #LI-Hybrid))&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high performing, driven individual to join our supply chain operations team. You will have category/sub-category ownership of our inbound operations and report into the Supply Chain Manager. This is the perfect role for someone to advance their career in supply chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and improve our inbound supply chain operations to ensure our ingredients arrive in full and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise inbound processes and identify cross-functional efficiencies, proactively minimising the impact to our end to end operation and more importantly our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and transform the function through project delivery, setting out clear course of actions to achieve defined outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently analyse internal data to generate ideas, support alternative solutions and provide clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimise costs through effective planning and waste management, recognise and propose new practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise the weekly ordering and forecasting processes, mitigating risks and thinking outside the box to formulate creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own relationships with external suppliers, working closely with procurement and technical teams to manage costs and onboard suppliers. Report on and manage supplier performance effectively to elevate the operational standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and monitor KPIs, balancing day-to-day operations with long term strategic objectives. Skillfully prioritise tasks, delegating where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively with internal teams including Inventory Management, Warehouse, Transport, Planning, Labour Management, Finance, Marketing ensuring timely and accurate information is shared.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop significant expertise, skills and knowledge to be the voice and influence for supply chain operations across the wider business. Coach and guide team members to deliver optimal outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrable experience in Supply Chain Operations, ideally in a similar industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are incredibly resilient and operate well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think on your feet and find quick and efficient solutions to resolve problems with minimal impact to internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a self-starter with initiative and a proactive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are not afraid to challenge the status-quo with new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a confident decision-maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find the perfect balance between bigger picture thinking and digging for the detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embrace change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a role model that excites and motivates other team members with your passion for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are hungry to learn new things every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in excel and data manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office!&lt;br&gt;● Eye care scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hours: &lt;/strong&gt;Monday - Friday, Flexible to work weekends (approx once every 6 weeks)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Gestalte den neuen Factor_-Standort in Verden mit.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_, eine Marke von HelloFresh, sucht dich als Mechatroniker Instandhaltung (all genders)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Unser neuer Produktionsstandort in &lt;strong&gt;Verden&lt;/strong&gt; ist erst seit diesem Frühjahr in Betrieb – und genau jetzt ist der richtige Zeitpunkt, Teil unserer Erfolgsgeschichte zu werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Gemeinsam sorgen wir dafür, dass unsere frischen Factor_-Mahlzeiten jeden Tag zuverlässig produziert werden. Dafür suchen wir Menschen, die gerne anpacken, technische Herausforderungen mögen und Verantwortung übernehmen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Bei uns erwartet dich kein eintöniger Arbeitsalltag. Du arbeitest an modernen Produktionsanlagen, Fördertechnik und Gebäudetechnik und bist Teil eines kleinen, eingespielten Team, das den Standort aktiv weiterentwickelt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wartung, Reparatur und Instandhaltung unserer Produktionsanlagen und technischen Einrichtungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fehler analysieren und Störungen schnell und nachhaltig beheben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produktionsanlagen, Fördertechnik sowie Gebäudetechnik betreuen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit externen Dienstleistern und Handwerksfirmen zusammenarbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wartungsarbeiten dokumentieren und Verbesserungen im technischen Bereich einbringen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gemeinsam mit dem Team für eine sichere und zuverlässige Produktion sorgen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine abgeschlossene technische oder handwerkliche Ausbildung, z. B. als Elektroniker, Mechatroniker, Industriemechaniker oder vergleichbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude daran, praktisch zu arbeiten und technische Probleme zu lösen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (mindestens B2)&lt;/strong&gt;, da die Kommunikation mit externen Dienstleistern und Handwerksfirmen Teil des Arbeitsalltags ist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft zur Arbeit im Schichtsystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Englischkenntnisse sind von Vorteil, aber keine Voraussetzung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Interne Schulungen und ein jährliches Budget für deine persönliche und berufliche Weiterbildung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_-Boxen:&lt;/strong&gt; Exklusive Mitarbeiterrabatte auf unsere leckeren Factor_-Mahlzeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergütung &amp;amp; Urlaub:&lt;/strong&gt; Wettbewerbsfähiges Gehalt sowie 30 bezahlte Urlaubstage pro Jahr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&lt;/strong&gt; Zugang zu Wellbeing-Initiativen – bald ergänzt durch attraktive Fitnessangebote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zukunft &amp;amp; Flexibilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir arbeiten kontinuierlich daran, unser Benefit-Portfolio zu erweitern – u. a. mit Mobilitätsunterstützung und betrieblicher Altersvorsorge, um dir noch mehr Sicherheit und Flexibilität zu bieten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/p&gt;
