&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for assisting in the creation of meal kits for our customers. This position is pivotal in ensuring the smooth and efficient production of our meal kits, whilst ensuring that the Health &amp;amp; Safety and Food Safety standards are met. This role will be titled as a Quality Control Auditor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with Food Safety and Health &amp;amp; Safety standards, actively cooperating with HelloFresh on health and safety matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strictly adhere to established procedures during rejected item handling, ensuring consistency and efficiency in the quality control process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an organized workspace to enhance efficiency and facilitate a seamless workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the collection and documentation of rejection data for quality performance metrics and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in root cause projects, applying basic problem-solving skills and collaborating with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergo cross-training to gain knowledge in handling various rejected items across different stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and escalate issues to quality control team leaders, addressing deviations promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with team leaders for insights, discussing challenges, and contributing to process improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communicator (proficient English levels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic numeracy and computer skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 1 year experience working in a warehouse or similar environment, but not mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent teamwork collaborates effectively with team members and other departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and follow instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced environment while maintaining a high level of professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
