&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Warsaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a new R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Poland and are looking for people who want to make a real impact from day one. You’ll be part of a globally connected team, helping to shape the culture and ways of working at our new location. This is a hands-on role in a supportive environment, where collaboration, learning, and adaptability are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value practical problem-solving, diverse perspectives, and people who take ownership. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to meaningful projects and help lay the foundation for a growing team, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced People Technology Senior Integrations Specialist to join our HelloFresh People Technology team. This role represents the senior individual contributor level within the Integrations and Engineering discipline and is designed for specialists who can independently deliver complex technical solutions across our People Technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, the role has a strong focus on Workday integrations and connected enterprise systems. Over time, the scope will increasingly extend across system-agnostic integrations, workflow automation, software and low-code development, and AI-enabled solutions. You will take end-to-end responsibility for designing, building, operating, and supporting reliable, secure, and scalable solutions across global environments, using the most appropriate technology for the problem rather than being limited to a single platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines deep hands-on engineering with mature operational ownership. You will work across Workday, APIs, middleware and emerging engineering capabilities, and will contribute to automation, intelligent workflows and AI-enabled solutions where these create practical value. You will act as a senior point of expertise for incidents and changes, applying judgement to diagnose root causes, manage risk and drive permanent fixes. While you will not define the overall engineering architecture or platform strategy, you will contribute actively to technical standards, patterns, quality improvements and the evolution of the discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end lifecycle of complex integrations and technical solutions across Workday and connected internal or external systems, from design and build through to production support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test and maintain solutions using appropriate engineering tools and patterns, including Workday Studio, EIBs, APIs, middleware, orchestration, scripting or low-code capabilities where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve workflow automation, intelligent integrations and AI-enabled solutions that reduce manual effort, improve employee technology experiences or increase the effectiveness of People Technology operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted engineering practices responsibly to improve development speed, testing, troubleshooting, documentation and solution quality, while respecting security, privacy and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex integration and engineering incidents, analysing logs, payloads, timing, data mappings and system behaviour to identify root causes and implement durable fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions meet requirements for data accuracy, security, performance, resilience and maintainability, including during cyclical or high-risk activity such as payroll, benefits processing or major organisational changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the definition and continuous improvement of engineering standards, integration patterns, reusable components, runbooks and testing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Functional, Product and Operations colleagues to clarify requirements, evaluate technical options, understand dependencies and translate business needs into practical engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and adopt relevant capabilities across the Workday ecosystem, including Workday Orchestrate, Extend / Build and future platform innovations, alongside appropriate external enterprise technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high-quality technical documentation and apply sound software engineering practices across solution design, testing, version control, deployment and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support more junior technical specialists, sharing engineering knowledge and helping raise capability across integrations, automation and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 5–8 years of experience in integrations, systems engineering, software engineering or related technical roles, with significant responsibility for delivering and supporting live enterprise solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience designing, building and supporting Workday integrations, or equivalent integrations on enterprise HR platforms, combined with the ability to work beyond a single application or vendor ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of integration and software engineering technologies such as APIs, REST/SOAP, XML, JSON, middleware, event or workflow orchestration, scripting, flat files, SFTP and encryption mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying software engineering practices such as reusable design, version control, automated or structured testing, deployment discipline and maintainable technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow automation, AI-assisted development or AI-enabled solutions in an enterprise technology environment, or a strong ability to rapidly develop capability in these areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise data models, interface dependencies, failure modes and the security, privacy and compliance requirements associated with sensitive employee data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to diagnose and resolve complex technical issues spanning multiple systems, vendors and integration patterns, and to drive durable rather than tactical fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently on ambiguous and complex problems, evaluate technical options, apply sound judgement and recognise when architectural concerns should be escalated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and partnering skills, with the ability to explain technical issues clearly to non-technical stakeholders and collaborate effectively across Product, Functional and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relevant degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering or a related field, or equivalent practical experience, with curiosity and a continuous-learning mindset towards emerging engineering and AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required; additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health - &lt;/strong&gt;You’re covered from your first day with&amp;nbsp; private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working - &lt;/strong&gt;We work in-office 3 days a week to align on goals, with flexible hours to support work-life balance and personal needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off - &lt;/strong&gt;You receive 26 days of paid vacation each year, providing you time to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development - &lt;/strong&gt;An annual Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and a Mentoring Program to support your ongoing professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Referral Program - &lt;/strong&gt;Our team members can take part in our internal employee referral program and receive a bonus for recommending successful candidates to open roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Comforts - &lt;/strong&gt;Free coffee, drinks, and fresh fruit are available to keep you refreshed throughout the day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Photographer in the HelloFresh Studio, you are part of our Photography team, working across food, product, lifestyle, and marketing productions. You combine strong technical photography skills with a creative eye to produce high-quality visual content that meets HelloFresh&#39;s commercial and brand standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Producers, Styling, Culinary, Creative, and Post-Production teams, you deliver high-quality photography while continuously improving your craft, embracing emerging technologies, and contributing to efficient, scalable production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-quality food, product, lifestyle, and marketing photography across multiple productions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute shoots according to creative briefs, photographic guidelines, and brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Styling, Culinary, Producers, Creative, and Post-Production teams to ensure successful productions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistency, efficiency, and quality across high-volume content production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Studio AI initiatives by adopting AI-assisted and hybrid production workflows and contributing practical feedback for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously develop your technical skills while identifying opportunities to improve quality and production efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in commercial photography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating technical and creative photography skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of lighting, composition, camera systems, and commercial photography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in generative AI and emerging photography technologies, with willingness to adopt new workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, collaboration, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, proactive, and solutions-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please include a portfolio of your recent and relevant work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_&lt;/strong&gt; a brand of HelloFresh is seeking a Forklift Operator. The Forklift Operator receives product for the day’s production and transports materials safely and efficiently to the appropriate areas of the facility. The Forklift Operator also picks product from inventory as needed, makes adjustments on the computer, and adheres to all safety protocols.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will….&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loading, unloading, shipping, and receiving warehouse items.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transporting materials to different locations within the facility.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimizing loads to ensure operational efficiency.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Securing loads to the machine before transportation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspecting for damages to vehicles.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating and managing technical equipment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picking and wrapping orders for shipment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identifying workplace safety hazards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adhering to safety management standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adhering to production schedules.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High school diploma or GED&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Valid fork-lifting certificate preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent hand-eye coordination.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency in operating technical machinery and RF scanners.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good physical condition.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mathematical aptitude.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good organizational skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to detail.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good written and verbal communication.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
