&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with proven ability to multitask, work under pressure, and meet time sensitive deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data driven- curious about what insights can be derived from numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly adaptable- you thrive in a fast-paced, high-change and dynamic work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
