&lt;p&gt;We are on the hunt for a motivated, analytical problem-solver to join our production team! The Production Coordinator is responsible for supporting and developing our production projects aimed at increasing efficiency and process improvement. You will support Production Supervisors and work closely with the Operations Manager. The ideal candidate is curious, analytical, and process driven. You will be employed at our Brampton distribution facility and will report to the Operations Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
