&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_ &lt;/strong&gt;a brand of HelloFresh is seeking a Quality Assurance Associate.&amp;nbsp; The Quality Assurance Associate audits our production processes to ensure our customers receive a safe, high-quality product.&amp;nbsp; This position completes various inspections on the quality of fresh produce and the inclusion of all required ingredients. Attention to detail and the ability to work independently are key for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain proper sanitation and personal hygiene practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete audits at a designated cadence during various steps of the production process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure food safety standards are met at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow and enforce strict manufacturing policies and procedures involving allergen control, Organic and Gluten segregation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify completeness and accuracy of daily production documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete daily sanitation, facility, and quality documents as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with cross-functional team(s) to place unacceptable ingredients on hold or non-conforming product received at facility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor temperatures of ingredients and storage locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Routine testing and swabbing of production areas to ensure accuracy of sanitation procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promptly communicate all safety related issues and concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High School Diploma, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, write, and speak English proficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous food, grocery, or restaurant experience preferred, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to 7 different Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) including those for BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Illinois Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;QA Officer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be right at the heart of the action in &lt;strong&gt;Karawatha, Brisbane&lt;/strong&gt;. Reporting directly to the Quality Assurance Manager, you will take full ownership of hands-on quality verification, uphold plant compliance, and safeguard world-class food safety standards across every operational shift. If you are eager to learn, make an immediate impact, and grow your career this is the perfect opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor Quality Controller and operational staff verification activities, including daily CCP audits, highlighting issues in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee general plant GMP and conduct pre-operational checks post-cleaning to verify effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate non-conforming products, foreign objects, and raw material defects through root cause analysis and risk assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver toolbox training, coaching, and mentoring to production and packing staff across departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise corrective action reports for major process deviations and follow up to ensure resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct handover discussions with incoming QC/QA staff and submit daily reports to management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform internal audits, calibration, and sanitation verification activities across 24/7 rotating shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have/are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 1 year of practical food industry experience in QA/QC roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound knowledge and practical application of HACCP, GMP, and GFSI standards (e.g., BRC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office applications (Excel, Word, Outlook), Google Sheets, and AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, root cause analysis, proactivity, and risk assessment skills across all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full availability and flexibility to commit to a 24/7 rotating roster covering morning, afternoon, and night shifts across Monday to Sunday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Food Science/Technology or related field (desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love Working With Us…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a Genuine Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive real change and help elevate quality standards at one of the world&#39;s fastest-growing food tech pioneers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Your Career: &lt;/strong&gt;Unlock clear growth pathways and dynamic internal mobility across our operational and quality divisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great Rewards: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy weekly pay paired with fantastic, long-term perks that come with working for a leading global brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Discounts: &lt;/strong&gt;Save big with an exclusive 40% discount on Youfoodz products for you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free Onsite Meals: &lt;/strong&gt;Fuel your shift with delicious, fresh meals provided free of charge on duty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hassle-Free Commute: &lt;/strong&gt;Take advantage of convenient, free on-site parking at our Karawatha facility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Benefit from tailored shift-rotation training, ongoing skill development, and structured career progression pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available (notice periods accepted)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full-time role (Must have full work rights in Australia)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Karawatha, Brisbane - Onsite Parking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#youfoodz #LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;(EDM) 36 Ave &amp;amp; 8th St, Nisku&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Quality Control Associate you will take a hands-on approach to maintaining and continuously improving our product quality control processes. Reporting to the Supervisor, Quality Control , you will play a key role in ensuring our Production Associates have all essential high-quality ingredients required to make delicious and safe&amp;nbsp; meal kits for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive inbounding and inventory SKUs from the Warehouse department and conduct quality control inspections to ensure products adhere to required specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Warehouse team to achieve quality targets, in addition to performing regular inspections on packaged products for lot codes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to Quality and/or BBD issues on the production lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear and concise communication with the Operations, Procurement, and Logistics teams; in cases of product non-conformance, alongside maintaining a photo database of product non-conformances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead production associates for ingredient sorting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality control inspections on work-in-progress and finished products to ensure products meet Company Standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy and efficiency at designated ship-out stations, and complete logs and records as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct environmental monitoring and equipment calibration verification, (Environmental sampling &amp;amp; ATP swabbing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support to FSQA Supervisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Quality Assurance inspections as they pertain to Finished Product, Raw Materials, Water and Cleaning &amp;amp; Sanitation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform sensory on shelf stable raw materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor PRPs and PC&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all Out of Spec findings, as they pertain to the aforementioned, are addressed through the procedures as they pertain to &quot;Deviation, Corrective Action &amp;amp; Preventative Measures&quot;, &quot;Food Safety Assessment&quot; and &quot;Product Holds&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct internal inspection on a periodic basis, i.e. GMP audits and pre operational inspections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure water samples are sent out to Accredited Laboratories on a periodic basis for analytical testing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support to the management teams in troubleshooting and resolving problems in the Production Process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure GMPs and Management of allergens is followed as per procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure spillages are cleaned up immediately to eliminate the potential for cross contamination of allergens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-secondary education in Biological, Chemical or Food Sciences diploma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 Months to 1 year experience working in QC/QA in a food processing, manufacturing or service industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to push, pull, and lift up to 50lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience with standing for prolonged periods of time including regular bending, twisting and walking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the Safe Food for Canadians Regulations and GFSI schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in a refrigerated environment (0°C to 4°C)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate in English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with MS Office, Google Apps and comfortable learning new technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize, remain calm and alert while multitasking in a fast-paced and deadline oriented environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and within a team environment, in addition to having strong interpersonal skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level 1 First Aid is considered an asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
