&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Quality Control Associate you will take a hands-on approach to maintaining and continuously improving our product quality control processes and monitoring our food safety requirements. Reporting to the Supervisor, you will play a key role in ensuring our customers are being provided with safe, great tasting meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive inbounding and inventory SKUs from the Warehouse department and conduct quality control inspections to ensure products adhere to required specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear and concise communication with the Operations, Procurement, and Logistics teams; in cases of product non-conformance, alongside maintaining a photo database of product non-conformances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality control inspections on raw materials, work-in-progress and finished products to ensure products meet Company Standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct environmental monitoring through swabbing and equipment calibration verification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor GMPs are followed by all employees and Management of allergens is followed as per procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance of products with regulatory requirements through monitoring of product labeling, CCPs and PRPs as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate reports and records (e.g. CCP &amp;amp; PCP records, line verification records, GMPs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input and verify data in QA tracking systems (e.g., Google Sheets, QA App, IMT, WMS, Datalit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address quality concerns and best before date (BBD ) issues on the production lines as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all Out of Spec findings are managed according to established procedures, including Deviation, Corrective Action &amp;amp; Preventative Measures, Food Safety Assessments and Product Holds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist management team in troubleshooting and resolving problems within the Production Process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform additional tasks as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-secondary education in Biological, Chemical or Food Sciences diploma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 Months to 1 year experience working in QC/QA in a food processing, manufacturing or service industry; experience with RTE product is an asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physically capable and willing to push, pull, and lift up to 50lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with standing for extended&amp;nbsp; periods of time and performing regular bending, twisting and walking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the Safe Food for Canadians Regulations and GFSI schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in a refrigerated environment (0°C to 4°C)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills in English, both verbal and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with MS Office, Google Apps and comfortable learning new technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize, remain calm and alert while multitasking in a fast-paced and deadline oriented environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and within a team environment, in addition to having strong interpersonal skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level 1 First Aid is considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Shift premiums are available for afternoon and overnight shifts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;75% discount on HelloFresh or Chefs Plate weekly box subscription&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;High impact work to help feed thousands of families in Canada&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to learn and grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with a hard-working and supportive team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
