&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Schichtleiter Warehouse Operations (all genders) sorgst Du dafür, dass im Tagesgeschäft im Lager reibungslos läuft und die Unternehmensziele zuverlässig erreicht werden. Du behältst jederzeit den Überblick über sämtliche Abläufe, Ressourcen sowie Prioritäten und stellst sicher, dass Dein Team Prozesse strukturiert, effizient&amp;nbsp; und produktiv umsetzt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zusätzlich übernimmst Du Verantwortung für eine starke Sicherheits- sowie Qualitätskultur und gewährleistest, dass Standards eingehalten und kontinuierlich weiterentwickelt werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung: &lt;/strong&gt;Führung und Coaching von Zeitarbeitskräften inklusive Einsatzplanung und Aufgabenverteilung zur Erreichung aller relevanten Schicht-KPIs sowie Unterstützung&amp;nbsp; der Weiterentwicklung der Mitarbeitenden durch regelmäßiges, konstruktives Feedback und die Förderung einer produktiven, kollegialen Teamkultur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operatives Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Sicherstellung möglichst reibungsloser Abläufe im Lager, Optimierung des Ressourceneinsatzes zur kontinuierlichen Erreichung der Produktionsziele in Zusammenarbeit mit verschiedenen Stakeholdern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prozessoptimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Kontinuierliche Analyse und Verbesserung der operativen Prozesse und damit verbundenen Kennzahlen zur Steigerung von Effizienz, Produktivität und Kosteneffektivität&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOPs &amp;amp; Standardisierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Entwicklung, Implementierung und Überwachung von Standardarbeitsanweisungen (SOPs) in Zusammenarbeit mit funktionsübergreifenden Teams und dem Learning &amp;amp; Development-Bereich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Durchführung von Audits zur nachhaltigen Sicherung der Standards für Lebensmittelsicherheit sowie Arbeits- und Gesundheitsschutz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Umgang mit operativen Herausforderungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Eigenständige Durchführung von Problemlösungsmaßnahmen und bei Bedarf gezielte Eskalation an den Operations Lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektmanagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Leitung / Unterstützung von Ad-hoc-Projekten und Koordination der Service- und Supportfunktionen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossenes Studium / Ausbildung im Bereich Wirtschaft/Logistik Supply Chain Management oder einem verwandten&amp;nbsp; Bereich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Logistik, einem Distributionszentrum, der Produktion bzw. einem vergleichbaren operativen Umfeld und fundiertes Verständnis für Lager- oder Produktionsprozessen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicheres Anwenden von&amp;nbsp; Software- und Systemlösungen in verschiedenen Anwendungsbereichen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der fortgeschrittenen Datenanalyse mit Tools wie Excel, Google Sheets, Grafana oder Tableau sowie in der Interpretation&amp;nbsp; von Daten zur Unterstützung von Geschäftsentscheidungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte Arbeitsweise und souveräner Umgang mit parallel zueinander anfallenden Aufgaben sowie wechselnden Prioritäten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- (mind. C1 Niveau) und gute Englischkenntnisse (mind. B2 Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vor allem suchen wir Menschen, die HelloFresh besser machen. Wir lieben vielfältige Erfahrungen und glauben, dass es viele Wege gibt, Fähigkeiten zu entwickeln.&amp;nbsp;Wenn Du also nicht alle Kriterien erfüllst, aber glaubst, in dieser Rolle überzeugen zu können, möchten wir gerne mehr über Dich erfahren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt; mit tollem Team in Hannover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt; durch interne Trainings sowie ein jährliches Team-Budget für Weiterbildung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote&lt;/strong&gt; bei EGYM Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt; durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen monatlichen Zuschuss zum Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist Du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören. Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1005&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#lastmilehannover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Customer Care team&lt;/strong&gt; is the voice of HelloFresh at the moments that matter most: when something has gone wrong and a customer needs more than a standard fix. As a &lt;strong&gt;Second Line Support Agent&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll take on the cases that first-line support can&#39;t resolve alone: food safety incidents, complex complaints, and escalations from across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also be one of the public faces of HelloFresh, responding to customers on social media and review platforms where everyone can see how we show up for people. It&#39;s a role that mixes hands-on problem-solving with real visibility, and you&#39;ll work closely with teams like Quality Assessment (QA), Legal, PR, and Marketing to make sure every case is handled with care and urgency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some days you&#39;re fully dedicated to either second line or social media, other days you&#39;ll combine both.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Native Dutch speaker required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hours per week&lt;/strong&gt;: 24 - 32 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working hours&lt;/strong&gt;: weekdays, weekends, and evenings (shifts typically run 11:00–19:30 or 12:30–21:00)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Available, and details to be discussed during interview process&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reach out proactively&lt;/strong&gt; to customers affected by a variety of incidents, and gather the information needed to resolve each case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Determine and issue appropriate compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing customer happiness with company guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report food safety incidents&lt;/strong&gt; to the FSQA team to support broader quality tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle cases escalated &lt;/strong&gt;by first-line agents, QA, Legal, and other internal teams, resolving them directly with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respond&lt;/strong&gt; to comments, DMs, and mentions across Instagram,X, and Facebook with a helpful and engaged tone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage HelloFresh&#39;s presence on review platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, including Google Reviews, Trustpilot, and Klachtencompas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spot sensitive or high-risk social media conversations&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and escalate to PR or Marketing using the escalation guide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing role, ideally including complaint handling or escalation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication skills, with the ability to adapt tone across public and private channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing multiple cases and channels at once without losing attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A calm, empathetic approach to sensitive or high-pressure situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment for knowing when to resolve an issue directly and when to escalate it further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;&lt;em&gt;Benefits at Work&lt;/em&gt;&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2026 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work flexibly with our hybrid setup, plus a €2.45 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset:&amp;nbsp; access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;/strong&gt; If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Accountant who will partner with departments across the organization to analyze and continuously drive improvement in our internal controls and financial reporting processes. Reporting to the Associate Director, Accounting &amp;amp; Taxation, you will act as a business partner to the operations team to assist in weekly, monthly and quarterly reporting of financial results. As part of the Finance team, you will play a key role in the preparation of accurate and timely financial reporting packages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of key areas of the financial statements by collecting and verifying financial information and providing supporting schedules to ensure completeness and accuracy of P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain accurate accounting processes and procedures for inventory, accruals and leases, including IFRS 16 assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with procurement, operation and data teams to continuously drive improvement in our internal controls and financial reporting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a business partner to bridge accounting actuals to budget and forecast in collaboration with FP&amp;amp;A, striving to continuously improve on the transparency of financial results provided to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop and implement processes to accommodate the growth of the Factor brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the interim and year-end internal and external audit requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor intermediate and junior accounting team members, supporting with the teams growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess accounting treatment for new projects and ventures, develop reports and present to management needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Other duties, as assigned &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4 years experience working in full-cycle accounting or experience in Public accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a bachelor’s degree in Finance/Accounting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a CPA designation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong knowledge of IFRS, including technical accounting and reporting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in using Excel (Advanced level), Gemini Pro &amp;amp; Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong interpersonal skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your attention to detail is renowned. You are able to multitask, work under pressure, and meet deadlines. You thrive in a fast-paced work environment. You are a proactive problem-solver: You always look for a better, more efficient way to complete your own and the team’s tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a high-growth company, are interested in food and technology, and are ready to take on significant responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 3 days in office per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$90,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take take ownership of advanced and complex accounting tasks, ensuring the seamless execution of financial operations. This role acts as a key resource in solving escalated issues, streamlining processes, and providing insights to optimize the accounting workflow. The Senior Accounting Coordinator will also mentor junior team members and serve as a subject matter expert on critical finance operations, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle complex invoice processing tasks, including three-way matching for high-value or disputed invoices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve escalations from suppliers or procurement teams, identifying root causes and implementing long-term solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies within accounting processes and propose solutions to streamline workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce and refine financial controls related to inventory, accounts payable, and month-end reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed reconciliations of high-volume accounts, ensuring accuracy and resolving discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and analyze advanced reports on accounts payable status, supplier performance, and financial compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior accountants to ensure the timely completion of close activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of contact for procurement, finance, and other teams to resolve accounting queries and provide expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with external auditors to provide requested documentation and explanations during audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Accounting Coordinators by providing training, troubleshooting support, and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop guides and resources to improve team understanding of best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with internal policies and external regulations across all financial transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in or lead ad-hoc projects aimed at improving operational efficiency or implementing new accounting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Oracle, SAP, or other enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of accounting principles and financial controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and the ability to work with complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced problem-solving skills to resolve escalations and process issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills to collaborate with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor and guide junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in accounts payable, accounting, or financial operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with process improvement initiatives or audit readiness is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
