&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Content Creator - Content Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior AI Content Creator in the HelloFresh Studio, you are part of the AI Content Creation team and play a leading role in developing and scaling AI-powered content creation across mainly photography, but also supporting video, design, and emerging creative formats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine a strong background in commercial visual production with hands-on expertise in generative AI. You have a refined visual eye and strong creative judgment, allowing you to create high-quality content yourself and recognize what makes an image or video successful. Beyond creating individual assets, a key part of your role is translating creative direction and successful approaches into reliable, production-ready workflows that expand the Studio&#39;s AI capabilities. Working closely with art directors, photographers, retouchers, video, design, and tech, you identify where AI can improve creative possibilities, production efficiency, and scale. You help define best practices, evaluate emerging technologies, and continuously develop how AI is used in visual production across the Studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality AI-powered content across commercial photography and video, including lifestyle, food, product, and campaign content, translating creative direction into assets ready for real production and marketing use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and refine AI content creation workflows, prompts, techniques, and reusable approaches using tools such as Krea, Higgsfield, Claude, ComfyUI, and emerging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Art Directors, Photographers, Video, Design, and Post-Production to translate creative concepts and established visual approaches into scalable AI-powered production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your creative judgment and production experience to continuously improve visual quality, realism, consistency, and efficiency across AI-generated content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Workflow Specialists to identify automation opportunities and help turn successful creative processes into scalable or automated content-generation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging AI models, tools, and techniques, testing their practical value and introducing those that meaningfully improve creative output or production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and share best practices, standards, and documentation for AI content creation, and support colleagues in developing their AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay closely connected to developments in generative AI, actively experimenting with new approaches and identifying opportunities to expand what the Studio can create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of professional experience in commercial photography, retouching, art direction, or a closely related visual production discipline&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong understanding of professional photography and/or video production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced hands-on experience creating high-quality visual content with generative AI tools and integrating AI into real creative or production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A refined visual eye and strong creative judgment&lt;/strong&gt;, with an excellent understanding of photography, composition, lighting, colour, visual storytelling, realism, and what makes commercial imagery feel premium and intentional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to interpret creative briefs and translate creative direction into high-quality visual content and repeatable production approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to work effectively across creative, production, and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive, curious, and solution-oriented, with a strong sense of ownership, an experimental mindset, and genuine enthusiasm for emerging AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please include a portfolio of your recent and relevant work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come see what&#39;s cookin&#39; at HelloFresh!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we want to revolutionize the way we eat by making it more convenient and exciting to cook meals from scratch. We have offices all over the world and we deliver delicious meals to millions of people.&lt;br&gt;We are the industry leader in meal-kit subscription services and we&#39;re growing all the time. We have distinct meal-kit services that cater to everyone with the most menu variety in the market, which allows us to reach an incredibly wide population of people.&lt;br&gt;The HelloFresh team is diverse, high-performing, and international, and our work environment is an inspiring space where you can thrive as a result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Sr. Analyst to own the forecasting, budgeting, and spend analytics backbone of our NA Packaging organization. This role sits at the intersection of supply chain data, finance, and packaging engineering — turning demand signals and cost data into the guidance that keeps our packaging supply chain running efficiently across all NA brands. You&#39;ll join a small, collaborative team of analysts and packaging engineers, taking on a broad scope that spans forecasting, cost analytics, and tooling across the full NA portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the annual NA packaging budget — translating supplier plans into material volumes, network plans, and cost/box estimates by brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and validate the weekly in-week demand forecast across all NA brands (HelloFresh, EveryPlate, Green Chef, Factor), driving packaging material ordering and procurement decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead PKG spend analytics — weekly and month-end (MEC) budget vs. expected vs. actuals, variance investigations, and driving corrective actions with ops partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the translation of packaging engineering configurations and network fulfillment requirements into a packaging forecast at all time horizons, leveraged in budgeting cycles, planning cycles, and week-to-week ordering. Measure and improve accuracy through budget cycles and ad hoc scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve the packaging scripts codebase (Databricks, Airflow, Python, Snowflake) and core planning tools (Packaging Allocator, ODL/ADL files)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct cost and supply impact analyses for packaging launches and transitions — new SKU introductions, format changes, fulfillment network shifts and supplier transitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the analytics point of contact bridging Operations Engineering, Procurement, Fulfillment, Logistics, Planning, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical, comfortable owning a forecast model end-to-end with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who can translate cost/variance data into decisions for non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized under pressure — this role sits on the critical path for budget cycles with hard deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive about flagging risk rather than waiting to be asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative across Finance, Supply Chain Analytics, and Packaging Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and stepping into a scope that&#39;s still being defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in supply chain analytics, FP&amp;amp;A, or operations analytics, ideally in packaging, manufacturing, or CPG/food&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Databricks and Snowflake (or equivalent SQL-based platforms); Python and Airflow experience a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel/Google Sheets modeling skills; hands-on experience with COGS or budget variance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with forecasting/demand planning models, ideally in a multi-brand or multi-SKU environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Supply Chain, Analytics, Finance, or related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and comprehensive health, dental, and vision benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off and holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted or complimentary HelloFresh box subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and internal mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, mission-driven culture with real ownership over your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of HelloFresh not to discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, marital status, genetic information, disability or because he or she is a protected veteran.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$75,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$92,583 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Newark, NJ Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$75,750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$92,583 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Analyst to join our Sourcing Enablement Team within Supply Chain Enablement &amp;amp; Insights at HelloFresh. In this role, you will partner closely with purchasing leaders, using data analytics, project management, and strategic communication to drive high-impact sourcing initiatives and optimize our tooling and processes. To succeed, you should thrive on turning ambiguous datasets into actionable business insights, supporting negotiations, and leading cross-functional alignment. We are looking for a proactive problem solver who can dive into complex details and deliver clear, strategic recommendations. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Procurement category leaders to facilitate high-impact sourcing events and manage data analysis for $100M+ in RFP spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize complex datasets into clear, actionable business insights for senior leadership and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, scale, and maintain decision-critical data products and AI tooling to streamline procurement strategy and process management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute rapid, ad-hoc spend and cost analytics to identify savings opportunities and support ongoing category initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent North American team interests in the global rollout of procurement tools, programs, and process enhancements, leading end-to-end adoption by gathering business requirements (BRDs), establishing audit and approval controls, and driving team compliance through training and enforcement mechanisms. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven – You can organize, analyze, and synthesize unstructured data into actionable insights to better inform operational decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious – You have an insatiable desire to understand how things work, why they work the way they do, identify data-driven insights, and consistently challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented – You possess strong organizational skills and consistently demonstrate a methodical approach to all your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter – You are highly motivated and passionate. You’re eager to take on new projects without knowing exactly what you will uncover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile – You thrive in fast-paced and dynamic environments and are comfortable working autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured-thinker – You use logic to identify issues and opportunities to solve complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator – You can explain complex technical information to a variety of audiences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years of relevant work experience in an advanced analytical capacity (preparing complex reports, presentations, and data visualizations) and/or 1-2 years of management consulting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Supply Chain, Business, Math, Engineering, Data/Computer Science, or other relevant areas of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced fluency in spreadsheet modeling and data analytics&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic proficiency in SQL required; advanced SQL and/or Python experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
