&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is seeking a Senior Art Director to shape and create performance-driven creative across Meta, TikTok and YouTube. Working at the intersection of Growth, brand and culture, you&#39;ll turn performance strategy into platform-native creative across video and statics: from concept and visual direction through hands-on design and final execution. This is a player-coach role: you&#39;ll set the visual direction for shoots, talent, creators and food, while also getting into the work yourself: designing, building and iterating assets alongside Copy, Video, Production and Creative Strategy. You&#39;ll bring strong taste and platform fluency while embracing emerging tools to expand what&#39;s creatively possible and scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concept, art direct and design platform-native paid social creative across Meta, TikTok, YouTube and OTT - video-first, but spanning static too - that aligns with brand objectives and drives measurable performance for Growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Growth strategy into compelling visual direction: food styling, set design, talent direction and creator partnerships that feel native to each platform and authentic to our brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with a copywriter to develop strong, cohesive concepts that communicate key messages with clarity and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside a videographer, editor and producer, providing creative direction on set and in post: from prop styling and location scouting through casting and directing talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Creative Strategy and Growth to understand campaign goals, audience, and performance metrics, and iterate creative based on what the data tells us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and analyze content performance to identify creative opportunities and provide actionable recommendations for future work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and maintain a high creative bar across a high-volume pipeline, balancing brand craft with the speed and iteration performance marketing demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance AI-enabled creative workflows across design and static production, using emerging tools to accelerate exploration, iteration and scalable content creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of platform behavior, visual culture and emerging technology, continuously bringing new creative approaches into the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple workstreams simultaneously while maintaining quality, consistency and on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who takes a human-first approach and is highly collaborative&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert in developing creative for social media platforms, their best practices, and the ability to adapt content for different formats and audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in leveraging data and analytics to inform creative decision-making and drive performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance creative: you think in scroll-stop, concept strength and creative efficiency, not just aesthetics, and you know how to use data to make better work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional communicator and presenter with the ability to effectively articulate ideas and collaborate with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to thrive in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment and manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong collaborator with excellent communication skills, and the ability to work effectively with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for creativity and a drive to stay updated with industry trends and emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture fit; someone who interacts with positivity, professionalism, passion, and kindness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’ experience as an Art Director at a creative agency or design-led consumer brand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating expertise in video production and art direction, with a focus on paid social campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of design software and a hands-on approach to the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience being on set, providing live feedback to stylists and videographers, as well as directing talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on-site 4 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in DTC or food and beverage is a major plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working as an Art Director or in a similar creative role, preferably in the digital advertising or social media marketing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; 401k company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave of 16 weeks &amp;amp; PTO policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$0 monthly premium and other flexible health plans effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;85% discount on your subscription to HelloFresh (as well as other product initiatives)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks, cold brew on tap &amp;amp; monthly catered lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company sponsored outings &amp;amp; Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
