&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,935&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Green Chef is the #1 Meal Kit for Eating Clean—and we have ambitious plans to grow. We’re looking for a Senior Associate, CRM to own end-to-end email and SMS execution for the most premium, health focused &amp;amp; sustainable brand in the HelloFresh portfolio. This is a dedicated, brand-embedded role, sitting on the Green Chef marketing team and working in close collaboration with the global CRM team. This role represents a meaningful investment in building Green Chef&#39;s CRM capability as a standalone growth engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be primarily focused on building, QA-ing, deploying, and optimizing flows across Activation and Reactivation customer segments, with future growth potential across other segments. This role is great for builders who enjoy getting things done&amp;nbsp; - with precision, speed, and a continuous drive to improve performance. You will collaborate closely on strategy, and will have a direct impact on some of Green Chef’s largest initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Head of Marketing, Green Chef and collaborates closely with the global HelloFresh CRM team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will …&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Email &amp;amp; SMS Strategy &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Green Chef Growth Managers for Activation &amp;amp; Reactivation, global CRM team and other cross-functional leads to ideate, test, and execute brand-specific growth levers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring cross-market insights and best practices into the Green Chef roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on segmentation strategy and lifecycle targeting to drive conversion across Activation and Reactivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign Build, QA &amp;amp; Deployment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end execution of email and SMS campaigns across all Green Chef segments from build through QA to deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain rigorous quality control across segmentation, personalization, and creative merging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate, on-time delivery against weekly-quarterly campaign goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trigger Flow &amp;amp; Automation Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and manage trigger-based flows and automated customer journeys&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify and implement automation improvements to reduce manual lift and increase campaign velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support technical migrations as part of the broader tooling roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Performance Reporting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly report on CRM channel performance e.g. conversion rates, deliverability, engagement&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive A/B testing across content / creative, segmentation, offers, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into actionable insights and drive a continuous feedback loop of improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Includes identifying white space and incremental growth opportunities, translating into test &amp;amp; initiative roadmaps, and executing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Brand, Creative, and Product Marketing to ensure campaign assets are briefed, planned, and delivered on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics to scope new opportunities for performance improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the CRM point of contact for Green Chef across internal and global stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An exceptional operator:&lt;/strong&gt; you take pride in flawless execution and treat accuracy and timeliness as non-negotiable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-obsessed and process-driven: &lt;/strong&gt;you thrive on operational excellence and bring structure to ambiguous situations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data driven: &lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;re comfortable in channel data, know how to find the story, and communicate it clearly to stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation-minded:&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;re always looking for ways to do more with less manual effort and scale what&#39;s working&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;: you focus on outcomes—revenue generated, customers acquired, and continually push for innovative growth initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong collaborator: &lt;/strong&gt;you work effectively across functions and levels, from day-to-day execution partners to senior leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive and self-directed:&lt;/strong&gt; you identify gaps, flag risks early, and bring solutions, not just problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable: &lt;/strong&gt;you thrive in fast-paced environments and stay flexible when priorities shift&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of CRM or lifecycle marketing experience, with demonstrated success owning campaigns from strategy through execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Salesforce Marketing Cloud (required); Iterable experience a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency across email and SMS channels; experience with in-app and push a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and managing automated journeys, trigger flows, and segmentation logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — comfortable reporting on channel performance, running A/B tests, and generating actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a D2C, subscription, or e-commerce environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$79,538&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,375 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, the goal is to change the way people eat forever by delivering high-quality food across 18 countries and 3 continents. As a global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, the portfolio includes HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, Factor_, and Youfoodz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engaging with HelloFresh in Warsaw means collaborating with HelloTech—a global technology division of over 1,000 people powering an end-to-end food ecosystem. From digital personalization and forecasting to supply chain optimization and food waste reduction, technology drives every step of this direct-to-consumer model.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech operates in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each holding accountability for a specific product domain end to end. In this role you will join an assigned squad, with the flexibility to transition between teams and projects as technical objectives and business priorities evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several technical domains are actively engaging providers. Projects will be aligned based on individual strengths and expertise during the process. Key technical domains include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliveries &amp;amp; Orders / Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Core backend systems turning a subscription into correct physical deliveries for millions of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active Journey:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintaining customer lifecycle stability: features covering habits, subscription management, ordering, and graceful error recovery at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu Personalization &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilizing data and applied science workflows to tailor user interfaces and predict regional consumer demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Supply Chain (SCM):&lt;/strong&gt; Procurement, inventory, labeling, and production systems solving physical-world challenges with software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across all domains, the technical profile consists of highly available, event-driven distributed systems serving global architectures. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain accountability&lt;/strong&gt; for the architecture, design, development, deployment, and operation of microservices under a full DevOps model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the technical lead on backend-heavy product problems&lt;/strong&gt;, designing, building and operating the services and systems needed to deliver them reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build event-driven systems&lt;/strong&gt; utilizing messaging technologies such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, or AWS SQS/SNS, and expose data via clean REST and gRPC interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work extensively&lt;/strong&gt; with Docker, container orchestration via Kubernetes, and CI/CD automated deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain a strong commitment to testing&lt;/strong&gt;, executing robust test suites stretching from unit tests through to full end-to-end coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate closely&lt;/strong&gt; within cross-functional agile teams including product leads, frontend engineers, designers, and data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical guidance&lt;/strong&gt; and support to surrounding team members, actively participating in code and architecture reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage modern AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; and workflows (e.g., Claude, Cursor) as a standardized component of engineering delivery to increase productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it&lt;/strong&gt;. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate what you build&lt;/strong&gt;. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong fluency in Go or a JVM language (Java/Kotlin)&lt;/strong&gt; and hands on experience building distributed systems in production: event-driven and asynchronous flows, clear service contracts, and designing for partial failure. High proficiency in one stack is required, with a willingness to expand technical knowledge into Go. You operate what you build, including its observability and data layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid experience&lt;/strong&gt; building, deploying, and operating critical backend services in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical comfort&lt;/strong&gt; navigating distributed systems, messaging queues, containerization, and modern deployment infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong software engineering instincts&lt;/strong&gt;, including practical application of design methodologies like TDD, BDD, or DDD, and the ability to make sensible technical trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; to operate effectively inside an international, multi-disciplinary technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take full ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have product sense &lt;/strong&gt;and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point:&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#ENGINEERING&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Menu Operations&amp;nbsp; team ensures the accuracy, reliability, and consistency of data and workflows across our ecosystem. This role will focus on automated data validation, cross-system reconciliation, monitoring, troubleshooting, and developing scalable solutions that improve data quality and operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will work closely with engineering, product, culinary, editorial, and business teams to identify data issues, improve validation processes, and standardize best practices across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue evolving this system, extending its capabilities, and preparing for expansion, we are looking for a Senior Software Engineer with strong backend experience, a talent for turning complex logic into clean, reliable systems, and enough full-stack fluency to support and enhance our internal application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and delivery of scalable backend platforms and distributed systems, leveraging&lt;br&gt;AI-assisted and agentic engineering workflows to accelerate delivery and improve system quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain backend services, ensuring scalable, reliable API interactions with our internal application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers, analysts, and planners to translate domain knowledge into robust, maintainable system logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of the platform toward event-driven patterns using technologies like Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support frontend needs for our internal React application, ensuring seamless integration between FE and BE layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve reliability through automated testing, performance tuning, and thoughtful system design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide as well as learn through pairing, design discussions, and knowledge sharing to help strengthen collective ownership across a strong, team-first environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in shaping the future direction of an advanced system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency and production experience with one or more backend languages such as Golang, Python, or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Docker, Kubernetes, and modern CI/CD practices in &lt;br&gt;production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building production-grade APIs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge and experience with relational databases and comfortable working with data across various data systems (PostgreSQL, Snowflake, S3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven architecture and messaging technologies (Kafka)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of cloud environments, containerization, and orchestration (AWS, Docker, Airflow)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or designing scalable architecture for internal tools or operational platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack capability with React or another modern FE framework a plus — enough to support and enhance application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a proactive, collaborative approach to working with engineers, analysts, planners, and product partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working through ambiguity and contributing clarity through simple, pragmatic design choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset of continuous learning, knowledge sharing, and improving the systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, the goal is to change the way people eat forever by delivering high-quality food across 18 countries and 3 continents. As a global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, the portfolio includes HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, Factor_, and Youfoodz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engaging with HelloFresh in Warsaw means collaborating with HelloTech—a global technology division of over 1,000 people powering an end-to-end food ecosystem. From digital personalization and forecasting to supply chain optimization and food waste reduction, technology drives every step of this direct-to-consumer model.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech operates in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each holding accountability for a specific product domain end to end. The service provider will join an assigned squad, with the flexibility to transition between teams and projects as technical objectives and business priorities evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several technical domains are actively engaging providers. Projects will be aligned based on individual strengths and expertise during the process. Key technical domains include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Customer Profile squad:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds AI-powered backend systems that automate campaign execution end-to-end, from content generation and validation to multi-channel delivery across email, SMS, and push.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversions Tribe:&lt;/strong&gt; supporting the &quot;Reachable Audience&quot; and Personalization initiatives. The mission is to build the systems that power customized user journeys at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across all domains, the technical profile consists of highly available, event-driven distributed systems serving global architectures. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the technical lead on backend-heavy product problems&lt;/strong&gt;, designing, building and operating the services and systems needed to deliver them reliably at scale under a full DevOps model..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build event-driven systems&lt;/strong&gt; utilizing messaging technologies such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, or AWS SQS/SNS, and expose data via clean REST and gRPC interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work extensively&lt;/strong&gt; with Docker, container orchestration via Kubernetes, and CI/CD automated deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain a strong commitment to testing&lt;/strong&gt;, executing robust test suites stretching from unit tests through to full end-to-end coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate closely&lt;/strong&gt; within cross-functional agile teams including product leads, frontend engineers, designers, and data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical guidance&lt;/strong&gt; and support to surrounding team members, actively participating in code and architecture reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage modern AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; and workflows (e.g., Claude, Cursor) as a standardized component of engineering delivery to increase productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it&lt;/strong&gt;. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate what you build&lt;/strong&gt;. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong fluency in Go or Python and hands on experience building distributed systems in production&lt;/strong&gt;: event-driven and asynchronous flows, clear service contracts, and designing for partial failure. High proficiency in one stack is required, with a willingness to expand technical knowledge into Go. You operate what you build, including its observability and data layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid experience&lt;/strong&gt; building, deploying, and operating critical backend services in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical comfort&lt;/strong&gt; navigating distributed systems, messaging queues, containerization, and modern deployment infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong software engineering instincts&lt;/strong&gt;, including practical application of design methodologies like TDD, BDD, or DDD, and the ability to make sensible technical trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; to operate effectively inside an international, multi-disciplinary technical environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take full ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have product sense&lt;/strong&gt; and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw centre:&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#ENGINEERING&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Construction Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Construction Manager will oversee multiple construction and CAPEX projects. This will include capital improvement projects, MEP upgrades, retrofits &amp;amp; renovations, and new builds. The Senior Construction Manager will be responsible for managing design, planning (cost &amp;amp; schedule), and execution (quality assurance and job site safety &amp;amp; compliance) for our current &amp;amp; future HelloFresh Fulfillment Centers. &amp;nbsp;You will manage enhancement projects and building construction to make our facilities best in class!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;**Food Manufacturing experience highly preferred**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage planning, organization, and execution of capital projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the coordination of all assigned construction project logistical tasks &amp;amp; timelines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the financial management of assigned projects that can be in excess of $20MM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make frequent site visits to survey the progress of work on all construction and associated renovation&amp;nbsp; projects to assure quality control &amp;amp; monitor performance to contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a critical role in formulation of construction budget; develop RFPs, negotiate terms and conditions&amp;nbsp; with professional entities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agreed upon project expectations and adherence to the approved budget and work effectively&amp;nbsp; with end user(s), such as Fulfillment Operations, Engineering, Logistics, etc. - and other necessary outside&amp;nbsp; professionals (architects, engineers, developers, estimators, equipment planners, etc.) to establish the&amp;nbsp; scope and budget for a project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with local/state agencies regarding permits and inspects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with outside contractors regarding bidding, scheduling, billing, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance to contract and recommend payment for appropriate services rendered. This&amp;nbsp; includes review and submission of all letters of approval, invoices, change orders, support documentation,&amp;nbsp; etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage business relationships with external contractors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage review process of all project design documents (drawings and specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date building &amp;amp; plot plans for planning &amp;amp; control purposes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepares project status reports regularly and effectively communicates the status of all major &amp;amp; minor construction projects to&amp;nbsp; Leadership and stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven – make decisions based on facts rather than gut-feelings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A connector of complex problems at all levels through excellent written and verbal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable organization, detail, and project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile - works in an ever-changing environment; demonstrates a data-driven focus in all work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in leading teams and encouraging collaborations at all levels and departments of an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural owner - Super reliable and thoughtful in managing your responsibilities, cares about the outcome and quality of work and earns the trust of your colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused: aim to achieve a customer experience and product that is second to none&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicative and send clear messages verbally and in written form to set direction, and convey updates on issues, operational status, and goals during daily/weekly stand-ups and leadership reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipped to manage projects, gather data, organize ideas, form recommendations and implement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated to providing the best possible experience for the HelloFresh customer&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have…&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Construction Management, Architecture, Engineering or a related &amp;nbsp;field a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years’ experience in construction with 5 years of experience in building e-commerce fulfillment/distribution centers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food industry experience a plus, but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant working knowledge of Federal, State and local laws and regulations related to facility buildouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple projects of scope and scale simultaneously&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven history negotiating contracts for facility expansion (contractors, sub-vendors, landlords, permit offices, &amp;nbsp;site management, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Building, Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing Codes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Word and Excel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret complex construction drawings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires heavy travel to all sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
