&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an outstanding Senior Director of Global Partnerships to lead our affiliate, strategic partnerships, and business development functions across the HelloFresh Group. This is a senior commercial role with global scope and a clear US anchor — responsible for driving high-quality, incremental customer acquisition through performance partnerships, loyalty and brand collaborations, gift-with-purchase programs (brand partnerships where a partner&#39;s product ships to customers at subscription milestones), post-transaction and publisher channels, and new acquisition BD. You&#39;ll lead a team of functional leaders across four pillars and partner closely with senior leadership to shape the overall commercial partnerships strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale the Global Partnerships division across four functional areas — US affiliate management, global partnership enablement, strategic and corporate partnerships, and business development for emerging acquisition channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the US affiliate portfolio through a period of active diversification: reducing reliance on legacy demand channels, testing new partner models, and recruiting the next generation of affiliate and post-transaction partners, while managing global accounts with meaningful US presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Gift-with-Purchase (GwP) into a repeatable, multi-market program with consumer brands across categories like kitchenware, wellness, and lifestyle — standing up scoped playbooks, a rolling calendar of committed partners, and clear cross-functional ownership across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up scalable loyalty earn/burn integrations with airline and rewards programs, and build the frameworks needed to globalize partnership opportunities that originate in local markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rebuild and scale post-transaction, cashback, and publisher partnerships with a clear focus on profitability as the channel matures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the acquisition BD function from the ground up: a sourcing and scoring engine, a scalable partner pipeline, and brand referral collaborations across categories such as health &amp;amp; wellness, fintech, and offer/deal platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing team of functional leaders, with a focus on talent development, accountability, and a results-driven culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the technology and measurement foundation for the group: partner integrations, a single source of truth for partnership data, and incrementality/MMM frameworks to validate ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the quarterback for your business: partner across Marketing, Finance, Product, and Operations to ensure shared vision, alignment, and delivery against group-wide growth goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide integrated partner and market insights to the leadership team to inform broader company-wide strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of professional experience, including 8+ years in affiliate marketing, partnerships, or business development, and 5+ years in senior leadership positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record managing multi-channel partnership portfolios at scale — affiliate networks, loyalty programs, co-branded or referral deals, post-transaction, publisher partnerships, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and leading high-performing teams of functional specialists across multiple disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P&amp;amp;L ownership with a highly data-driven approach to target-setting, budget management, and performance communication to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial fluency: comfortable structuring partnership economics, building business cases, and influencing cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong and proven external relationship skills — experienced building and sustaining partnerships with complex, multi-stakeholder, enterprise-level counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the partnership tech stack: affiliate platforms (Impact, CJ, Partnerize, or equivalent), CRM (HubSpot preferred), and measurement tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A global mindset with the ability to balance US execution priorities against a multi-market operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of fast career trajectory, high ownership, and experience building new commercial capabilities — from scratch or through a period of significant expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in an entrepreneurial, fast-paced and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal, written and interpersonal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$178,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$216,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The CVO Tribe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CVO owns two of HelloFresh&#39;s largest economic levers: &lt;strong&gt;benefit optimization&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;pricing&lt;/strong&gt;. The tribe uses machine learning, personalization, and lifetime-value prediction to replace manual, rules-based decisioning with data-driven systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The engineering org is globally distributed across Berlin, Warsaw, NYC, Boulder, and Toronto, and includes Frontend, Backend, Data, and ML Engineering, working closely with embedded Data Scientists. The work spans a genuinely mixed engineering profile: ML-heavy systems for benefit recommendation, personalization, and customer lifetime-value forecasting, alongside backend and distributed-systems work powering pricing infrastructure and subscription products at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Director, based in Berlin, you&#39;ll lead this full spectrum, setting technical strategy across ML, backend, and data disciplines and across time zones, without relying on daily co-location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead an organization of 25-30 engineers, data scientists, and ML practitioners across Berlin, Warsaw, NYC, Boulder, and Toronto, through a layer of Engineering Managers and Staff Engineers reporting into you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own ML strategy for benefit recommendation, personalization, and customer lifetime-value forecasting, as well as backend and distributed-systems strategy for pricing and subscription infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the transformation of ways of working toward fully GenAI-native, cross-functional product teams, building on teams that already ship the majority of their code with AI assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own reliability and operational excellence across both ML and backend systems: observability from model output through to customer-facing delivery, SLOs/SLIs, incident management, and MLOps practices such as retraining, rollback, and experiment tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Data Science, Marketing, Finance, and adjacent engineering teams to align engineering priorities with business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop Engineering Managers and Data Science Leads across disciplines and geographies, holding them accountable for team health, delivery, and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Range across ML and backend engineering.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need to be hands-on expert in both, but you need credibility in each: enough ML depth to set direction on production ML systems and partner effectively with Data Science, enough distributed-systems depth to be a trusted partner on pricing infrastructure and subscription products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven leadership of globally distributed teams&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple countries and time zones, without daily co-location. Comfortable with regular travel and bridging US and European hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep ML engineering expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, including feature engineering, training/serving infrastructure, experimentation, and MLOps. Causal inference or uplift modeling experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed systems and backend depth&lt;/strong&gt;, including scaling backend services and data pipelines in revenue-sensitive, high-throughput environments. Subscription or billing experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of building or scaling AI-native engineering practices, not just adopting AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and pricing domain fluency&lt;/strong&gt;, or strong aptitude to build it quickly, including benefit optimization, lifetime-value forecasting, and pricing elasticity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven leadership at scale&lt;/strong&gt;: 12+ years in software/ML engineering, with 5+ years managing Engineering Managers across more than one technical discipline and geography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, with strong grounding in SRE and MLOps practices for systems with direct financial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional communication&lt;/strong&gt;, translating ML, data, and backend concepts into business terms and vice versa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low ego, high ownership, and a bias toward clarity over complexity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global collaboration across HelloTech&#39;s hubs in Berlin, Warsaw, NYC, Boulder, and Toronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-leverage, technically diverse work spanning ML, backend, data, and product engineering, with a direct line to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely AI-native environment with a mandate to scale that approach further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical and engineering leadership in an autonomous, product-led setup, with end-to-end ownership from problem definition to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a discount on HelloFresh meal kits, delivered straight to your door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build for the long-term with our company pension scheme (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounted memberships with Urban Sports Club and John Reed, yoga classes, and access to Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your work and life with flexible hours, Work From Home/Abroad options, and a home office setup budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive childcare support (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a monthly allowance for the Deutschlandticket to support sustainable commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with access to internal trainings and a central L&amp;amp;D budget (remove for interns).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from a modern, comfortable office in Berlin-Kreuzberg and enjoy social events like team outings, Friday beers, and company runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences, so even if you don&#39;t tick every box but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we&#39;d really like to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is reorganising UX to work AI-native — practitioners either go deep as platform and skills experts, or broad as generalists who move fluidly across product, design and engineering to drive experience quality and innovation. This role leads UX for our Operations organisation: the part of the business that bridges technology with physical fulfilment, procurement, quality assurance and supply chain, across every market and brand we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll take over from a Director who spent two years shifting this function from reactive delivery to a high-leverage, AI-native strategic partner — including building an internal design platform, integrated with AI tooling, that other parts of the business have since adopted. You inherit that trajectory, not a finished product: some of our highest-stakes bets for 2026, including how we plan menus algorithmically at scale and how we run the internal tools that power supply-chain decision-making, are still being actively designed, not maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Berlin-based, in-person leadership role. Operations is one of several major, Berlin-anchored parts of our technology organization, and regular physical presence — with peers, with your team, and in the room for cross-functional decisions — is a deliberate requirement of how we want this function led going forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX strategy and quality across four core areas of Operations: menu planning and food systems (algorithmic menu planning, ranking, demand forecasting, assortment), fulfillment (production, order management, inventory, logistics, manufacturing, supplier reliability), an internal operations-research platform that runs dozens of optimization models across the supply chain, and the technology backbone that keeps our warehouses and production sites running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued build-out of an AI-native design practice: extending our design system directly into AI-assisted workflows, and using that as proof that UX can lead — not just support — the company&#39;s AI-first agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service design for the internal-facing tools that operators, planners and analysts depend on every day — often the least glamorous and highest-impact surface area in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent leadership for a distributed team spanning multiple geographies: hiring, career development, and consistent design-quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat at the Operations leadership table, partnering directly with the senior Product and Engineering leaders for the organization, and representing UX&#39;s interests in company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in UX/product design, including several years leading design for complex, operational, or B2B/enterprise-grade systems — supply chain, logistics, marketplace operations, or similar domains are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shifting a design function from reactive delivery to strategic, AI-native practice — not just familiarity with AI tools, but experience redesigning how a team works because of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling design systems/platforms that other teams adopt, and comfort operating at the intersection of design, product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — this role sits at the table with senior product, engineering and exec leadership and needs to hold its own there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and unglamorous domains: this is service design for internal operators and planners, not consumer-facing polish, and the highest-value problems here are rarely the most visible ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location &amp;amp; ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Berlin office, with an expectation of regular in-person presence — this is one of the small number of senior UX roles at HelloFresh where onsite leadership is a deliberate requirement rather than a preference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting line&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to HelloFresh&#39;s VP of UX, who also leads UX for two other major parts of the business and reports into senior Product leadership. UX holds a more central, cross-functional reporting line than is typical for Product or Engineering here, reflecting the company&#39;s investment in design and experience quality as a differentiator — with visible sponsorship at the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Senior Facilities Manager, you will lead all aspects of facilities and maintenance operations across the site, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing environment. You&#39;ll oversee building and equipment maintenance, contractor and vendor relationships, budgets, and compliance, while driving continuous improvement and operational excellence. Leading a team of Facilities colleagues, you&#39;ll inspire high performance, deliver against key KPIs and objectives, and ensure the site operates to the highest standards of safety, quality, and cost-effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jh6prp&quot; data-start=&quot;28&quot; data-end=&quot;179&quot;&gt;Lead, motivate, and develop the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance team to achieve outstanding performance and help every colleague reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6lt1cq&quot; data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;Oversee the day-to-day operation of site facilities, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;quqzkb&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Manage and coordinate maintenance teams and contractors, ensuring all work is completed efficiently, safely, and to the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o6xcnk&quot; data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;Act as the first point of contact for colleague queries, working closely with HR, Training, and other support teams where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17cbdgv&quot; data-start=&quot;579&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives that enhance operational performance, reliability, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xlucbk&quot; data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;Lead facilities procurement activities, including tendering and RFP processes, to secure best value and effective facilities management solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ti84o8&quot; data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;963&quot;&gt;Implement and optimise central Building Management System (BMS) dashboards to improve visibility, control, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kollsx&quot; data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1090&quot;&gt;Manage facilities and maintenance budgets, identifying opportunities to maximise value while maintaining service excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hcnu7f&quot; data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1243&quot;&gt;Build strong relationships with suppliers, evaluating contracts and negotiating commercial terms to achieve cost savings without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ekskyz&quot; data-start=&quot;1244&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;Identify, investigate, and resolve operational issues, escalating complex challenges to the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance senior leadership team where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ky8w78&quot; data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;Ensure full compliance with Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), work instructions, and all relevant company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6enake&quot; data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1735&quot;&gt;Champion a culture of Food Safety and Health &amp;amp; Safety, ensuring compliance with legal requirements and recognised standards, including BRCGS and ISO, while promoting a proactive approach to risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sktqr3&quot; data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1888&quot;&gt;Conduct regular audits, track corrective actions, and drive continuous compliance across Food Safety, Health &amp;amp; Safety, and other regulatory standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cbb8wo&quot; data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;2071&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Promote a strong safety culture by reporting incidents promptly, encouraging colleagues to raise concerns, and taking responsibility for maintaining a safe and compliant workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;23&quot; data-end=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;23&quot; data-end=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;38&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s84q4u&quot; data-start=&quot;38&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;Proven experience in facilities and maintenance management, with a strong track record of leading high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;doq93p&quot; data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;250&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of building systems, maintenance practices, and facilities operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1er2hdw&quot; data-start=&quot;251&quot; data-end=&quot;362&quot;&gt;Experience managing maintenance budgets, projects, and contractors to deliver safe, cost-effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dn5gsf&quot; data-start=&quot;363&quot; data-end=&quot;468&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of health &amp;amp; safety legislation, compliance requirements, and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w0o35y&quot; data-start=&quot;469&quot; data-end=&quot;554&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) and quality management standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;117q80j&quot; data-start=&quot;555&quot; data-end=&quot;647&quot;&gt;A continuous improvement mindset, using data and insights to drive operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k0zdg1&quot; data-start=&quot;648&quot; data-end=&quot;738&quot;&gt;Ability to foster a culture of high performance, safety, compliance, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u4ab9e&quot; data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;823&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w53r2y&quot; data-start=&quot;824&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;Proven ability to coach, develop, and inspire colleagues to achieve their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qinkpp&quot; data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;1009&quot;&gt;Demonstrated leadership experience managing performance and driving operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gquslx&quot; data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot;&gt;Experience managing employee relations matters, including disciplinary processes up to and including dismissal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1339&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
