&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a data-savvy and self-motivated Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Analytics Manager to join our Marketing team and support the fast and sustainable growth of the HelloFresh, Factor and Chefs Plate businesses in Canada. The Marketing Revenue &amp;amp; Analytics Manager helps drive customer and revenue optimization focus of the marketing team by leading complex data analysis and supporting the growth and management of a small team of marketing analysts. Reporting to the CMO of Hellofresh Canada, you will generate business insights, lead roadmap development and be the key contact and voice for marketing analytics in Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing Canadian revenue optimization of new and existing customers, using a small team to run analytics insights, processes, and practices that help drive top and bottom line revenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Finance Planning &amp;amp; Analytics to ensure top and bottom line revenue is on track to plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead all local experimentation in marketing performance monitoring and responsibilities related to taking action on revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the review and scoping of data requests for the Marketing Analytics Team, as well as broader roadmap development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry and market developments that might impact business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and manage a small team of marketing analysts to help complete analyses and deep dives that produce insights that drive transformative change for the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive analysis of performance &amp;amp; brand marketing data to identify gaps and opportunities for KPI improvement (acquisition, CACs, brand awareness, LTV, etc.), and work with channel managers to implement insights and push initiatives forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play the role of driving the insights generated by the analytics team to tangible action and projects adopted by the rest of the marketing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice for the marketing analytics function, supporting the local marketing team in understanding new metrics and teaching foundational analysis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The key contact for the Global Marketing BI and other marketing analytics teams in other markets to drive cross-market collaboration, best practice sharing, and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze customer data to identify pain points and opportunities in the customer journey, helping to determine customer segmentation and personalization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support additional internal metrics in retention and NPS deep dives when required o understand customer concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively support all marketing annual and quarterly planning processes, from analysis to budget to storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in a highly analytical role, with experience managing junior reports (bonus if you’ve worked in a Start-Up or in a high-growth environment).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced abilities in Excel and SQL, along with requisite knowledge in other relevant languages (eg. python and R), as well as an ability to use statistical modeling techniques for robust analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong business acumen and can translate insights into actionable recommendations that align with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to support, mentor and work collaboratively with other junior team members to drive forward high quality and thoughtful analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity: you always want to know the “why” and you go beyond the scope of a given assignment to get your answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by challenging targets and are keen to tackle both the big projects and small tasks in order to grow the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative and an excellent communicator: you distill and communicate complex solutions to a non-technical audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with an ability to prioritize according to highest business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
