&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Public Relations – Factor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid position to the New York City HelloFresh Headquarters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Factor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Factor, we’re on a mission to make real food the new standard for how the world eats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe convenience should never come at the expense of quality. That’s why every Factor meal is chef-crafted with premium ingredients, thoughtfully prepared in our kitchens, and ready to enjoy in just two minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of the dominant food brands in America, we’re redefining convenient eating through better ingredients, better nutrition, and a brand that’s challenging the status quo. From partnerships with Serena Williams and Hyrox to premium ingredient innovation and breakthrough creative, we’re building a modern food brand at the intersection of food, wellness, fitness, and culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager of Public Relations who can help make Factor impossible to ignore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t a traditional PR role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who knows how to &lt;strong&gt;create buzz, earn attention, and get people talking&lt;/strong&gt;—not just secure coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Public Relations, you’ll help shape how consumers, media, creators, and industry leaders experience Factor. You’ll develop ideas and communications strategies built to travel across earned media, social, creators, partnerships, and culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring a &lt;strong&gt;social-first mindset&lt;/strong&gt; to PR: identifying the stories, moments, conversations, talent, and creative ideas that can break through in feeds first and then expand into broader earned attention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own day-to-day public relations strategy, lead our agency partner, launch innovative products, amplify major brand partnerships, and find unexpected ways to put Factor into the cultural conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple: &lt;strong&gt;create more moments people notice, share, talk about, and remember.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across Brand Marketing, Creative, Organic Social, Growth, Culinary, Nutrition, Commercial, Legal, and Corporate Communications, you’ll play a critical role in building one of the most relevant and talked-about food brands in America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Buzz &amp;amp; Cultural Relevance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ideas designed to generate conversation, earned attention, social sharing, and cultural relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging trends, conversations, memes, creators, events, and cultural moments Factor can credibly participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create proactive PR moments rather than relying primarily on traditional announcements and press releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Creative and Organic Social to develop ideas that can live across earned, owned, creator, and social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously ask: &lt;strong&gt;What would make people actually talk about this?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find unexpected ways to put Factor into conversations happening across food, wellness, fitness, sports, and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead With a Social-First Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach communications through the lens of how stories will travel across social platforms, creators, media, and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Organic Social to identify real-time opportunities and turn cultural conversations into brand moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop PR ideas with strong visual, video, creator, and social storytelling potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for executives, chefs, nutrition experts, athletes, partners, and other brand voices to show up credibly in social conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond the headline to how every major PR moment can generate content, conversation, and amplification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Brand Communications Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute integrated communications strategies aligned with Factor’s business and brand priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create compelling narratives that reinforce Factor’s leadership in real food, nutrition, and convenient healthy eating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build annual and seasonal communications plans supporting major marketing campaigns, product launches, partnerships, cultural moments, and business milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify proactive storytelling opportunities that earn attention beyond traditional product announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure PR, social, creators, partnerships, and brand storytelling work together as one connected system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Earned Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with national business, consumer, lifestyle, food, health, wellness, fitness, and marketing media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop distinctive, timely media angles that generate high-quality earned coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stories editors and journalists genuinely want to cover—not simply stories we want to tell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write press releases, media pitches, briefing documents, talking points, FAQs, and other communications materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inbound media inquiries and coordinate interview opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursue quality, relevance, and conversation—not impressions for impressions’ sake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Product &amp;amp; Innovation Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop breakthrough communications strategies for menu innovations, seasonal launches, premium ingredients, and new product initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate sourcing, culinary craftsmanship, nutrition expertise, and product innovation into stories consumers, creators, and media care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find the provocative insight, cultural tension, or creative idea that can turn a product launch into a broader brand moment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Culinary, Nutrition, Product Marketing, Brand, Social, and Creative teams to identify newsworthy moments throughout the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplify Brand Partnerships &amp;amp; Activations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead communications planning for strategic partnerships, sponsorships, talent, and major brand moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize earned and social conversation surrounding athlete partnerships, experiential activations, and integrated marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative ideas that extend partnerships beyond traditional announcements and sponsorship visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with talent, creators, internal teams, and agency partners to create moments with the potential to break through culturally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure every major partnership has an amplification strategy across earned media, social, creators, and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Executive Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders to build distinctive thought leadership platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify media interviews, awards, podcasts, social platforms, and executive profile opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear points of view that executives can credibly own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create messaging, briefing materials, talking points, and interview preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help position Factor leaders as provocative, credible voices across food, nutrition, wellness, culture, and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the PR Agency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the day-to-day relationship with Factor’s public relations agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for creativity, proactivity, speed, and cultural awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish priorities, objectives, budgets, timelines, and performance expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push agency partners to bring proactive ideas—not simply execute briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold partners accountable for generating meaningful attention, conversation, and business impact—not simply media impressions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an always-on pipeline of stories, cultural opportunities, and breakthrough ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect &amp;amp; Strengthen the Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor brand sentiment, media conversations, and social dialogue to identify reputational risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure consistent messaging across all external communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move quickly and thoughtfully when conversations around the brand change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Communications, Public Relations, Journalism, Marketing, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–9 years of public relations, brand communications, social, or integrated communications experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-growth consumer brands, preferably within food, CPG, wellness, lifestyle, fitness, sports, or consumer technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of creating ideas or moments that generated meaningful buzz, earned attention, social conversation, or cultural relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how PR, social, creators, content, and culture increasingly work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success developing integrated communications strategies that generate high-quality earned media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong media relationships across national consumer, lifestyle, business, and trade outlets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external agencies and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding writing, storytelling, presentation, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative instincts and an ability to recognize what will—or won’t—break through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate with speed, curiosity, and good judgment in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with celebrity talent, athletes, creators, or major partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating social-first or culturally driven brand moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food, nutrition, wellness, fitness, and sports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first year, you’ll:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make Factor a more talked-about and culturally relevant brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a consistent pipeline of buzz-worthy ideas and moments that generate earned and social conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase the quality, consistency, and impact of earned media coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a proactive, social-first communications calendar that consistently creates newsworthy moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver standout communications around major brand campaigns, partnerships, product launches, and cultural moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build stronger integration across PR, Organic Social, Creative, creators, and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting that demonstrates the impact of communications on brand health, awareness, conversation, and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted strategic and creative partner across Brand Marketing and the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get… (do not edit this list)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Factor #JD1008 #Public Relations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$145,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Planning, Retail and Food Service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role to the NYC HelloFresh Headquarters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor is building the next growth platform in fresh prepared meals. We’ve already built one of the leading DTC meal brands in North America, and now we’re extending that strength into retail and foodservice, where customers are increasingly looking for better, fresher, more convenient meals. We believe this is a category ready for real disruption, and early signals show that Factor’s product, brand, and customer promise are resonating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Sr. Manager, Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Planning, Retail &amp;amp; Foodservice to build the commercial operating system that turns this ambition into a scalable business. Reporting to the Director, Commercial Sales, Retail &amp;amp; Foodservice, you will own commercial forecasting and sales planning, trade and revenue growth management, pricing architecture, commercial reporting, and new item launch processes - much of which doesn&#39;t exist yet and is yours to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role for someone analytical, structured, commercially curious, and energized by building systems where none exist. You&#39;ll be the connective tissue across sales, supply chain, finance, marketing, and operations. If you&#39;ve built a forecast from scratch, run a post-promotion analysis, and kept a new-account launch on track across sales, supply chain, and finance, this role was designed for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the master commercial forecast by customer, SKU, and week, consolidating inputs from retail sales, foodservice, and account teams; partner with Supply Chain on S&amp;amp;OP, forecast assumptions, promotional lifts, new item launch curves, and key customer and channel scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the master trade calendar across retail and foodservice accounts, integrating promotional activity with retail / shopper marketing, account milestones, and commercial planning cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track trade spend against budget, build promotional ROI models, and run post-event analysis — building the trade guardrails, margin visibility, and revenue management discipline the commercial team plans against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer pricing files, price lists, and cost-change workflows; govern account data and prepare the materials behind pricing committee decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the weekly and monthly commercial dashboards covering shipments, forecast, sell-through, trade, pricing, distribution, new item performance, and key account risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the data behind category reviews and customer meetings — scorecards, velocity and distribution readouts, the appendix — and turn category analytics into clear commercial recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the commercial gatekeeper for new item commercialization, owning launch timelines, commercialization one-pagers, retailer submission readiness, and first 26-week launch scorecards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales &amp;amp; BD, Foodservice, Retail / Shopper Marketing, Supply Chain, Finance, and Operations to keep customer meetings, trade plans, marketing activity, launches, and account calendars synchronized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document core commercial processes and build the repeatable SOPs for forecasting, pricing, item setup, reporting, and account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytically self-sufficient:&lt;/strong&gt; you can build models, dashboards, trackers, and data views independently, and translate analysis into clear business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A process builder: &lt;/strong&gt;you are energized by creating systems, calendars, scorecards, and SOPs where none exist yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded:&lt;/strong&gt; you understand that forecasting, pricing, trade, and analytics are only useful if they help the team make better customer, operational, and P&amp;amp;L decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organized and detail-oriented without losing the big picture: &lt;/strong&gt;you can manage multiple accounts, SKUs, launches, deadlines, and stakeholders while knowing what needs escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong collaborator: &lt;/strong&gt;you build trust with sales, supply chain, finance, marketing, business operations, and external data partners through accuracy, reliability, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;you can turn complex data, risks, and trade-offs into concise, decision-ready summaries for commercial leaders and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive and ownership-oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;you send the update before being asked, flag the risk before it becomes a problem, and help keep the team moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable in a fast-moving build environment: &lt;/strong&gt;you can create structure as the business scales, even when the process is not fully defined yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in sales strategy, sales planning, commercial strategy, trade marketing, revenue growth management, category management, consulting, or CPG analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and owning a commercial forecast, trade calendar, pricing file, or planning process end-to-end — not just contributing inputs to someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel / Google Sheets modeling skills; experience with dashboards, BI tools, or SQL is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with retail sales data, syndicated data (e.g. Circana, NielsenIQ), retailer portals, or category management is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to CPG, retail, grocery, food, beverage, or fresh / refrigerated categories is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with sales, finance, supply chain, and marketing on commercial planning or launch execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, with comfort preparing leadership-ready materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS or equivalent experience; MBA a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k with company match that vest immediately upon participation, and company equity plan based on role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to 7 different Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) including those for BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
