&lt;li&gt;Strategic Sourcing Expert: You possess a clear understanding of procurement sourcing best practices and strategic sourcing methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Leader: You have strong experience in leading and managing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-Driven Problem Solver: You are a creative thinker with a strong focus on process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Decision Maker: You are passionate about using data and instilling that mentality in your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-Oriented Project Manager: You possess exceptional organizational and project management skills, with a methodical approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-Starter &amp;amp; Agile: Highly motivated to take on new projects and thrive in fast-paced, dynamic environments, willing to flex across multiple categories and stakeholder teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Communicator: You can easily articulate complex solutions cross-functionally and to upper management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Player: You prioritize collective goals and work effectively within teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;You have...&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree (Business Administration, Finance, Engineering, Legal, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a procurement/sourcing lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the strategic sourcing process/methodologies and an ability to read and interpret commercial contract language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building supply chains and developing creative solutions to unlock new capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel to suppliers, production sites, and other HelloFresh office locations, including internationally (up to 25%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Relevant experience in Food, Agriculture, or the CPG Industry is a strong asset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, 401k with company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, including sabbatical, and parental leave of up to 16 weeks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tuition reimbursement for continuing education (upon 2 years of service)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
