&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$126,130 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Marketing Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; on our &lt;strong&gt;Pricing Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; team within the Global &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; organisation, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in driving data-informed pricing and discount decisions at HelloFresh. Based in our Berlin Headquarters, you&#39;ll help build best-in-class analytics to support price and discount strategy across HelloFresh&#39;s brands — turning data into strategic recommendations, challenging the status quo, and directly shaping how our global brands price, grow, and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Associate Director of Pricing Analytics, you&#39;ll partner closely with the commercial Pricing &amp;amp; Discount Strategy team and stakeholders across Product, Engineering, ML&amp;amp;AI, and Finance. You&#39;ll bring the toolkit of a data scientist — experimentation, causal inference, and modeling — and the judgment to turn it into decisions. As our scope expands, there&#39;s room to grow into broader &lt;strong&gt;Market Insights&lt;/strong&gt; work supporting senior leadership across our 15+ markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own price and discount experiments end to end&lt;/strong&gt; — frame the hypothesis, design the test, size it, launch it through our always-on testing program, and deliver the readout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model how customers respond to price and promotions&lt;/strong&gt; — price elasticity, geo-segmented pricing, discount and promo effects, and ML-assisted discount recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply causal inference&lt;/strong&gt; — incrementality and quasi-experimental methods (difference-in-differences, synthetic control, matching) — to measure true impact where a clean A/B test isn&#39;t possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship analysis as data products&lt;/strong&gt; — production pipelines and self-serve apps (Databricks, SQL, Python, Streamlit) that stakeholders use directly, not one-off notebooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and enhance reporting and visualization assets&lt;/strong&gt; that support day-to-day pricing decisions and strengthen performance oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate complex technical findings&lt;/strong&gt; as clear recommendations and tangible next steps for commercial leaders without a technical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with data science, finance, and marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to measure discount impact consistently across gross and net revenue and short- and long-term customer profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with and mentor analysts&lt;/strong&gt; within the team, championing scalable, automated, and reproducible ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As scope grows&lt;/strong&gt;, measure, benchmark, and monitor brand and market performance and help inform Marketing budgets — contributing to the Market Insights agenda alongside senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;motivated, collaborative mindset&lt;/strong&gt; with strong team-working skills and a passion for solving complex business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in data science, analytics, or a related quantitative field — ideally in a fast-paced B2C or subscription business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt; (required) — you&#39;re comfortable owning an analysis end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foundation in &lt;strong&gt;experimental design and A/B testing&lt;/strong&gt;, including how to size a test and choose primary and guardrail metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;causal inference and econometrics&lt;/strong&gt; — price elasticity, incrementality, and quasi-experimental methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid &lt;strong&gt;applied statistics&lt;/strong&gt;, and familiarity with common &lt;strong&gt;machine-learning&lt;/strong&gt; methods (regression, trees, clustering; uplift / heterogeneous-effects a plus) — with the judgment to know when a method genuinely helps and when a simpler approach is better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Marketing and Growth metrics&lt;/strong&gt; and how they connect to overall business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in a &lt;strong&gt;modern data stack&lt;/strong&gt; (Databricks / Spark / a SQL warehouse) and a visualization tool (&lt;strong&gt;Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;, Looker, or Power BI; or apps built in Streamlit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;results-oriented, structured approach&lt;/strong&gt;, able to turn vague or ambiguous business questions into clear analytical frameworks and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven &lt;strong&gt;project ownership and stakeholder management&lt;/strong&gt;, especially in senior or cross-functional settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication skills in English&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to explain analytical concepts to non-technical audiences and influence decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pricing, discounting, or marketing-analytics domain experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Insights / market-benchmarking experience supporting senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bayesian or hierarchical / mixed-effects modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GenAI / LLM tooling for analytics (e.g., natural-language-to-SQL, agent or assistant surfaces).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh-subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access, wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#JD1002&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&amp;nbsp;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Mobile Engineer in the Consumer Foundations tribe, you&#39;ll join the Client Platform squad and work hands-on to help evolve our mobile platform. Alongside engineering and product teammates, you&#39;ll help move our white-labeled, multi-brand application from a native brownfield React Native setup toward a more scalable greenfield architecture. This is a chance to build strong technical foundations, contribute to shared tooling, and help a growing engineering organization ship reliable mobile software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our stack: &lt;strong&gt;Core:&lt;/strong&gt; React Native, iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin) &lt;strong&gt;Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Monorepos, White-labeling, shared npm packages &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Bitrise, Expo (Future) &lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Honeycomb, Maestro E2E&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to Migration Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Help execute the brownfield-to-greenfield React Native migration within our white-labeled, multi-brand application ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Monorepo Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within our React Native monorepo to support concurrent development across multiple squads, and help maintain shared npm packages used across mobile and web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen CI/CD:&lt;/strong&gt; Help maintain and improve our CI/CD pipelines in Bitrise, and contribute to the team&#39;s ongoing evaluation of a future Expo migration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Test Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and extend end-to-end test coverage using Maestro, helping raise the bar for release quality and confidence across the app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain tracing and dashboards in Honeycomb to help the team make data-informed decisions about app health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Across Squads:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with your Engineering Manager and teammates to review technical solutions and bring good engineering practices into your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Application Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Help investigate and resolve production issues, contributing to a culture of stability and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Write clear technical documentation — design proposals, ADRs, or lightweight write-ups — appropriate to the scope of the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling &lt;/strong&gt;(e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;React Native &amp;amp; Native Mobile Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, production-tested expertise in React Native, combined with strong knowledge of both iOS and Android. You understand React Native&#39;s internal mechanics, performance profiling, native code bridging, platform-specific features and constraints, as well as the respective app store release processes. You are comfortable working across the full mobile stack to build and scale enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience using AI coding agents (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) in production or near-production work. You think beyond prompts to context engineering—structuring specifications, tool configurations, and information flow so agents produce reliable output. You can decompose complex workflows across agentic components, identify unreliable outputs, and introduce the appropriate guardrails where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale-Minded Developer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of managing and optimizing workflows, linting, caching, and build times for large engineering organizations (50+ developers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Monorepo Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience managing complex build configurations, white-label scaling, and monorepo architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Autonomy &amp;amp; Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable operating with a high degree of autonomy, making sound technical decisions in ambiguous situations, and supporting teams during complex production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep mobile engineering expertise,&lt;/strong&gt; with experience across the app release cycle, test automation, on-device performance and platform UX conventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Cross-Squad Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a proven ability to influence technical direction across multiple engineering teams through expertise, communication, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take full ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Growth Alliance enables HelloFresh to expand by getting more customers to try, recommend, and return to our products. We build digital experiences used by customers around the world, including our checkout funnel, discounting and wallet services, experimentation platforms, and referral technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about building customer-facing products at global scale—and shaping how millions of people interact with food and technology—this is a strong place to grow your impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Mobile Developer, you’ll join a cross-functional team building features that empower both customers and internal stakeholders. You’ll contribute to developing high-quality mobile and web experiences using modern technologies, with a focus on performance, accessibility, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with senior engineers while taking ownership of well-defined features end-to-end, growing your technical depth and product intuition over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re also increasingly leveraging &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven tools and systems&lt;/strong&gt;—from developer productivity (e.g., code generation, testing support) to customer-facing experimentation and personalization—so you’ll have opportunities to build and iterate in an evolving, AI-enabled environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate within a cross-functional team of engineers, product managers, designers, and analysts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test, and ship features that improve the customer experience and drive growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to code quality, performance, and maintainability of our mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in system design discussions and help implement scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with backend services and APIs to deliver seamless end-to-end functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and experimentation to inform product decisions and iterate on features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of continuous improvement through code reviews and team discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging tools and practices, including AI-assisted development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years of experience working with React or React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience building mobile applications (iOS and/or Android) using technologies such as Swift, Kotlin, or React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of integrating frontend applications with backend services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with testing (unit, integration, or end-to-end) and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile development and working in cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with designers and product managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a willingness to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience with experimentation platforms (A/B testing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Exposure to AI/ML-powered features or tools (e.g., personalization, recommendations, or developer tooling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience optimizing performance for mobile applications at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behavioral Data &amp;amp; Experimentation is a cross-functional platform team with end-to-end ownership of digital tracking across all markets globally at HelloFresh: from tracking infrastructure all the way to curated data products and the hypothesis validation mechanisms (e.g., A/B testing). Our customers are the engineering and product teams across HelloFresh, so reliability, automation, and developer experience are central to what we build. The squad brings together software engineers, data engineers, and data scientists to build the tracking, event, and statistical infrastructure that drives product decisions. Our work enables customer experience improvements and business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Mobile Engineer, you&#39;ll own and evolve the mobile app tracking architecture that powers behavioral tracking and experimentation across HelloFresh&#39;s brand portfolio. Your core platforms are Android (Kotlin) and React Native. You will also contribute to iOS and Web codebases as the work requires, alongside teammates with deep expertise on those platforms. AI is part of our daily work: you&#39;ll use Claude, Zed, and Opencode across design, development, and testing, and help the team adopt new practices as they emerge. Above all, we want people who make the team stronger. Even if you do not meet every requirement, we would still like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the integration and evolution of tracking and experimentation SDKs (Snowplow, Statsig, or equivalent) across Android native and React Native layers, ensuring consistent, reliable event capture for every brand and customer touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve native mobile telemetry challenges, such as lifecycle events, background sync, offline event buffering, and custom native bridges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI-driven workflows into our platform tooling to increase automation and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive engineering excellence by implementing robust automated testing, rigorous error handling, and high-quality release practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers, software and data engineers to continuously evolve our platform offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and contribute to team-wide engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to] the app experience, owning the metrics that reflect quality for mobile customers (retention, crash-free sessions, conversion).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive mobile engineering experience (5+ years) with strong native depth, ideally on Android (Kotlin). If your depth is on another platform but you have a track record of ramping up quickly in unfamiliar stacks, that works for us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, cross-platform mindset, with a proven ability to work across mobile and web codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GenAI proficiency, including a proven ability to leverage AI tools and workflows to increase development speed, quality, and overall team output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on engineering excellence, demonstrated through a commitment to high-quality codebases, proactive system stability, and resilient infrastructure design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining automated tests at different levels, including unit, integration, and end-to-end testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of taking ownership in ambiguous, cross-functional environments and working across engineering, product, and data teams to ship solutions that measurably move the needle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep mobile engineering expertise, with experience across the app release cycle, test automation, on-device performance and platform UX conventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including the ability to explain technical decisions and trade-offs to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with how client-side signals flow into downstream systems such as GTM and Snowplow, and with A/B testing and feature-flagging frameworks such as Statsig.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with iOS development (Swift).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Web frontend development (React, TypeScript, browser telemetry).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic backend or data engineering context (Node.js, Python, REST/gRPC APIs, or data pipelines).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_986add36c57b5fd6&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger&quot;&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Motion Designer 2D/3D (m/f/x)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Marketing · Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh Group, our mission is to change the way people eat forever. Since our 2011 founding in Berlin, we&#39;ve become the global market leader in the meal kit sector, inspiring millions of home cooks and food lovers every week. Our portfolio spans eight brands across 16 markets, from HelloFresh and Factor to Good Chop and Pets Table.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Motion Designer who balances high-level craft with systems-level thinking. This isn&#39;t a role for templated content churn; it’s about setting a high creative bar and building the frameworks that keep that quality intact at high volume, particularly across Paid Social. You will use AI tools to accelerate production, keeping human creativity at the center of every decision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Berlin studio as part of the Global Brand Team, you will report to the Video Creative Lead. You’ll act as their key partner in translating brand storytelling into motion — owning the creative process from inception to final cut while evolving our motion design system across global markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diverse backgrounds and non-linear skill development. If you feel aligned with this mission, we encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet every single bullet point.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the craft. &lt;/strong&gt;Concept, storyboard, design, and animate 2D and 3D motion assets across TV, Digital OOH, Paid Social, and YouTube.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Brand Systems: &lt;/strong&gt;Evolve and maintain our global motion design guidelines. Build reusable project templates, workflows, and asset libraries that internal designers and external agencies can seamlessly execute against.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate AI Thoughtfully: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage modern AI tools (e.g., Runway, Midjourney) to optimize production speed without compromising brand aesthetic or creative standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &amp;amp; Mentor: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with creative and brand leads to present work to stakeholders, while guiding junior designers and freelancers to raise overall craft quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsess over details: &lt;/strong&gt;Execute precise timing, easing, pacing, and basic sound design. Master the invisible stuff that separates ok motion from unforgettable motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE LOOKING FOR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;5+ years of dedicated motion design experience with a strong portfolio demonstrating excellence in both 2D and 3D execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to build production pipelines, style frameworks, and scalable workflows for high-volume content environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Toolkit: &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced proficiency in After Effects, Cinema 4D, Blender, Figma, and the broader Adobe Creative Cloud suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emerging Tech Proficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience integrating AI-assisted animation, editing, or image-generation tools into creative workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conceptual &amp;amp; Nuanced Craft: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional eye for rhythm and pacing, strong sensitivity to brand context, and the communication skills to navigate stakeholder feedback effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid brand experience. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve applied and evolved brand systems before, not just made pretty one-off videos.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meticulous Craft &amp;amp; Sensitivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Uncompromising taste and attention to detail (from timing and easing to brand nuance and context) backed by the emotional intelligence to navigate feedback and read both a brief and a room well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in sound design or an intuitive musical sense for pacing and rhythm. ● Prior experience working within the food, D2C, or tech sectors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application along with a portfolio or showreel highlighting your 2D/3D capabilities, above-the-line campaigns (TV/DOOH), and digital channel assets (Paid Social/YouTube).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a structured thinker who turns ambiguous operational problems into clear, data‑backed plans. You break complexity into actionable steps and communicate the “why,” “what,” and “how” with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring hands‑on experience in production or supply chain planning within manufacturing or fulfillment environments.&amp;nbsp; You understand how daily decisions ripple across inventory, labor, capacity, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fluent in Excel or Google Sheets — pivot tables, scenario modeling, and automation are second nature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working with ERP/MRP systems and BI tools (Power BI, Tableau, or similar).&amp;nbsp; You know how to pull, clean, and interpret data to drive operational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a clear communicator who can bridge operations and analytics audiences.&amp;nbsp; You translate data into narratives that help partners understand risks, tradeoffs, and recommended actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay calm and solutions‑oriented during escalations.&amp;nbsp; You can assess the situation quickly, communicate contingency plans, and guide teams through last‑minute pivots without losing composure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate effectively with both internal and external partners.&amp;nbsp; You build trust, maintain strong working relationships, and ensure alignment across production, fulfillment, vendors, and cross‑functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self‑directed and proactive — you identify the most important problems before being asked.&amp;nbsp; You anticipate risks, surface insights early, and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care deeply about data integrity and process excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own weekly and monthly production and capacity plans that align demand forecasts with operational, labor, and equipment constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain master production schedules for pick‑and‑pack fulfillment operations, incorporating headcount, equipment availability, throughput assumptions, and daily readiness inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support S&amp;amp;OP processes by consolidating demand, supply, and operations inputs into actionable daily and weekly plans that drive alignment across the network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage daily and weekly plan attainment for co‑manufacturers and fulfillment sites, including in‑week replanning when inputs deviate from forecast (labor, materials, equipment, or throughput).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure ingredient and SKU readiness by validating availability, shelf‑life windows, and production feasibility ahead of each cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain meal availability across the fulfillment network through proactive balancing of production, inventory, and transfers across sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and mitigate operational risks including shortages, shelf‑life constraints, labor bottlenecks, machine downtime, and throughput variability; model scenarios and communicate clear contingency plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data integrity across ERP/MRP and planning systems to ensure accurate inventory, capacity, and service‑level reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and reconcile weekly/monthly KPIs against targets; update planning rates and assumptions to reflect current plant capabilities and performance trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with procurement and replenishment teams to manage inventory stock transfers, optimize network balancing, and minimize waste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive improvements to planning processes, tools, and workflows, including automation opportunities that increase accuracy, speed, and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or contribute to cross‑functional special projects as the supply chain planning subject‑matter expert, supporting initiatives across production, fulfillment, procurement, and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a Minimum, You Have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Business, Statistics, Mathematics, Supply Chain, Finance, or related field with 2-3 years relevant experience in production planning, detailed scheduling , replenishment planning, demand planning or materials management required OR Associates degree with 3 to 5 years relevant experience in production planning, detailed scheduling , replenishment planning, demand planning or materials management required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food and Beverage manufacturing industry experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple demands on time required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APICS or CPIM certification a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel or Google Sheets skills required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
