&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a post-production manager in the HelloFresh Studio, you are a part of our post-production team, working daily on our food and lifestyle imagery. Your expertise in retouching, primarily in Photoshop, plays a crucial role in delivering consistent, appealing, high-quality, yet natural-looking imagery to our stakeholders. You have a good eye for detail and take pride in your work, yet appreciate constructive feedback, prioritize tasks efficiently and have a strong sense of time management. Communicating with various stakeholders and handling photography assets with care and structure. You are not only executing within established workflows, but confidently working with generative AI and hybrid approaches to enhance outputs, increase efficiency, and support new ways of creating visual content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are up to date with the most important image creation and retouching developments, including generative AI tools, and know how to apply them in a practical, production-ready context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editing and retouching&lt;/strong&gt; of our food, product and lifestyle photography&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handling and fulfilling retouching requests&lt;/strong&gt; within a global and multi-stakeholder environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate &lt;/strong&gt;with internal teams, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;clear and effective communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders worldwide, while managing &lt;strong&gt;feedback &lt;/strong&gt;professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintaining an organized workflow&lt;/strong&gt; and file management standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensuring&lt;/strong&gt; a consistent look according to our guidelines through all of your work and be a real brand ambassador&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage retouch projects&lt;/strong&gt;, including clear and professional stakeholder communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently use &lt;strong&gt;generative AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; within post-production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review and refine&lt;/strong&gt; AI-refined or generated imagery to ensure it meets high-quality, natural-looking, and brand-consistent standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in retouching in a commercial setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True foodie who enjoys working with food imagery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Adobe Photoshop and staying up to date with industry and technology trends. Capture One and/or Lightroom are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with generative AI image tools and workflows (prompting, iteration, refinement, or node based workflows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual judgment and ability to bring both traditionally shot and AI-assisted imagery to a consistent, high-end commercial quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True team player attitude excited about working in a creative and efficient environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen eye for detail and meticulous in consistency of outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough with administrative tasks and have a structured approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic mindset, always looking for ways to improve and optimize routine tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please include a portfolio of your recent and relevant work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;There is a requirement for a Senior Product Analyst with deep expertise in web and app analytics to support data-informed product and growth decisions across the organization. This engagement involves working with the analytics and reporting function, providing services globally across Berlin and New York City time zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;The scope involves solving challenging business problems using digital product usage and customer data to create high-quality digital product experiences. Deliverables will drive user experience design, product development, and customer journey optimization. The provider will be responsible for professional-grade dashboarding and reporting for critical product and growth initiatives at the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with the Senior Product organization (Product, Software Engineering, UX leads) to support strategic priorities and evidence-based decision-making.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; with cross-functional teams to gather requirements and define project objectives while utilizing project management skills to plan and execute data-driven tasks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design, implement, and analyze&lt;/strong&gt; A/B tests and experiments to measure product feature impact and optimize user experiences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; automated reporting and dashboards that facilitate data access and enable self-service analytics across the organization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; sophisticated analytics solutions to define KPI trees, design measurement frameworks, and track product performance across app and web platforms to identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; AI and automation tools to increase efficiency in data analysis, reporting, and insight generation workflows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate&lt;/strong&gt; complex data and statistical concepts to technical and non-technical stakeholders to influence strategic decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BS or equivalent in business, computer science, mathematics, economics, statistics, engineering, or a relevant quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency with Google Analytics 4 (GA4) / Snowplow, including advanced configuration and custom event tracking; experience with Mixpanel/Amplitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced BigQuery experience, including complex SQL queries, query optimization, data modeling, and large-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Python programming skills for data analysis, automation, and building analytical tools (pandas, numpy, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills including advanced formulas, pivot tables, and data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of leveraging AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, etc.) to increase productivity in analytical tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools such as Tableau, Looker, or Data Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of product analytics methodology, including Cookie/Event tracking, user behavior analysis, and experimentation design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with descriptive and inferential statistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with dbt, Airflow, or other modern data stack tools preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience providing services to fast-paced product-led or consumer-facing technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years’ experience analyzing complex data in a business context, with at least 3 years focused on product or web/app analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently and drive projects from ambiguous problem statements to actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Analyst, with deep expertise in web and app analytics, to help drive data-informed product and growth decisions across our organization. You will join our analytics and reporting team working globally between our Berlin and New York City offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will solve challenging business problems using digital product usage and customer data, to create the best digital product experiences that delight and retain customers. Your insights will drive user experience design, product development, and customer journey optimization and you will provide professional grade dashboarding and reporting that reaches the C-suite level for some of our most critical product and growth initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner widely across the Senior Product organisation (Product, Software Engineering, UX leads) to set strategic priorities and promote a culture rooted in evidence-based decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather requirements and define project objectives while utilising project management skills to plan and execute data-driven projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement and analyze A/B tests and experiments to measure product feature impact and optimize user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop automated reporting and dashboards that democratize data access and enable self-service analytics across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sophisticated analytics solutions to define KPI trees, design measurement frameworks, and track product performance across app and web platforms, to identify opportunities for product improvement and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI and automation tools to dramatically increase efficiency in data analysis, reporting, and insight generation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex data and statistical concepts persuasively to technical and non-technical stakeholders, influencing strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review as a technical expert the implementations of multiple teams across domains, continuously improving the deliverables of your teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BS or equivalent in business, computer science, mathematics, economics, statistics, engineering, or a relevant quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency with Google Analytics 4 (GA4) / Snowplow, including advanced configuration, custom event tracking, and experience with Mixpanel/Amplitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced BigQuery experience required, including complex SQL queries, query optimization, data modeling, and working with large-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Python programming skills for data analysis, automation, and building analytical tools (pandas, numpy, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills including advanced formulas, pivot tables, and data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of leveraging AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, etc.) to increase personal and team productivity in day-to-day analytical work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools such as Tableau, Looker, or Data Studio required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of product analytics methodology like Understanding of Cookie/Event tracking, user behavior analysis, and Event experimentation design etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with descriptive and inferential statistics required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with dbt, Airflow, or other modern data stack tools preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in fast-paced product-led or consumer-facing technology companies required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years&#39; experience analyzing complex data in a business context, with at least 3 years focused on product or web/app analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work autonomously and drive projects from ambiguous problem statements to actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#PRODUCT #DATA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$98,200 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoins une superstar de la foodtech française&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez HelloFresh, nous bousculons les habitudes alimentaires des français grâce à nos Box à cuisiner !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition ? Révolutionner le quotidien de nos abonné.e.s, en promouvant une façon plus durable de cuisiner et en leur faisant découvrir de délicieuses recettes, créatives et équilibrées. L&#39;alliance parfaite entre technologie et gastronomie, pour un maximum de gourmandise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh est présent dans plus de 15 pays. La France est des plus jeunes marchés, lancé en 2019, et nous y avons connu une croissance fulgurante nous propulsant comme leader du marché.&amp;nbsp; rejoindre notre équipe, c’est la garantie d’avoir un impact fort dans l&#39;une des scale-up françaises les plus prometteuses !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comment rendre tout cela possible ? Grâce à une équipe talentueuse et dynamique, des valeurs fortes de bienveillance et de diversité, et un environnement de travail stimulant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu souhaites prendre part à cette incroyable aventure humaine, internationale et entrepreneuriale, rejoins-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes à la recherche d&#39;un.e &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; pour rejoindre notre équipe &lt;strong&gt;Produit&lt;/strong&gt;. En tant qu&#39;Analyste Produit Senior, tu seras la référence analytique pour les décisions produit en France, à l&#39;intersection des équipes Culinaire, Menu Planning et SPD (Strategy &amp;amp; Product Development).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il ne s&#39;agit pas simplement de produire des rapports, mais d&#39;un rôle clé où tu pourras &lt;strong&gt;façonner directement les décisions stratégiques produit&lt;/strong&gt; — de l&#39;architecture de menu à l&#39;optimisation des recettes, en passant par la stratégie d&#39;assortiment. Ce rôle se caractérise par &lt;strong&gt;sa diversité&lt;/strong&gt; : tu pourrais passer une journée à analyser la performance client sous l&#39;angle produit, la suivante à construire un outil pour automatiser un workflow, et la troisième à présenter des insights actionnables au management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu veux être au cœur de la data produit et avoir un impact direct sur ce que des milliers de client.e.s mettent dans leur assiette chaque semaine, alors ce poste est fait pour toi !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que tu feras :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business intelligence et reporting produit : &lt;/strong&gt;concevoir et maintenir des tableaux de bord et rapports récurrents sur les sujets produit (performance du menu, adoption des recettes, rotation d&#39;assortiment, etc.), définir et suivre les KPIs clés, et présenter des synthèses régulières pour alimenter les rituels de pilotage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyses ad hoc et exploratoires : &lt;/strong&gt;mener des analyses qui informent directement les décisions produit — architecture de menu, optimisation de recettes, stratégie d&#39;assortiment — et identifier proactivement des opportunités à fort impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement et maintenance d’outils analytiques : &lt;/strong&gt;concevoir et maintenir des outils analytiques internes (scripts, dashboards, automatisations) pour soutenir les workflows des équipes Culinaire, Menu Planning et SPD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse de données : &lt;/strong&gt;extraire, transformer et analyser des données complexes pour soutenir les décisions produit, en garantissant la qualité et la cohérence des datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytique client orientée performance produit : &lt;/strong&gt;analyser le comportement et les préférences client.e.s sous l&#39;angle de la performance produit (satisfaction, réachat, fidélisation selon les choix de menu ou de recette) pour informer les décisions d&#39;assortiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage de projets stratégiques&lt;/strong&gt; : prendre en charge le lead analytique et opérationnel de projets stratégiques visant à améliorer le cœur de produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration internationale &lt;/strong&gt;: travailler en lien avec le Global Product Analytics team sur des projets à fort impact, contribuant à la création de valeur sur l&#39;ensemble des marchés HelloFresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu&#39;on recherche chez un.e candidat.e :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es issu.e d&#39;une top école d&#39;ingénieur, de commerce ou d&#39;une formation universitaire en data/statistiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as au moins &lt;strong&gt;4 ans d&#39;expérience&lt;/strong&gt; en analyse de données, business intelligence ou data science, idéalement dans un environnement e-commerce, FMCG ou food-tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; de façon avancée ; Python est un plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as de l&#39;expérience avec des&lt;strong&gt; outils de BI&lt;/strong&gt; (Tableau privilégié) et une excellente maîtrise de Gsheet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as de l’expérience dans l’&lt;strong&gt;utilisation d&#39;outils IA/ML &lt;/strong&gt;pour des analyses exploratoires (ex. détection d&#39;anomalies) et en usage de LLMs comme accélérateur de productivité analytique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais traduire des analyses complexes en &lt;strong&gt;recommandations claires, synthétiques et actionnables&lt;/strong&gt; pour des interlocuteur.ice.s non techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es organisé.e, rigoureux.se, tu portes une grande attention aux détails et sais prioriser entre plusieurs sujets tout en leur accordant le temps nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es proactif.ve : tu identifies les bonnes questions autant que tu y réponds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu parles couramment français et maîtrises l&#39;anglais à l&#39;oral comme à l&#39;écrit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus : tu as une vraie passion pour la food et une appétence pour les enjeux culinaires ou de grande consommation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous t&#39;offrons :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un impact réel : tes actions alimentent directement la croissance d&#39;une des plus belles scale-ups européennes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une courbe d&#39;apprentissage rapide&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe bienveillante : une petite team talentueuse et passionnée qui t&#39;aidera à monter en compétence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement international : tu travailleras avec des équipes dans 13 pays; c&#39;est une vraie école&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des bureaux au cœur de Paris (1er arr.), une culture dynamique et entrepreneuriale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages : réductions HelloFresh, tickets restaurant Swile, accès Gymlib, transport, et tout ce qui fait que c&#39;est cool de venir au bureau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le déroulé du processus de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous examinons ton CV et ta lettre de motivation. Si c’est un match, nous t’invitons à une série d’entretiens et à réaliser un case study. Nous nous engageons à organiser rapidement les entretiens, afin de t’accueillir chez HelloFresh au plus vite !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes débuts chez HelloFresh :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A ton arrivée, nous te concoctons des sessions d’onboarding qui te permettront de rencontrer chaque manager et de t’imprégner ainsi du fonctionnement de HelloFresh.&amp;nbsp;Tu auras aussi du temps pour faire plus ample connaissance avec ton équipe avant de plonger dans le vif de tes missions !&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Ireland is in an exciting growth phase - expanding customer choice, deepening menu relevance, and driving long-term loyalty in a fast-growing market. As our Senior Product Manager, you will own the product space, driving impact across product strategy, product operations, and culinary workstreams. You will lead a talented, dedicated team and serve as the strategic engine behind what makes our boxes brilliant for Irish customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a technology product role.&lt;/em&gt; You will work across the full physical product value chain and lifecycle - from ingredient sourcing and culinary development through to menu strategy, editorial execution, and customer experience - making decisions that directly impact what lands on our customers&#39; doorsteps every week. You will need the ability to operate at pace, cut through complexity, and bring teams and stakeholders with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic business planning: &lt;/strong&gt;Reviewing product KPIs and guiding the team to improve the product offering - balancing short-term operations with long-term strategic direction, and owning the product investment calendar to increase retention while optimising for revenue and costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborating and building strong relationships with Operations, Marketing, and international teams - being the voice of the physical product for HelloFresh Ireland, advising on coherent processes between functions, and ensuring a coordinated approach to product initiatives across local and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process optimisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Identifying opportunities to streamline, automate, and improve how we work - across teams and with key partners - and aligning operational improvements with the strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical decision making: &lt;/strong&gt;Working with the team to ensure access to the relevant information, analyses, and insights needed to make informed product development decisions and translate the product vision into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business case development: &lt;/strong&gt;Developing business cases around physical product improvements and product-related processes (e.g. changes in product offering, tooling, and automations), and making data-led recommendations to Ireland and global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People management: &lt;/strong&gt;Leading, developing and inspiring teams spanning Culinary, Physical Product Strategy, and Product Operations - setting clear strategic direction, cultivating a high-performing culture, and supporting each team member&#39;s growth across different career stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience in product, category, or commercial - ideally food, FMCG, meal kits, or subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for food, with the ability to translate taste trends and market signals into compelling product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven people leadership across different career stages - coaching, clear direction, and investment in growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen - connecting product decisions to business outcomes including revenue and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional influence - aligning teams toward a shared goal without needing formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and structured, with strong project management skills and the ability to deliver to tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills - able to drill into detail, connect findings to the big picture, and present insights clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric, with creative thinking to identify unmet needs and develop solutions that address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action - moving quickly without sacrificing quality, bringing momentum to the teams around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp problem-solving instincts - comfortable with ambiguity and confident driving toward solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At home in lean, agile environments - able to do more with less and build from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Excel and Google Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a serious impact on one of the fastest-growing technology companies in Europe in an exciting growth phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, high impact on our Operations setup from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, international environment with mission-driven colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A guaranteed steep learning curve &amp;amp; boost for your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from our selection of employee perks (70% off your HelloFresh boxes, private health insurance, employer matching pension program, cycle to work scheme, Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme, gym membership etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Dublin Docklands, Ireland&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in ROI, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager. As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process criminal and background&amp;nbsp;checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&amp;nbsp;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ql-header-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As HelloFresh scales globally, our Supply Chain Technology team is expanding to solve unique, high-stakes logistics challenges. In this role, you will lead our Delivery Network Squad, taking ownership of scalable products that directly impact how millions of meal kits move through our logistics network and reach customer doorsteps. You will collaborate closely with engineering tribes and operational leaders across all HelloFresh markets to optimize existing shipping capabilities and build innovative 0-to-1 solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&amp;nbsp;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ql-header-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute a clear mid-term vision for your domain, driving step-change improvements across logistics network design, execution, and shipping operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a cross-functional tribe of engineers, product managers, and operational stakeholders across global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the domain SME, mastering complex logistics challenges and ensuring our product suite delivers high usability and operational value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a data-driven approach to deep-dive analytics, continuously evaluating, measuring, and optimizing product feature performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-user testing and change management to facilitate smooth feature rollouts across global operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a customer-obsessed culture focused on delivering the highest quality delivery experience to HelloFresh customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ql-header-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong senior/lead level of product management experience, preferably within e-commerce, logistics, or food tech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of solving complex operational challenges in large, multi-country environments by optimizing products and launching 0-to-1 innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical expertise paired with business acumen, capable of translating raw data into clear, actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to distill complex technical topics for diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, growth-oriented mindset with a passion for building simple, scalable, and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;The Foundations Alliance&#39;s mission is to accelerate the delivery of high-quality, scalable, and highly available digital products at HelloFresh by providing services and platforms that improve internal builder productivity and system reliability.&amp;nbsp;This position is for a Senior Product Manager to drive the vision, strategy, and execution for the Operational Data Platform—the systems that create, transport, and store data at the point of origin, making it available for downstream analytics or AI. The role holds accountability for a high-leverage layer of the data ecosystem: the streaming and database infrastructure that product engineering teams rely on to get data flowing reliably.&lt;br&gt;The core objective is to ensure operational data is created, delivered, and shared downstream reliably, cost-efficiently, and with explicit quality guarantees. The service provider will define the roadmap for the squad&#39;s platform (event streaming, relational, and NoSQL databases), partner closely with the Engineering Lead for the Operational Data Platform, and collaborate cross-functionally with data producer and analytical teams. This engagement comes at a key moment for critical-path cost-efficiency and reliability initiatives. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive the product vision and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for the Operational Data Platform—focusing on low-latency data creation, transport, storage, and availability for downstream analytics—partnering closely with the Engineering Lead for the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead the squad&#39;s cost-efficiency roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, taking accountability for targeted cost savings as a core KPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain the reliability of critical-path systems&lt;/strong&gt; (streaming and core databases), setting uptime targets and feeding incident learnings back into platform planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion data-contract and schema standards&lt;/strong&gt; at the point of data creation, collaborating with data-producing engineering teams to close adoption gaps and ensure quality data flows downstream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Guide platform tooling decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, consolidating technologies around optimal solutions rather than accumulating redundant options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the handover contract&lt;/strong&gt; with the Analytical Data Platform, ensuring downstream data is consistently trustworthy and ready for governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Act as the primary interface&lt;/strong&gt; between the Operational Data Platform and data producers, translating business and technical needs into actionable roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define, track, and report squad KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; (cost efficiency, critical-path reliability, data-quality adoption) against quarterly alliance goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; with a solid grounding in data infrastructure, data engineering, or backend platforms—comfortable with streaming, messaging, and database architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Working familiarity&lt;/strong&gt; with event streaming and relational/NoSQL database technologies to partner credibly with engineering leads on technical trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Track record of driving roadmaps and KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; for technical teams in platform problem spaces, managing metrics like cost, reliability, or data quality to target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-driven approach&lt;/strong&gt; to prioritization and roadmap decisions, supported by analytical tools and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong collaboration and communication capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; to establish trust and technical alignment with engineering leads and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pragmatic, execution-oriented mindset&lt;/strong&gt; to drive day-to-day delivery autonomously and navigate cost, reliability, and technical debt trade-offs in live production environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#PRODUCT&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end-to-end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Consumer Alliance&lt;/strong&gt; drives customer acquisition, conversion optimization, and retention strategies across all HelloFresh and Ready-to-Eat (RTE) brands globally. The alliance is responsible for cross-cutting initiatives that maximize business value through modernized architecture. By leveraging rigorous experimentation, data-driven insights, and continuous modernization, we ensure a frictionless, highly optimized experience that improves order rates and sustains long-term growth across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within the alliance, the &lt;strong&gt;Order &amp;amp; Subscription&lt;/strong&gt; tribe owns everything that happens once a customer commits: how orders are built, scheduled, modified, and delivered, week after week, at scale. The &lt;strong&gt;Deliveries squad&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a Senior React Native Engineer with iOS knowledge to build and evolve the delivery planning, tracking, scheduling experiences across our mobile &amp;amp; web apps. This is where an expected order becomes a doorstep experience: every change you ship is measured directly in delivery accuracy &amp;amp; customer trust, across all HelloFresh Group&#39;s brands and markets, for millions of customers every week, globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Squad, Tribe &amp;amp; Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve the delivery and orderflows in our React Native apps, from problem definition through to production and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run experiments on high-traffic, revenue-critical surfaces, and use the results to decide what ships next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers across the department and the company to continuously improve the code base, systems, and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop solutions that can continue to scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other team members through workshops, pair programming, and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the app experience, owning the metrics that reflect quality for customers (delivery accuracy, crash-free sessions, performance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;2-3 years of hands-on work with React Native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of experience working with Mobile or Web technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: a working knowledge of native&lt;strong&gt; iOS development&lt;/strong&gt; (Swift/Objective-C, Xcode, CocoaPods/SPM) sufficient to debug, extend, or write native modules and bridges when React Native isn&#39;t enough&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in building component-based architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of integrating frontend and backend services seamlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD workflows, along with solid testing practices, including unit, integration, and end-to-end testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills when partnering with engineers and other functional roles, like product management and UX designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mobile engineering expertise, with experience across the app release cycle, test automation, on-device performance and platform UX conventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at a global scale, supporting 6+ million customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to the workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Ireland is in an exciting growth phase - expanding customer choice, deepening menu relevance, and driving long-term loyalty in a fast-growing market. As our Senior Product Manager, you will own the product space, driving impact across product strategy, product operations, and culinary workstreams. You will lead a talented, dedicated team and serve as the strategic engine behind what makes our boxes brilliant for Irish customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a technology product role.&lt;/em&gt; You will work across the full physical product value chain and lifecycle - from ingredient sourcing and culinary development through to menu strategy, editorial execution, and customer experience - making decisions that directly impact what lands on our customers&#39; doorsteps every week. You will need the ability to operate at pace, cut through complexity, and bring teams and stakeholders with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic business planning: &lt;/strong&gt;Reviewing product KPIs and guiding the team to improve the product offering - balancing short-term operations with long-term strategic direction, and owning the product investment calendar to increase retention while optimising for revenue and costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborating and building strong relationships with Operations, Marketing, and international teams - being the voice of the physical product for HelloFresh Ireland, advising on coherent processes between functions, and ensuring a coordinated approach to product initiatives across local and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process optimisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Identifying opportunities to streamline, automate, and improve how we work - across teams and with key partners - and aligning operational improvements with the strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical decision making: &lt;/strong&gt;Working with the team to ensure access to the relevant information, analyses, and insights needed to make informed product development decisions and translate the product vision into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business case development: &lt;/strong&gt;Developing business cases around physical product improvements and product-related processes (e.g. changes in product offering, tooling, and automations), and making data-led recommendations to Ireland and global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People management: &lt;/strong&gt;Leading, developing and inspiring teams spanning Culinary, Physical Product Strategy, and Product Operations - setting clear strategic direction, cultivating a high-performing culture, and supporting each team member&#39;s growth across different career stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience in product, category, or commercial - ideally food, FMCG, meal kits, or subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for food, with the ability to translate taste trends and market signals into compelling product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven people leadership across different career stages - coaching, clear direction, and investment in growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen - connecting product decisions to business outcomes including revenue and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional influence - aligning teams toward a shared goal without needing formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and structured, with strong project management skills and the ability to deliver to tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills - able to drill into detail, connect findings to the big picture, and present insights clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric, with creative thinking to identify unmet needs and develop solutions that address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action - moving quickly without sacrificing quality, bringing momentum to the teams around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp problem-solving instincts - comfortable with ambiguity and confident driving toward solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At home in lean, agile environments - able to do more with less and build from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Excel and Google Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a serious impact on one of the fastest-growing technology companies in Europe in an exciting growth phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, high impact on our Operations setup from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant, international environment with mission-driven colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A guaranteed steep learning curve &amp;amp; boost for your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from our selection of employee perks (70% off your HelloFresh boxes, private health insurance, employer matching pension program, cycle to work scheme, Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme, gym membership etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Dublin Docklands, Ireland&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in ROI, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager. As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process criminal and background&amp;nbsp;checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As you may have read in the news …..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“HelloFresh Acquires Ready-to-Eat Meal Company Factor75, Inc.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The acquisition marks the next step in HelloFresh’s growth plan in the US to strengthen its leading position and to expand its total addressable market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Both companies will benefit from their combined resources, operational excellence and data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are extremely excited by this news as we add to the range of products available to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is Factor?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that health and wellness starts with food and what you put into your body. Our goal is to help our customers achieve their health and wellness goals. We focus on being physically fit and healthy with nutritious, purposeful eating. We want to help real people achieve real results without sacrificing time and energy trying to sort through the overwhelming amount of information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use the freshest, highest quality ingredients available, and our in-house culinary team is constantly working to optimize the nutritional value of every single meal. Meals arrive fresh and are fully prepared- simply heat in the microwave or oven and enjoy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have responsibility for all quality assurance related internal audits in adherence with regulatory standards. The position manages a team of quality assurance managers in kitchen, production and fulfillment environments in the Goodyear area. Additionally, the position develops, implements and oversees quality management systems designed to ensure continuous production of advanced composite materials and applications consistent with established standards, customer specifications and production goals to ensure the highest level of food safety and quality of our products. This position will report to the Associate Director of Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Operations.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a high level of internal and external customer service. Investigate (and correct) customer issues and complaints relating to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages the department engaged in inspection and testing activities to ensure high productivity and high technical integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing internal audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and analyze statistical data and product specifications to determine standards and to establish quality and reliability expectancy of finished products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate objectives with production procedures in cooperation with other plant managers to maximize product reliability and minimize costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, document and implement inspection criteria and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret quality control philosophy to key personnel within the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active role on internal continuous improvement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and implement quality control training programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide, and oversee, inspection activity for products throughout the production cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with vendors and procurement to ensure quality of all purchased parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Addressing non-conformities from previous internal and external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting a management review of the quality system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Following-up on and closing pending preventive and corrective action requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that organizational systems and training is in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that documentation and design controls are appropriate for organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administering document control and configuration management system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing established calibration and testing programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting the management team and providing QA support as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide all employees with necessary tools, proper training and corrective direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report food safety and quality problems to personnel with authority to initiate action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as backup SQF Practitioner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership: train and develop a large group of employees&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Management: for assigned production lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Solving/Analysis&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results Driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Proficiency: speak to employees with tact and diplomacy&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Management: tracking/monitoring production and maintaining productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Capacity: computer literacy to input information into the computer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Orientation: able to take direction and relay information to employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate’s degree or related management work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7 years of work experience in quality assurance, should be combined with a demonstrated track-record of accomplishments as a quality assurance manager, and with satisfying customers in technology-driven, developing companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of HelloFresh not to discriminate against any employee or applicant for employment because of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, marital status, genetic information, disability or because he or she is a protected veteran.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$119,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$137,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end-to-end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Consumer Alliance&lt;/strong&gt; drives customer acquisition, conversion optimization, and retention strategies across all HelloFresh and Ready-to-Eat (RTE) brands globally. The alliance is responsible for cross-cutting initiatives that maximize business value through modernized payment processing, dynamic customer activations and reactivations, and organic growth channels like SEO. By leveraging rigorous experimentation, data-driven insights, and continuous backend modernization, we ensure a frictionless, highly optimized funnel that improves conversion rates and sustains long-term growth across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Cart &amp;amp; Wallet squad is looking for a Senior React Native Engineer to build and evolve the cart, checkout, and wallet experiences across our mobile and web apps. This is where intent turns into revenue: every change you ship is measured directly in conversion, order value, and customer trust, across all HelloFresh Group&#39;s brands and markets, for millions of customers every day, globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloTech, flexibility and cross-functional collaboration are core to how we work. While this role is aligned to a specific Alliance, strong candidates may also be considered for opportunities across different teams or projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve the cart, checkout, and wallet flows in our React Native apps, from problem definition through to production and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run experiments on high-traffic, revenue-critical surfaces, and use the results to decide what ships next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers across the department and the company to continuously improve the code base, systems, and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop solutions that can continue to scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other team members through workshops, pair programming, and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the app experience, owning the metrics that reflect quality for mobile customers (retention, crash-free sessions, conversion).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2-3 years of hands-on work with React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 5 years of experience working with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in building component-based architectures using React.js and Node.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of integrating frontend and backend services seamlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD workflows, along with solid testing practices, including unit, integration, and end-to-end testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills when partnering with engineers and other functional roles, like product management and UX designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep mobile engineering expertise, with experience across the app release cycle, test automation, on-device performance and platform UX conventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at a global scale, supporting 6+ million customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to the workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;Senior Regulatory Compliance Specialist&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Job Description&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Regulatory Compliance Specialist supports regulatory compliance across HelloFresh’s Meal Kit and Factor businesses, ensuring products, ingredients, labels, and menu information meet applicable regulatory requirements and internal standards. This role works closely with cross-functional partners to review regulatory information, identify and resolve compliance risks, and support accurate and timely execution in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position plays an important role in providing regulatory coverage across the business, including Thursday–Monday support for menu changes, ingredient substitutions, labeling updates, and other time-sensitive regulatory needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Review and approve regulatory and labeling information for HelloFresh Meal Kit and Factor products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support Factor labeling updates and changes, ensuring ingredient statements, allergen declarations, Nutrition Facts, claims, and other required information are accurate and compliant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review Meal Kit menus, recipes, ingredients, and substitutions for regulatory compliance, including time-sensitive changes that occur later in the week or over the weekend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate products and ingredients against applicable U.S. regulatory requirements and escalate potential compliance risks when appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review ingredient specifications, supplier documentation, product information, and supporting regulatory documentation for accuracy and completeness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Culinary, Procurement, FSQA, Operations, and other stakeholders to resolve regulatory questions and support business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support new product, ingredient, and menu launches by ensuring regulatory requirements are identified and addressed prior to implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain accurate regulatory documentation and records to support compliance, traceability, and audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide guidance to internal stakeholders regarding labeling, allergens, claims, ingredient declarations, and other regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify opportunities to improve regulatory processes, documentation, workflows, and tools to increase accuracy and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Provide regulatory support and escalation coverage Thursday through Monday to ensure time-sensitive menu, labeling, ingredient, and substitution issues are addressed quickly and appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;3+ years of relevant experience in food regulatory affairs, food labeling, food safety, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Food Science, Nutrition, Biological Science, or a related discipline preferred but not required. In lieu of a degree, 3 years of relevant food safety or regulatory experience will be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of U.S. FDA and USDA food labeling and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience reviewing Nutrition Facts panels, ingredient statements, allergen declarations, claims, and other food labeling information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience interpreting ingredient specifications and regulatory documentation and translating requirements into actionable guidance for business partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of Canadian food labeling and regulatory requirements is an asset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with labeling, specification, regulatory data, or related software systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical skills and exceptional attention to detail, with the ability to identify potential compliance risks and determine appropriate next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to explain regulatory requirements clearly to non-regulatory stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and respond effectively to changing business needs in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;Ability to work a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Thursday–Monday schedule to provide regulatory support during critical business coverage periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; United States or Canada&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;: Thursday–Monday, with an 8:00, 9:00, or 10:00 AM start time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Mississauga, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$72,450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,450 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

