&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior UX Product Designer, Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role to the Toronto HelloFresh Headquarters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer to join our Engagement team&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping experiences that deepen customers’ relationships with HelloFresh and create more reasons to engage with our products over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior-level individual contributor, you’ll lead complex, high-impact challenges across &lt;strong&gt;loyalty, referrals, discovery, cooking experiences, and other engagement initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll combine strong product design craft with experimentation, systems thinking, and commercial awareness to create experiences that are useful, rewarding, and capable of building lasting customer habits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic and hands-on role. You’ll contribute to the future direction of our engagement experiences while continuously identifying opportunities to improve what exists today. You’ll work in an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native design environment&lt;/strong&gt;, using AI throughout the design lifecycle to accelerate discovery, synthesis, prototyping, and execution — while exploring how emerging technology can create more relevant and personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Senior level, we expect you to independently lead ambiguous product challenges, influence product direction, and contribute patterns and practices that make the broader team stronger. You’ll remain deeply involved in the craft, using the quality of your thinking, design, and collaboration to bring others along.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead high-impact UX experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end design of experiences across &lt;strong&gt;loyalty, rewards, referrals, discovery, cooking, and other engagement mechanics&lt;/strong&gt; that strengthen customers’ relationships with our brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiences that give customers compelling reasons to return, participate, explore, share, and get more value from HelloFresh over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex customer and business problems into experiences that feel simple, motivating, and relevant while driving measurable outcomes such as engagement, retention, lifetime value, and referral-driven acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think beyond individual features or transactions to understand how repeated interactions can build habits, trust, and long-term customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape product direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Data, Research, Marketing, CRM, and Content Design to identify opportunities across the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect customer needs, behavioural insights, commercial goals, and emerging technology to develop strong product directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define how loyalty, referrals, discovery, and other engagement experiences connect into a coherent customer relationship rather than a collection of disconnected features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move comfortably between contributing to longer-term vision and delivering tactical improvements that generate measurable impact today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong design perspective to your product area while remaining open to evidence, experimentation, and the expertise of your partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive experimentation and validated learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use quantitative and qualitative insights to identify opportunities, develop hypotheses, and design high-impact experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Data to understand customer behaviour and translate signals such as participation, frequency, retention, redemption, sharing, and conversion into actionable design opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how different mechanics — from rewards and incentives to personalization and social sharing — influence customer motivation and behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look beyond the outcome of individual A/B tests to identify patterns and insights that can inform future product and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term commercial impact with the quality and sustainability of the longer-term customer relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work AI-natively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI into your day-to-day design practice, from exploration, research synthesis, and ideation through rapid prototyping and design-to-code workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools such as Claude &amp;amp; Claude Code, Gemini, Figma AI, and emerging technologies to shorten the distance between an idea and something customers can experience and validate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore opportunities for &lt;strong&gt;AI-native engagement experiences&lt;/strong&gt;, including personalization, recommendations, adaptive experiences, conversational interactions, and new ways to help customers discover and get value from HelloFresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong design judgment to AI-generated outputs, understanding when AI accelerates quality and when human craft, intuition, and critical thinking matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar for design craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create polished, intuitive experiences with strong attention to visual hierarchy, interaction design, motion, micro-interactions, content, and overall usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a high level of craft to experiences that may need to be motivating, rewarding, or expressive without becoming distracting, confusing, or gimmicky.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve the quality and coherence of the Engagement experiences you work on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute patterns, practices, and examples that help other designers deliver stronger work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give and seek thoughtful critique, using feedback to continuously strengthen the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design systems, not just screens&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think across journeys rather than individual touchpoints, identifying opportunities to create reusable patterns and modular experiences that can scale across &lt;strong&gt;loyalty, referrals, rewards, discovery, brands, markets, and customer segments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consider how engagement mechanics connect across surfaces and moments rather than treating individual features in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our design system teams while contributing Engagement-specific patterns where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce design debt and fragmentation by creating solutions that make future experimentation faster without sacrificing relevance or quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong perspectives and clear rationale to complex product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide cross-functional partners through ambiguity and trade-offs, advocating for customer-centred solutions while understanding commercial and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with &lt;strong&gt;Marketing and CRM&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure product experiences and customer communications reinforce one another across the lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment through clear communication, evidence, and strong design rationale rather than formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other designers through critique, collaboration, and sharing new practices and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior-level product design experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically &lt;strong&gt;4–6+ years of product design experience&lt;/strong&gt;, although we care more about the scope, complexity, and impact of your work than years alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating end-to-end ownership of complex consumer experiences, from understanding the problem through shipped outcomes and learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience independently navigating ambiguous problems, making sound design decisions, and influencing product direction within your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement and experimentation expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing &lt;strong&gt;B2C consumer products&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within e-commerce, subscription, marketplace, loyalty, social, content, or other high-frequency digital experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how product experiences can influence customer motivation, frequency, habit formation, retention, and advocacy — not just immediate conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand experimentation deeply and can translate behavioural data, customer insights, and business metrics into meaningful design opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance commercial outcomes with customer value, trust, and the quality of the longer-term relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional product design craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise across interaction and visual design, including hierarchy, information architecture, responsive behaviour, motion, and micro-interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take complex experiences and make them feel simple, and can articulate what separates a functional experience from a great one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how thoughtful interaction and visual design can create moments of delight and motivation without compromising clarity or usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about the details while understanding when speed, learning, and iteration matter more than perfection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native design fluency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is already part of how you work, not something you are waiting to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You regularly use AI across multiple stages of your design process, whether that’s discovery, synthesis, ideation, prototyping, or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable experimenting with tools such as Figma AI, Claude, Claude Code, Gemini, or similar emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re interested not only in using AI to work faster, but in understanding how it changes what we can design for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You naturally look beyond the individual screen or experiment to understand how experiences connect across the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience creating reusable patterns or modular solutions that can work across journeys, customer contexts, brands, or markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance the benefits of consistency and reuse with the need to design for the specific customer motivation and context at hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinking and high agency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity, challenging assumptions, and proactively identifying opportunities rather than waiting for perfectly defined briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring conviction to your design decisions while remaining open to evidence, experimentation, and alternative perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can establish a strong direction for your work and then get hands-on to make it real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working beyond traditional design boundaries: shaping product decisions with Product Managers, exploring technical possibilities with Engineers, working with Data to understand behaviour, and partnering with Research, Content Design, Marketing, and CRM to understand and influence the broader customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to build alignment across disciplines and move work forward without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex problems into clear, compelling narratives and confidently present your thinking to stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate not only &lt;strong&gt;what&lt;/strong&gt; you designed, but the customer insight, hypothesis, trade-offs, and business rationale behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can adapt the depth and format of your communication to the decision that needs to be made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Shipping Associate oversees day-to-day operations across receiving, shipping, warehousing, inventory distribution, and logistics. Reporting directly to the Shift Lead and Supervisor, the associate executes operational directives while ensuring strict compliance with all safety protocols, Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), Safe Quality Food (SQF) standards, and PPE/hygiene policies. The role requires certification and proficiency in operating material handling equipment as designated by facility leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift: Thursday to Sunday - 7:00pm to 5:30am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Palletize assembled boxes securely and systematically according to designated shipping specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all cartons are upright with carrier color-coded indicators clearly facing outward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build uniform, tier-by-tier loads to maintain structural stability during handling and transit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit shipping labels across packages to verify alignment with the correct carrier lane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wrap and secure completed pallets prior to staging or transport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely and efficiently transfer pallets from the production floor to the shipping dock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm each pallet undergoes verification by the Shipping Verifier and receives proper pallet identification labeling before transfer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform incoming verification checks on top-layer shipping labels for all incoming pallets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate that visible color tags match designated shipping lane specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate, complete, and affix official pallet labels to verified loads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and direct the placement of pallets into their respective shipping lanes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately record pallet data using the Box Counter Tool for every processed load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visually confirm that incoming trailers are properly staged at the designated dock doors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform thorough trailer cleanliness and safety inspections, completing required documentation prior to loading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Re-verify top-layer package labels for each pallet prior to trailer loading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct visual perimeter checks of staged pallet lanes to confirm uniform color coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile total loaded box counts against expected carrier manifests; conduct final floor sweeps across shipping and production areas for final outbound shipments of each carrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively across cross-functional facility departments to resolve operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work autonomously under minimal supervision while carrying out management directives professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain material handling equipment and promptly escalate operational or mechanical defects to supervisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized and clean work environments in accordance with facility 5S and safety regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input operational data accurately into inventory management systems and software platforms (e.g., Microsoft Office, Google Sheets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties are performed within a cold-storage manufacturing and assembly facility with exposure to controlled temperatures ranging from 10ºF to 40ºF. The environment involves continuous exposure to airborne particles, active mechanical equipment, and operational noise/vibration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requires the physical ability to stand, walk, bend, reach, and lift for extended shifts (10–12 hours). Must possess manual dexterity to operate tools/equipment and effective oral/auditory communication abilities, with or without reasonable accommodations.&amp;nbsp;Ability to regularly lift/move up to 25 pounds independently and occasionally up to 50 pounds with assistance. Requires sharp close-range and peripheral visual acuity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company match that vests immediately upon participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and additional sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our company is committed to fair hiring practices and complies with all applicable laws, including the Colorado Job Application Fairness Act (JAFA). In accordance with JAFA, we will not request your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution on your initial application for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;When submitting supporting documents such as a resume, curriculum vitae (CV), or educational transcripts, you may voluntarily redact or omit any information that would identify your age. This includes:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of birth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of attendance at educational institutions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dates of graduation &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your decision to redact this information will not adversely affect the consideration of your application. We evaluate all candidates based on their skills, qualifications, and experience. Please be aware that should you receive a conditional offer of employment, we may be required to request this information for legally permissible purposes, such as verifying eligibility for employment or for benefits administration and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Colorado Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$18.25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$18.25 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into the Senior Director of National Production, you will oversee all fulfillment processes (warehouse, portioning, and pick &amp;amp; pack) within a HF Distribution Centre. Your focus is to ensure that our customers receive a perfect box on time; create, develop, and manage a high-performing team; and drive continuous improvement initiatives and process rollouts to achieve cost and operational targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Leadership Team, you will play a key role in shaping and building HelloFresh’s operational scale and capability of the future, as we strive to win our customers with high levels of service, quality and choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team multi-department team consisting of Operations Managers, Supervisors, and Coordinators/Team Leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a high-performing culture, with focus on leadership, accountability, engagement, continuous learning and speed/agility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up, manage, and be accountable for key performance indicators and targets, with focus on employee safety, food safety, quality, order accuracy, cost, and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Planning, Supply Chain, and Logistics leaders and teams to deliver production plans that optimize product freshness, on-time delivery, while delivering on DC targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tomorrow better than today! Drive continuous improvement by collaborating with teams/Ops Excellence in identifying, scoping, and delivering initiatives and leading/coaching teams through positive and focused change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate root-cause analysis and implement corrective actions to prevent recurring product and performance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, improve, and setup standard processes, onboarding, and training in all fulfillment processes - Warehouse, Portioning, and Pick &amp;amp; Pack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the DC achieves and/or exceeds the Global DC Audit and regional Occupational Health &amp;amp; Safety standards; oversee facility and equipment upgrades and maintenance to achieve and/or exceed standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Ops Excellence, SCM Tech, and other CA/global resources to enable our team and deliver on system, data, and process improvements within the DC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and build a work environment focused on Health &amp;amp; Safety. Work in compliance with OH&amp;amp;S acts and regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use personal protective and safety equipment and clothing as directed by the employer and report workplace hazards and dangers to the supervisor or employer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of Manufacturing and/or Supply Chain experience with a Bachelor’s and/or Master’s degree in Engineering, Business or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of OHS and Food Safety and its application in a warehouse and production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing a large scale operations with multiple management tiers and large employee headcount&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, enthusiasm, and a can-do attitude. Used to working in a high pressure, fast paced, and constantly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and self-motivation. We seek a leader who competes to win and have the burning desire to make a meaningful difference in our business and lives of our employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An authentic leader, who’s able to build strong relationships, clearly communicate and motivate, and drive accountability in all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective collaborator, who empowers and enables others to share ideas, raises awareness, gets buy-in, and and delivers fast and well-rounded solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of manufacturing and warehouse systems and controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple projects and assignments able to prioritize and meet budgets deadlines and achieve objectives;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain sensitive and confidential information;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications and/or licenses with Lean Six Sigma preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to travel within Canada&amp;nbsp; up to 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;em&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, please click the &quot;Apply Now&quot; button. If this role doesn&#39;t quite match what you&#39;re looking for, but you&#39;d like to know more about joining the HelloFresh team, please visit our Jobs page to view our other vacancies. We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;On top of base salary and amazing benefits, this role is also eligible for the HelloFresh equity program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#JD1003&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Mississauga, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Site QA/QC Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our dynamic, fast-growing team in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;100&quot;&gt;Bleiswijk&lt;/strong&gt;. As a key member of the Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance (FSQA) department, you will drive the initiatives that define the quality of every HelloFresh box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;You will be on the front lines of our fulfillment center, optimizing daily processes and partnering closely with operational teams to ensure a gold standard of quality for our customers. When challenges arise or unannounced audits occur, you are the expert who steps forward to ensure compliance and maintain our high operational momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Management Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary driver of the Quality Management System (QMS), ensuring the site remains compliant with all internal standards and external regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and refine internal quality processes to bridge the gap between high-speed operations and flawless food safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Work side-by-side with production and logistics teams to embed a &quot;quality-first&quot; mindset and optimize daily fulfillment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Take a leading role in conducting internal audits and GMP rounds, while serving as the key point of contact for supervising external and unannounced audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the wider Site Quality team to spearhead strategic projects that drive the evolution of the HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the investigation and follow-up for supplier non-conformities and consumer complaints, turning feedback into actionable site improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;2-5 years work experience in a quality function within the food industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are accurate and goal oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are able to present in a fast-paced and continuously changing work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You enjoy working with other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You have experience with quality systems such as IFS, BRC or FSSC22000.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English and Dutch (must).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop and, if necessary for your position, a phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your future with a pension plan through Aegon Cappital (age-based rates, 50/50 split).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a 7,5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis (2026), plus free access to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a flexible hybrid work setup with a €2.40 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start with 24 days of annual leave (pro-rata), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, and €0.23 per km for car/bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access internal/external opportunities aligned with our Job Framework, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated annual budget to help you keep learning, developing new skills, and growing your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€20/month), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;HelloFresh is on a mission to change the way people eat, forever!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Since our 2011 founding in Europe’s vibrant tech hub, Berlin, we’ve become the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, delivering to over 4.2 million households worldwide in 15 countries across 3 continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our more than 15,000 employees from over 70+ nationalities are the heart and soul of our diverse, fast-paced and dynamic environment where innovation and smart, fast action is encouraged.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We will encourage you to make an immediate impact in your area of work as well as empower you to grow your career with us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a culturally-switched-on Social Content Creator to shape how HelloFresh and Green Chef show up organically across TikTok and Instagram, while also building paid hooks that amplify what&#39;s working. You&#39;re a storyteller first, someone who can capture a real moment, build a brand world, and move at the speed of culture. You work closely with Creative Strategy, PR and product teams to make sure content is joined up, whether that&#39;s amplifying a launch, staying ahead of a sensitive moment, or keeping your creative output aligned with what&#39;s happening across the broader business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organic content creation (60%):&lt;/strong&gt; Own the creative production for HelloFresh and Green Chef&#39;s organic social channels, TikTok, Instagram Reels, and Stories. Ideate, film, and edit content that feels genuinely native to each platform and each brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural moments and reactive content:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re plugged in. You spot a trend, a moment, or a cultural conversation and move fast, translating it into content that&#39;s relevant to HelloFresh or Green Chef without feeling forced or late.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EGC and community-first content:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion employee-generated and community content that makes both brands feel human and real. Whether it&#39;s a team member&#39;s kitchen, a customer&#39;s box arrival, or a behind-the-scenes prep moment, you know how to shape raw material into something worth watching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Copy and community voice:&lt;/strong&gt; Write captions that earn the scroll-stop and comments that make the brand feel like a person. You&#39;re in the comments sparking conversations, replying in a way that builds a following, and turning passive viewers into people who actually care about the brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong point of view and aren&#39;t afraid to use it, but you also know which hills aren&#39;t worth dying on. You can read a moment, take a calculated risk on a spiky caption, and pull back when the brand&#39;s reputation matters more than the engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand world content:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and hold the visual and tonal brand worlds for both HelloFresh and Green Chef, they are distinct, and you&#39;ll maintain that distinction while keeping content fresh, platform-native, and never stale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentary-style storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;You’re comfortable being front of camera. Bring depth and craft to both brands, following a Green Chef recipe from field to fork, documenting what a real week of HelloFresh cooking looks like, or capturing the texture of life inside the business. You shoot and edit with intention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid video hooks (40%):&lt;/strong&gt; Convert organic learnings into paid-ready hooks and short-form ad formats. Work with the paid social team to identify what&#39;s resonating organically and rapidly translate it into tested paid creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trend research and idea generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Constantly scouting, TikTok, Instagram, YouTube Shorts, food culture, competitor brands, and bringing a consistent pipeline of fresh ideas to the team each week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a social content, content creator, or digital media role, with a portfolio showing range across organic and paid formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine feel for culture and platform behaviour. You know what&#39;s trending and when to react before it fizzles out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident filming and editing across formats: short Reels, talking-head content, documentary-style sequences, and reactive lo-fi content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong eye for brand aesthetics, you can hold two distinct brand worlds in your head and create for both without conflating them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable on camera, directing non-professional talent, and drawing out natural, authentic moments from colleagues or founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and organised, you can manage content calendars, shoot logistics, and cross-team briefs without things slipping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience with longer-form documentary or editorial social content, food and lifestyle niches, or building EGC programmes from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chronically online in the best possible way. You treat your social feeds as ongoing creative research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office! (London site only)&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Innovation team is looking for a Sourcing Manager, Canadian New Ingredients to own the commercial and operational side of bringing new ingredients to HelloFresh. Supporting the Canadian Product team, you are accountable for the full journey of an innovation ingredient - from finding the perfect supplier, negotiation and onboarding, to a live SKU in our boxes.&lt;br&gt;Where the broader product team identifies what ingredients we should pursue, you are responsible for making them happen. You engage suppliers, negotiate the terms, and own the end-to-end process that takes a new ingredient from opportunity to operational reality - fast. You will work closely with FSQA, Procurement, Operations, Planning, and Marketing, and you are measured by your ability to move innovation ingredients through that system without losing speed or quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Reachout: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and initiate contact with potential new suppliers for ingredients in the innovation pipeline. Communicate ingredient specifications clearly, coordinate sample submissions, and manage supplier relationships through the evaluation process. You set the tone for new supplier relationships from day one and remain the primary point of contact through onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Relationships: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the full scope of commercial terms with innovation ingredient suppliers, including pricing, volume commitments, supply agreements, payment terms, exclusivity arrangements, and brand partnership structures such as co-marketing programs or product-for-placement deals. You understand what a sound commercial arrangement looks like across all of these dimensions and you negotiate terms that work for HelloFresh while building durable supplier relationships. You partner with Strategic Sourcing to ensure alignment with broader procurement strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End New Ingredient Onboarding: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the full onboarding process for all new ingredients brought in through the Product Innovation pipeline. This means running the NID Fast Track from Ingredient Brief through Vendor Reachout, Price Negotiation, and Sensory Testing, to SKU Onboarding and Post-Launch Review — coordinating every team involved and holding the timeline. For RFP and standard SKU processes, you provide support through approvals navigation and sensory inputs. Nothing launches without your sign-off on the supplier and commercial side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SKU Approvals: &lt;/strong&gt;Steward new new ingredient SKUs through the HelloFresh approval processes. Coordinate across Procurement, Operations, and FSQA to ensure all approvals, specifications, and data requirements are complete before launch. You sequence the work across teams to prevent bottlenecks and keep innovation ingredients on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-Launch Review: &lt;/strong&gt;Track how new ingredients perform after launch across quality, customer feedback, and operational metrics. Flag underperforming ingredients early, lead corrective action where needed, and close the loop on every ingredient you brought in. Performance data informs what the team pursues next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in ingredient sourcing, procurement, or food innovation within CPG, food service, or a related industry — with a demonstrated track record of managing supplier relationships and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen: &lt;/strong&gt;You are comfortable across the full range of supplier commercial terms — pricing, contracts, volume structures, exclusivity, and partnership arrangements. You know what good looks like and you can negotiate to get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Process Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;You have owned complex, multi-stakeholder processes before and you know how to keep them moving. New ingredient onboarding touches FSQA, Procurement, Operations, Planning, and Marketing — you coordinate across all of them without losing momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FSQA Familiarity: &lt;/strong&gt;A working understanding of food safety and quality assurance frameworks — SQF, HACCP, supplier audits, or equivalent. You know what needs sign-off and you do not skip steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You work effectively across Sourcing, Marketing, FSQA, Operations, and Planning. You get alignment without needing to own every decision, and you know when to escalate versus when to just solve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-year degree &lt;/strong&gt;in Business, Supply Chain, Food Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Deal-Maker: &lt;/strong&gt;The commercial side of supplier relationships is where you thrive. You understand the full scope of a supplier agreement, know what terms matter, and negotiate with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Owner: &lt;/strong&gt;You take a new ingredient from first supplier contact to live SKU and you do not let it drift. You track the dependencies, manage the handoffs, and close things out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Connector: &lt;/strong&gt;You build strong relationships — with suppliers and with the internal teams you need to get a new ingredient over the line. People want to work with you because you make their jobs easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Navigator: &lt;/strong&gt;You know how to move fast inside a complex organization. You do not bypass process — you learn it well enough to find the fastest legitimate path through it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;On top of base salary and amazing benefits, this role is also eligible for the HelloFresh equity program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$88,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$98,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Sourcing Strategy Manager to join our New Concepts team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing and executing end-to-end sourcing strategies for finished goods — from initial product concept through supplier selection, commercialization, and in-market performance. You will lead the sourcing of third-party manufactured products, owning the full lifecycle from co-manufacturer qualification to supplier portfolio governance. You will play a leading role in driving finished goods innovation — identifying, qualifying, and commercializing new products with co-manufacturers and third-party producers — while building a supplier network that delivers on cost, quality, reliability, and scale. You will have key responsibilities over finished goods SKU ideation and onboarding, co-manufacturer selection and qualification, supplier relationship management, price negotiations and contract management, capacity planning, and end-to-end strategic sourcing — while continuously raising the bar on supplier performance and portfolio governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you will help drive the strategy and framework for how the business interacts with its supplier base and have a direct stake in affecting bottom-line profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will own…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Network Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute sourcing strategies for finished goods categories that align with company growth objectives, innovation priorities, and financial targets — owning the strategy from brief to in-market delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize a scalable co-manufacturer and third-party supplier network, identifying operational capability gaps, qualifying new partners, and proposing risk mitigation plans before they become supply failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply deep industry knowledge to design and manage supplier segmentation frameworks, Supplier Business Reviews, and performance governance that drive measurable improvements in quality, service, and cost competitiveness across the finished goods portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; New Product Commercialization&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Culinary, Operations, FSQA, and Commercial teams to translate new product concepts into sourced, qualified, manufacturable finished goods — bridging culinary vision and operational reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end finished goods sourcing process for new product development — from co-manufacturer identification, RFP, and qualification through pilot runs, FSQA sign-off, commercial negotiation, and successful first-ship commercialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance customer experience, operational complexity, food safety requirements, and total cost of ownership when onboarding new finished goods SKUs and co-manufacturing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Financial Performance &amp;amp; Cost Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage individual sourcing contributions to annual business planning and team financial targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement cost optimization initiatives and execute supplier negotiations to improve margins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations and contract management for mid to high value agreements, balancing financial savings with long-term supplier partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supply Chain Resilience &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute proactive risk management and supply continuity strategies across assigned finished goods suppliers and co-manufacturing partners — including dual-sourcing, capacity contingency planning, and exit sequencing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold suppliers accountable through established performance metrics, service level agreements, and corrective action programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage and resolve day-to-day operational, quality and supply conflicts as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Process Excellence &amp;amp; Data Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive iterations and continuous improvement of sourcing processes, supplier onboarding frameworks, and category management guidelines of a team level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and analytics to build data driven solutions and inform strategic decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you will work…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Autonomous Execution &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work highly autonomously to manage the scope, timeline, and execution of both short- and long-term strategic sourcing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Daily sourcing decisions and negotiations to broader department strategies and corporate objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage uncertainty independently by developing successful, actionable solutions to complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully manage interactions with stakeholders across Product, Operations, Finance, Legal and FSQA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence project outcomes and decisions without direct authority by leveraging data, business insight, and strong relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Individual Contribution &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a recognized subject matter expert within your respective category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively take ownership of your career path and dedicate time to mentoring and coaching more junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically challenge the outcome of other team members work for technical soundness and provide constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Success in this role looks like…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Short- and long-term sourcing project and product launches are executed on time, within scope, and with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network &amp;amp; Supplier Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Assigned third party manufacturers consistently meet quality, service, and cost metrics through proactive performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Sourcing driven financial targets, margin improvement goals, and cost optimization metrics are successfully achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Sourcing standards, tools, and workflows are continuously challenged, updated, and improved on a team level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Fruitful, collaborative relationships are maintained with stakeholders, accelerating cross functional decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;At a Minimum, You Have…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience in strategic sourcing, category management, or supply chain operations — with direct experience sourcing finished goods, managing co-manufacturers, or commercializing new products through third-party manufacturing partners in the food or consumer goods industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree, preferably in supply chain, business, engineering, or a related field (or equivalent relevant experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Google Suite applications (especially Google Sheets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of successfully leading large initiatives and sourcing events through strategic sourcing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high value contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel as needed (up to 20%), with destinations determined by business need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
