&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a hands-on CapEx procurement expert, not a generalist. You&#39;ll lead strategic sourcing for capital investments across HelloFresh&#39;s European production sites: machinery, automated lines, Material Handling Equipment (MHE), and facility build-outs. You&#39;ll be embedded with Engineering and Operations from spec to handover, owning multi-million euro decisions. This role reports to the Director Indirect Procurement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, confident, entrepreneurial, and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for data processing, optimisation &amp;amp; reporting, ability to navigate ambiguity, attention to detail and great stakeholder management ability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end CapEx sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value capital projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a multi-year CapEx category strategy covering production machinery, conveyors &amp;amp; MHE, cold storage, and building fit-outs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Total Cost of Ownership modelling and investment scenario analysis with Engineering and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Early Supplier Involvement (ESI) to influence specs and design-to-cost outcomes before projects are locked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets: qualification, performance tracking, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Project Management and Site Operations from inception through commissioning — not just at the buying stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor equipment markets, supplier landscape, and technology trends relevant to food production and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support broader Procurement Ops team, if necessary, in MRO, Facilities Management, Utilities, etc. projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in procurement, with at least 3–4 years of dedicated CapEx category ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record sourcing capital equipment: production machinery, automated systems, conveyors/MHE, or equivalent industrial CapEx&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering degree or equivalent technical background strongly preferred: you need to speak your stakeholders&#39; language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale sourcing across multiple European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; German and/or French is a meaningful advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong TCO and financial modelling skills; able to build business cases alongside Engineering and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able travel to production sites across Europe if necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initially we offer 2 years contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor Europe is scaling rapidly, and as the complexity of our product offering grows, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Manager, Menu Performance&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize the performance of our weekly menu plan and surrounding processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a data-driven, hands-on building role. You will decide what tools, systems, and processes we need to optimize our weekly processes, and use all of the AI tools at your disposal to develop / optimize them. You’ll be the ultimate owner of our weekly product cycle: which means optimizing our menu for maximal engagement and retention of our customers, as well as simplifying / automating as much of our internal process as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re analytical supply chain master who wants more exposure to product/customer, a systems thinker who loves building and improving processes, or a technical generalist who wants to push the boundaries of what’s newly possible with AI - this is a chance to supercharge one of Europe’s fastest-growing food-tech brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize menu performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve our menu planning model: Refine the models that architect our weekly menu—optimizing for customer engagement and retention within&amp;nbsp;real constraints: seasonality, cost targets, and production capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find out what actually drives outcomes: Run correlation and driver analysis on which menu attributes genuinely move engagement and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model the commercial impact: Understand and forecast how menu decisions land on cost per meal and profitability to course-correct early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the weekly menu cycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer data into action: Own the weekly menu review, turning customer ratings and qualitative feedback into insights the Culinary and Kitchen Operations teams can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the process reliably: Ensure menus are built and uploaded on time, coordinating across R&amp;amp;D, Supply Chain, and Production as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recipe/menu data quality: Challenge our data hygiene practices and implement the processes and controls that ensure our data is complete and accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the tools and automate the work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate meal onboarding: Take our concept-to-launch process apart, find the unnecessary manual steps, and eliminate or automate them to&amp;nbsp;improve speed to market. Expect to build software and write scripts to get there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and extend the Product tool stack: Take our existing tools and improve them, consolidate them, and build what’s missing. Build systems that survive without you in the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder: You are comfortable with ambiguity. You don’t need a playbook to be effective; you are excited to write it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-obsessed: You’re fluent enough to query and QA data yourself, and can create data visualizations that separate signal from noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker: You don’t just fix a problem; you fix the process that allowed the problem to happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and process-oriented: You can quickly spot the bottlenecks in a process and picture the improvements concretely enough to build toward them; you love creating issue trees and driving to the root cause of problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native: You’re on the cutting edge of what tools are available and have built things beyond what your formal background should allow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency: You don’t get stuck easily: you ask why, you find workarounds, and you hustle to keep the project on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5+ years in Product/Business Operations, Analytics, Management Consulting, or Operational Excellence. Experience in FMCG, E-Comm, or Food-Tech is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale Exposure: You have a track record of transitioning manual, spreadsheet-based processes into automated, scalable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Toolkit: Advanced in Excel/Google Sheets and proficiency with SQL is required; experience Python is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Experience: You should have numerous examples of what you’ve built with AI coding tools (e.g. Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot or equivalent).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: Proven ability to influence leaders across different departments and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom to initiate, execute and implement your own ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lots of learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24&amp;nbsp; holidays based on 40 hours per week per year, pro rata&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid work setup - with roughly 2 days in our Amsterdam office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of travel expenses to the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount on your ClassPass subscription, and a discount for your gym membership via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount on your additional health insurance through Zilveren Kruis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A discount on your weekly, Factor, HelloFresh and/or Green Chef box in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy lunches, fruit and snacks in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social activities with our culturally diverse team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;factor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#JD1008&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Backend Engineer to join our Customer Value Optimization (CVO) tribe at HelloFresh. This is a high-impact individual contributor role sitting at the intersection of Data Science and Backend Engineering. You&#39;ll be the technical bridge that turns ML models into reliable, scalable production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across squads within the CVO tribe, partnering closely with Data Scientists and Backend Engineers to define how we serve ML models at scale, raise the technical bar, and accelerate the tribe&#39;s ability to deliver value to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and own robust, scalable infrastructure for live serving of ML models in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical bridge between Data Science and Backend Engineering teams within the CVO tribe — translating Data Science needs into scalable engineering solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive best practices for model serving, APIs, and system design across squads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-squad technical initiatives, from architecture decisions to hands-on implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Scientists to ensure models are production-ready — performant, observable, and maintainable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to tribe-wide engineering standards and shape the technical roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support engineers across squads without direct line management responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of backend engineering experience, with a strong foundation in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and operating ML model serving systems or ML platforms in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of distributed systems, APIs, and micro services architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of working across team boundaries to deliver complex, cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills — able to work fluently with Data Scientists, Machine Learning Engineers, and Data Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach with strong technical judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML frameworks and serving tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with feature stores, model registries, or MLOps tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in e-commerce, subscription, or personalization domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Box Discount&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food Puns&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 3 days in office per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$182,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to the success of the Food Systems Alliance by providing technical leadership across multiple engineering teams and business domains. At a pivotal stage in our transition from bespoke operational tooling to globally scalable software products, you will help shape architecture, drive technical decision-making, and translate complex supply chain processes into robust, maintainable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with engineers and operational stakeholders, you will influence technical direction, promote engineering best practices, and support the delivery of scalable solutions that power HelloFresh&#39;s global supply chain operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; cross-squad technical initiatives to design and build modular, globally scalable backend solutions for complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act&lt;/strong&gt; as the technical bridge between engineering squads and operational stakeholders (Procurement, Production, Data) to architect reliable, long-term systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive&lt;/strong&gt; engineering best practices around system design, code quality, and maintainability across the entire Food Systems Alliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize&lt;/strong&gt; complex data workflows and event-driven architectures to seamlessly support day-to-day production and scaling needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical leadership &lt;/strong&gt;through architecture reviews, design discussions, and knowledge sharing across engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape&lt;/strong&gt; the technical roadmap by proactively identifying architectural bottlenecks and proposing strategic improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the technical lead &lt;/strong&gt;on backend-heavy product problems, designing, building and operating the services and systems needed to deliver them reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work beyond your specialization&lt;/strong&gt; when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate what you build&lt;/strong&gt;. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive backend engineering expertise, ideally within Golang and JVM-based ecosystems (Kotlin or Java), coupled with a strong grasp of distributed systems and microservices architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of designing and operating highly scalable, event-driven systems using messaging technologies such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, or SQS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to work fluidly across team boundaries, translating complex business or operational requirements into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern cloud infrastructure (AWS, Kubernetes) and observability practices, with the capacity to establish and advocate for tribe-wide standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in&amp;nbsp; Golang or Java and hands on experience building distributed systems in production: event-driven and asynchronous flows, clear service contracts, and designing for partial failure. You operate what you build, including its observability and data layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to problem-solving, possessing strong technical judgment and a passion for mentoring fellow engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at a global scale, supporting 6+ million customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to the workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Backend Engineer to join our Ingredient to Product tribe at HelloFresh. This is a high-impact individual contributor role sitting at the intersection of Food Systems&amp;nbsp; and Backend Engineering — you&#39;ll be the technical bridge that identifies business and technical gaps and works with business leads to turn requirements into scalable production systems and solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across squads within the Food Systems alliance, partnering closely with Backend Engineers to ensure E2E menu operational efficiencies are met, raise the technical bar, and accelerate the tribe&#39;s ability to deliver value to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh we are moving away from a model where software developers just execute tickets toward one where product engineers are trusted to own customer problems. A Product Engineer takes a problem, forms a point of view, validates it with customers and data, and ships it using AI as a force multiplier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and own robust, scalable infrastructure for menu operations and be a key driver to ensure a successful xPS migration in the US market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical bridge between Food Systems business leads and Backend Engineering teams within the Ingredient to Product tribe — translating needs into scalable engineering solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the technical lead on backend-heavy product problems, designing, building and operating the services and systems needed to deliver them reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work beyond your specialization when the problem demands it. Your specialization is your anchor, not your boundary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate what you build. You instrument, monitor, and improve your systems in production. Shipping is the beginning of the learning cycle, not the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with AI tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) beyond casual experimentation. You use AI agents every day. You have a practical sense of how the context you provide to AI tools shapes output quality, and how to set boundaries on AI-generated work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong fluency in Python (Golang is a plus) and hands on experience building distributed systems in production: event-driven and asynchronous flows, clear service contracts, and designing for partial failure. You operate what you build, including its observability and data layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take full ownership. You have a bias to ship. You finish the last twenty percent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have product sense and are opinionated about what should be built and why, and you can back that opinion with data and user evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Join HelloFresh in Warsaw as part of HelloTech, our global technology organisation of 1000+ people building the digital products behind our end-to-end food experience from meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood. Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model runs on technology at every step: customer-facing apps, personalization, pricing, forecasting, supply chain, and food-waste reduction. Each of our brands serves distinct customer needs, but all are powered by the shared platforms, data, and engineering standards that HelloTech builds. HelloTech is organized into autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific domain end-to-end. From our Warsaw office, you&#39;ll help shape scalable, data-driven products used across all our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to keep improving how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh&#39;s products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the Shopping AI &amp;amp; Search squad, part of the Shopping Journey tribe within our Consumer Alliance. Shopping Journey&#39;s mission is to help customers build lasting habits with HelloFresh, making it effortless to manage a subscription, find and order what they love, and get help when something goes wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within that tribe, Shopping AI &amp;amp; Search owns a specific bet: building unified AI Assistant experiences for HelloFresh customers inside the chatbot and across the broader shopping journey, including personalized and conversational search and proactive in-app recommendations. The goal is a shopping experience that feels like it understands the customer, wherever they encounter it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Backend Product Engineer, you&#39;ll provide technical leadership across this initiative, shaping architecture, driving technical decisions, and helping the squad (and its neighbors) build AI-powered systems that are fast, reliable, and genuinely useful, not just impressive in a demo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical architecture for unified AI Assistant experiences spanning conversational search, personalized search, and proactive in-app recommendations — so the experience holds together whether the customer is in the chatbot or elsewhere in the app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end technical decisions around integrating LLM-powered capabilities into customer-facing systems, weighing quality, latency, and cost at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical bridge between Shopping AI &amp;amp; Search, neighboring squads across Shopping Journey, and product/platform stakeholders, so architecture stays coherent as the assistant expands to new surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive engineering best practices for building and operating AI-powered systems — observability, graceful degradation, and testing strategies for components that are inherently probabilistic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership through architecture reviews, design discussions, and hands-on mentoring that raises the engineering bar across the tribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI coding tools (e.g. Claude, Cursor) as a standard part of how you build, and help shape how the wider team adopts AI-assisted engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the technical roadmap by spotting architectural bottlenecks early and proposing improvements before they become blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of backend engineering experience, with deep expertise in distributed systems, microservices, and event-driven architecture (Kafka, RabbitMQ, or AWS SQS/SNS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on proficiency in Go, or another modern backend language (Java/Kotlin, Python, or TypeScript/Node.js), with the willingness to work in Go, our squad&#39;s primary stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience integrating LLMs or other AI services into production systems via APIs/SDKs. This isn&#39;t an ML engineering role — we&#39;re not training foundation models — but you&#39;re comfortable designing around how they behave: latency, cost, and non-determinism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine, daily hands-on use of AI coding tools (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, or similar) that goes beyond casual experimentation, with a practical sense of how the context you give these tools shapes what you get back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern cloud infrastructure (AWS, Kubernetes) and observability practices, with the ability to set and advocate for standards across the tribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning ambiguous product problems — search relevance, recommendation quality, conversational UX — into a clear technical roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to problem-solving, strong technical judgment, and a real interest in mentoring other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and comfort working with senior stakeholders and distributed, international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior experience with search or recommendation systems is a plus, not a requirement what matters most is your ability to design and operate reliable, scalable backend systems and reason well about new ones.&amp;nbsp;Above all, we&#39;re looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We know there&#39;s more than one path to the skills this role needs — if you don&#39;t tick every box but think you&#39;d thrive here, we&#39;d still like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&amp;nbsp;Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&amp;nbsp;Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&amp;nbsp;Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&amp;nbsp;The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we&#39;d love to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month. Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager, you will own and evolve HelloFresh&#39;s benefit creation platform, which defines, configures, and governs every discount, voucher, and reward across all our global brands and channels. Leading a dedicated squad of engineers, you will transform this high-impact system into a flexible, scalable, and highly automated platform. This is a foundational infrastructure role where you will design self-serve tooling and robust governance rules, ensuring our marketing and commercial teams can safely launch campaigns without engineering bottlenecks. Your work will directly protect our P&amp;amp;L margins while unlocking innovative, automated capabilities for future customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the long-term vision,&lt;/strong&gt; strategy, and roadmap for our global benefit and incentive platform, setting the path toward intelligent, automated creation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design scalable platform primitives&lt;/strong&gt; and reusable building blocks to eliminate custom, one-off engineering for individual marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish automated governance layers,&lt;/strong&gt; including margin floors and stacking checks, to systematically protect business profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build intuitive back-office tooling&lt;/strong&gt; that enables commercial and growth teams to configure standard campaigns independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment&lt;/strong&gt; across international teams, encouraging adoption of a unified platform contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate and implement automation&lt;/strong&gt; and smart interfaces where they bring the highest return on investment, balancing flexibility with system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in platform product management is essential, with a proven track record of building scalable internal tools, APIs, or foundational infrastructure rather than just user-facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 6+ years of product management experience, specifically operating already at a Senior or Staff level within complex systems across multiple markets or diverse business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership and communication skills are required to align senior, cross-functional stakeholders and champion platform adoption without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It is a strong advantage if you bring a background in commercial strategy or promotional economics, enabling you to design smart business guardrails that balance marketing flexibility with P&amp;amp;L protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data analysis and technical architecture is highly valued, helping you effectively design reliable automation and interpret experiment data alongside engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point (Prosta 20).&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our New Ventures team is focused on growing our global footprint by launching our core products in new markets and expanding across multiple brands and verticals. We’re a globally distributed team operating across 7+ brands in 15+ countries, building desirable products and seamless, engaging experiences that customers haven’t seen before. With many exciting projects underway, we’re driven to generate the next billion-dollar business—so if you’re passionate about tackling bold challenges, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a close-knit group of engineers of different stripes - developers, designers, and product owners - who are working together to solve interesting e-commerce and supply chain problems around how people eat. Sometimes, this involves implementing features to improve the user&lt;br&gt;journey and making it easier for our customers to buy amazing food. Other times, this means creating stable software solutions that keep our distribution centers running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an engineer to help implement solutions &amp;amp; write beautiful code, working with various team members as we build out our consumer facing applications &amp;amp; the infrastructure that supports them. As a member of our Toronto team, you’ll work with highly-skilled engineers, who in collaboration with our other global teams, have turned HelloFresh into the #1 meal delivery service in the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of scalable backend platforms and distributed systems, leveraging AI-assisted and agentic engineering workflows to accelerate delivery and improve system quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical discovery, requirements refinement, and solution architecture in ambiguous problem spaces, &lt;strong&gt;translating product and business goals into scalable execution strategies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and optimize AI-enabled development workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including spec-driven development, agent orchestration, context management, automated verification, and quality validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product, platform, and engineering teams to foster a strong product engineering mindset focused on customer value, experimentation, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architectural discussions, mentor engineers in modern backend and AI-assisted engineering practices, and establish standards for observability, quality engineering, and system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and AI tooling to continuously enhance engineering effectiveness, software quality, and organizational scalability while ensuring strong human oversight and operational accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with microservice architectures, event-driven systems (e.g. Kafka, RabbitMQ), and distributed systems design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Docker, Kubernetes, and modern CI/CD practices in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with relational and document databases, including PostgreSQL, MySQL, and/or MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI proficiency and advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;. Hands-on experience leveraging AI technologies through AI-assisted engineering workflows, LLM integrations, agentic development patterns, or ML-driven product capabilities to improve engineering velocity and product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency and production experience with one or more backend languages such as Golang, Python, or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills. You are comfortable working closely with frontend engineers, designers, product managers, and distributed teams, and can influence technical direction while bringing clarity to complex topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - We support your career progression and invest in your continued learning through experiences and initiatives owned by our dedicated L&amp;amp;D team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer in our Supply Chain Management organization, you will be responsible for defining, securing, and implementing technical solutions for business problems. You will play a critical role as our systems scale to handle a jump from 1.2 million to over 2.4 million produced boxes per week due to recent software product consolidation. You will look after speeding up development, decision-making, and problem-solving. You will work with our neighboring teams to ensure that our efforts aim to achieve a clearer architecture and boundaries between tech teams to support autonomy. You will communicate directly with our business stakeholders and multiple tech teams supporting local markets. You will report to the Director of Engineering in the Production tribe. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume technical leadership within a tribe and own the most challenging tech decisions, including architecture, design, development, deployment, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the teams in the architectural design and help to maintain architectural integrity in the scope of the tribe and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend a significant portion of your time orchestrating code generation—guiding AI coding agents, rigorously reviewing their implementations, and refining logic based on organization needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve software problems that have visible risks, roadblocks, and constraints. You will navigate an environment that is approximately &lt;strong&gt;70% greenfield development and 30% legacy systems&lt;/strong&gt;, managing dependencies, data quality, compliance, and architectural transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor more junior engineers by fostering a culture of continuous learning and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, 10+ years of engineering experience, including 2+ years in a staff/principal level capacity and technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong capability in working with different stakeholders and experience addressing physical world problems with software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-Stack &amp;amp; Agentic Engineering: Deep problem-solving skills and full-stack proficiency (e.g., C#, Python, Golang, and modern frontend technologies). You bring hands-on experience leveraging AI coding agents (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code) in production, moving beyond basic prompting to master context engineering, workflow decomposition, and the implementation of strict guardrails for reliable agent outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data engineering fundamentals is highly desirable, including expertise in data modeling, governance, quality assurance, and proficiency in data processing and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and implementing modular systems, including proficiency in synchronous/asynchronous communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player attitude and a passion for helping others grow through peer-to-peer mentoring, knowledge-sharing sessions, and advocating for best engineering practices, such as CI/CD, TDD, BDD, DDD, and Design Patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An agile mindset with the ability to advocate for cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interacting with front-end developers, designers, product managers and our teams around the world is very much part of our day-to-day, so communication skills are vital. We are looking for strong problem-solvers who can apply their engineering skills to a wide range of platforms and environments, while also acting as an ambassador to coach team members and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with a discounted Urban Sports Club membership and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factor_&lt;/strong&gt;, eine Marke von HelloFresh, sucht für den Standort in &lt;strong&gt;Verden &lt;/strong&gt;einen &lt;strong&gt;Gabelstaplerfahrer oder eine Gabelstaplerfahrerin (m/w/d/x)&lt;/strong&gt;. Gemeinsam mit Teams aus anderen Bereichen bist Du verantwortlich für die Unterstützung bei der Zubereitung und dem Versand unserer beliebten verzehrfertigen Mahlzeiten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist verantwortlich für die Be- und Entladung von Lastkraftwagen sowie den innerbetrieblichen Transport von Lebensmitteln und Verpackungsmaterialien.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bestückst die Warenbereitstellung für die Produktion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du transportierst palettierte Waren zu den Ladebuchten für abholende Lastkraftwagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du buchst präzise jede Materialbewegung mittels Handscanner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hältst konsequent die spezifischen Vorgaben im Umgang mit Lebensmitteln ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist verantwortlich für die Produktivität und Fehlervermeidung im eigenen Arbeitsbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du stellst zuverlässig die Versorgung der Produktion mit Lebensmittel-Paletten oder -Kisten sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast einen Staplerschein und bringst Erfahrung im Umgang mit Staplern mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über gute Deutsch- oder Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine Belehrung nach § 43 Infektionsschutzgesetz (IfSG) – ehemals Gesundheitszeugnis – ist wünschenswert, aber keine Voraussetzung. Falls nicht vorhanden, übernehmen wir die Organisation und Kosten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist bereit, in einem Schichtbetrieb zu arbeiten - auch an Wochenenden und Feiertagen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist bereit, in wechselnden Temperaturbereichen zwischen 4 °C und 26 °C zu arbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst die körperliche Belastbarkeit mit, um Produkte mit einem Gewicht von bis zu 10 kg (selten auch bis zu 23 kg)&amp;nbsp; zu heben.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein sorgfältiger Umgang mit Lebensmitteln und die Einhaltung entsprechender Vorschriften sind für Dich selbstverständlich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein hohes Qualitätsbewusstsein, ein Grundverständnis für Qualitätsmerkmale von Lebensmitteln und bringst Gewissenhaftigkeit bei der Prüfung von Produkten mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basislohn 18,23 € / Stunde&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rabatte auf deine Factor_ Box&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding + Trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Schulungen und Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persönliche Sicherheitsausrüstung + spezielle Kleidung für Kältearbeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Heißgetränke während der Arbeitszeit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
