&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end purchase order process for your assigned supplier portfolio, ensuring timely and accurate deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate daily with suppliers, Production, and internal stakeholders to resolve shortages, quality issues, and delivery deviations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and improve supplier performance by tracking KPIs such as OTIFIQ, error rates, and adherence to standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly operational planning by validating forecasts, assessing risks, and proposing mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process improvements to strengthen supply chain efficiency and prevent recurring issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to secure ingredient availability for upcoming menus and promotional volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: Your Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in supply planning, procurement, logistics, or a similar operational role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and proficiency with Excel or other data tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the ability to communicate clearly and collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and proactive working style, with the ability to adapt quickly to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, French and Dutch both written and verbal is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. Skills develop in many ways, and we value diverse experiences. Even if you don’t check every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2025 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 7.5% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work flexibly with our hybrid setup (50% office, 50% remote), plus a €2.40 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees can work from another country for up to 8 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset: participate in Pantry Staple trainings, access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly vrij-mi-bo (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Analyst&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a FULLY ONSITE position at our HELLOFRESH Production facility in Goodyear, AZ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Schedule: (Tuesday - Saturday 8:00am - 5:00pm) Schedule varies based on support needs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we want to revolutionize the way we eat by making it more convenient and exciting to cook meals from scratch. We have offices all over the world and we deliver delicious meals to millions of people. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We are the industry leader in meal-kit subscription services and we’re growing all the time. We have distinct meal-kit services that cater to everyone with the most menu variety in the market, which allows us to reach an incredibly wide population of people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The HelloFresh team is diverse, high-performing, and international, and our work environment is an inspiring space where you can thrive as a result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come and join the technology team that is revolutionizing how we bring food to our customers tables! As a Systems Analyst, you will support our production systems and work on valuable data analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will ...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support WMS, WES, WCS, and other order processing systems within the fulfillment network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot technical issues in WMS, WES, WCS, and other systems across all operations as they occur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand all available reporting tools, create reports that enable improved operation visibility and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep&amp;nbsp; knowledge of site level operations in order to drive and support continuous improvement efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously review operations setup and drive improvement via enhancements and functionality deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as point of contact for production for all system requests (including order research, ad hoc reporting, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for all level 1 Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document support issues and resolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create Work Instruction and SOP documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training materials for WMS, WES, WCS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task and prioritize tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and reliability to cover scheduled shifts that support 24/7 production operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS degree required.&amp;nbsp; Computer Science, Management Information Systems, or Engineering Degree desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in multi-site industrial distribution, manufacturing, or processing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Efficient Microsoft Office (Excel, Word, Power Point), Google app (Gmail, drive, sheets, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience gathering data and creating custom reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Employee Resource Groups that are open to all employees, including those pertaining to BIPOC, women, veterans, parents, and LGBTQ+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Inclusive, collaborative, and dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company that is disrupting the traditional food supply chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description is intended to provide a general overview of the responsibilities. However, the Company reserves the right to adjust, modify, or reassign work tasks and responsibilities as needed to meet changing business needs, operational requirements, or other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Arizona Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$79,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Enablement Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the end-to-end enablement strategy and delivery of complex, high-impact technology systems across our ANZ operational landscape. Operating with high autonomy, you will lead deep-dive gap analyses to tailor global system blueprints to local market needs, drive technical readiness workstreams, and shape the Launch Team’s playbooks and capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney, Australia&lt;/strong&gt; and reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Launch Team Lead - ANZ&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategy, scope, and delivery of complex, high-impact system launches across the ANZ region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage project plans, timelines, and RAID logs, proactively mitigating risks and managing cross-functional dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead deep-dive gap analyses comparing global tech blueprints against local ANZ requirements, challenging proposals with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical readiness workstreams by partnering with local Operations, Global VSM teams, and Global Tech Squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute rollout training strategies, tracking system adoption rates and minimizing manual workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hypercare periods for high-risk launches, coordinating rapid issue resolution and conducting post-launch reviews to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key interface representing ANZ market needs to Global Product &amp;amp; Tech teams while managing local and global stakeholder relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of project management theories, concepts, methodologies, and launch interdependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience independently managing projects in Supply Chain / Operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great organisation skills with the ability to manage multiple projects without compromising delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in adapting communication styles to manage multi level, cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with demonstrated ability to analyse data for decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly autonomous with strong decision-making skills and the confidence to hold approval authority on technical readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative problem-solver who excels at managing uncertainty and developing successful operational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional communicator, capable of credibly representing market needs to global teams &amp;amp; confident in leading meetings/training sessions with local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player who enjoys elevating team capabilities, refining playbooks, and establishing operational best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HelloFresh Academies - internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At HelloConnect, you will be part of a dynamic team in Inoza tower, BGC that embraces innovation and leverages advanced technology to create exceptional experiences. Our culture is built on collaboration, continuous learning, and a commitment to excellence. You’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects, develop your skills, and grow within a supportive environment that values diverse perspectives and experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take on a key responsibility for driving recruitment strategy, coaching a high-performing team, and ensuring seamless execution of talent acquisition processes across Global Business Services. This role is focused on proactive problem-solving, process compliance, and performance development, while maintaining strong stakeholder relationships and minimizing escalations. The Team Leader also plays a hands-on role in interviews and candidate assessments when required to meet business demands or coach team members in best practices, contributing to our ongoing efforts to drive business success and enhance customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for passionate individuals who can bring their unique skills and ideas to the table. Even if you don&#39;t meet every requirement but believe you’d excel in this role, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals and performance standards for the talent acquisition team, aligned with business objectives and hiring targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic TA planning, including pipeline development, and continuous improvement of sourcing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the first point of contact for escalations and ensure issues are resolved promptly with minimal impact on timelines and stakeholder satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active presence in daily operations while focusing on strategic outcomes and long-term talent acquisition goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development &amp;amp; Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor team members in sourcing, interviewing, stakeholder engagement, and other TA-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular performance reviews, provide real-time feedback, and establish individual development plans to support career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate ongoing training to ensure team alignment on recruitment standards, system usage, and process compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee accurate and timely tracking of requisitions, candidate progress, hiring status, and reporting through the applicant tracking system (ATS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the coordination and quality control of job advertisements, interview logistics, and offer issuance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with HR Operations and other departments to ensure complete, compliant onboarding and pre-employment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to recruitment policies, regulatory requirements, and data privacy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with hiring managers, senior leaders, and other stakeholders to align recruitment outcomes with business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or participate in handshake meetings to gather hiring requirements and set realistic hiring expectations and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver consistent updates on hiring performance and recommend solutions or adjustments as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Support &amp;amp; Ad Hoc Interviews:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step in to conduct interviews or candidate assessments when needed, especially for critical roles, high-volume periods, or team coaching purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support during peak recruitment cycles, ensuring continuity and service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, review, and deliver regular reports and dashboards on recruitment metrics such as time-to-fill, candidate pipeline status, source effectiveness, and offer-to-acceptance ratios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and data-driven recommendations to leadership and stakeholders to improve decision-making and enhance recruitment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data integrity and compliance in all reporting activities through the consistent use of the applicant tracking system and relevant tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead recruitment-related projects and initiatives, such as process automation, DEI efforts, and employer branding campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze recruitment data to identify trends and optimize team performance, candidate experience, and time-to-fill metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the use of new technologies, tools, and platforms that enhance the effectiveness of talent acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Human Resources, Psychology, Business Administration, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6 years of progressive experience in talent acquisition, with a minimum of 3 years in a team leadership or senior specialist role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing full-cycle recruitment in a shared services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coaching, delegation, and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and conflict-resolution abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and reporting skills, with proficiency in ATS platforms and Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple priorities in a dynamic and fast-paced setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Mobility, Diversity, Employer Branding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volume hiring (nice to have)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Beyond the standard package, we offer perks like Long Service Benefits (anniversary bonus) to recognize and celebrate your dedication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritize your well-being by offering mental health support, HMO medical coverage, generous leave benefits plus life insurance for both you and your family&#39;s peace of mind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;: Invest in your personal development with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, plus access to the 360 Learning platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Environment&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a rapidly growing global Business Process Outsourcing company, where you&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse community spanning across multiple continents and cultures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a healthy balance between your professional and personal life, with a supportive environment that prioritizes your well-being and personal time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The first step to your new role starts here. Send in your application, along with your salary expectations and preferred start date. Our dedicated team will thoroughly review your details. We are excited to connect with you soon!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#helloconnect&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#hcgreenhouse&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As Team Lead of Display &amp;amp; Video Marketing, you will take ownership of a critical execution function within the Display &amp;amp; Video Marketing team within the HelloFresh Group’s US portfolio of brands (HelloFresh, Factor, Green Chef, EveryPlate). You will also lead a small team of Specialists across paid programmatic Display &amp;amp; Video user acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary mission will be to drive channel performance across YouTube, Google Demand Gen, and non-Google programmatic display &amp;amp; video channels— whilst developing your team and building the processes that make our Display &amp;amp; Video marketing operation more efficient and scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone ready to step up from expert individual contributor to first-line people leader. You will be accountable for results, energized by coaching others, and rigorous enough to hold the bar on data quality, testing discipline, and creative execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for someone driven to make HelloFresh better. We firmly believe that skills are developed through diverse experiences and unique pathways. Therefore, even if your background doesn&#39;t &quot;tick every box&quot; but you are confident you would excel in this role, we strongly encourage you to apply and share your story with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Display &amp;amp; Video specialists, providing regular 1:1s, clear performance feedback, and visible growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the setup, management, and day-to-day optimization of Display &amp;amp; Video campaigns across YouTube, Google Demand Gen, and additional non-Google programmatic channels (Amazon DSP, AppLovin, The Trade Desk, etc.), ensuring KPIs are met and budgets are paced efficiently across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a structured testing agenda — running A/B tests and audience segmentation experiments across CPAs, ROAS, and retention metrics, and translating results into repeatable playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with CRO, Creative, Brand, and Product teams to ensure a seamless user journey from click to first subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Tracking and Creative Teams to launch new partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate aligned messaging across ad creative alongside the Brand and Creative production teams, leading a continuous feedback loop of testing and learning, collaborating closely with the Brand team and relevant Performance Marketing channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Marketing Analytics and AdTech teams to support the integration of display &amp;amp; video marketing data into Marketing Mix Modelling (MMM) and other core measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close technical or setup gaps that impede channel efficiency, partnering with Product and Tech stakeholders where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain team documentation, reporting dashboards, and marketing calendars to ensure the Display &amp;amp; Video Marketing team operates efficiently and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We evaluate performance and potential through our What &amp;amp; How framework — looking at both what you deliver and how you show up to deliver it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of professional experience in digital marketing, with at least 2–3 years focused on display and/or video-based acquisition media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven hands-on experience managing campaigns in Google Ads, Amazon DSP, AppLovin), at meaningful scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience line-managing or formally mentoring direct reports, with a demonstrated ability to coach, develop, and hold a team to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of tracking and reporting platforms such as GA4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable interpreting performance data across BI tools (Looker, Tableau) and campaign platforms to generate actionable insights — and communicating them clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and running structured experimentation programs (incrementality testing, creative testing) and translating test results into scalable, repeatable approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring an ownership mindset: you take accountability for your team&#39;s results, make data-driven decisions, and proactively close gaps without waiting to be asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills — you can align cross-functional stakeholders, represent your team in senior forums, and build trust across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine team player who values diversity of thought and actively fosters an inclusive, high-performance culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a B2C subscription or e-commerce environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with programmatic display &amp;amp; video platforms (Google Ads, Amazon DSP, The Trade Desk, AppLovin, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Marketing Mix Modelling (MMM) or incrementality measurement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in automation or workflow tooling (e.g., Claude, Gemini, reporting automation, Google Ads Scripts).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3780&quot; data-end=&quot;3791&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and 401(k) with company match (vesting immediately upon participation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO policy and 4 weeks of parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;$0 monthly premium and flexible health plans starting on day one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;85% discount on your HelloFresh subscription and other product offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative, dynamic work environment within a fast-paced, mission-driven company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
