&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Associate Director of Workforce Staffing Operations, reporting to Director, you will lead, execute, and continuously improve a best-in-class staffing delivery program to support hourly / non-exempt talent needs across the HelloFresh US distribution center network. You are customer obsessed, have a passion for flawless execution, data driven, hands-on, &amp;amp; interested in being part of a team building “best in class” food fulfillment operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In partnership with leadership, manage internal and external vendor partner relationships with staffing partners including 3P vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of staffing associates and contingent workforce lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management and ownership of cost per hire through strategic oversight of contingent workforce partner delivery and other talent acquisition costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, develop and execute strategic vendor partner initiatives for all HelloFresh lines of business including; Hellofresh Core, Green Chef, EveryPlate, and Factor’s Distribution Center Network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive staffing performance and partner accountability via staffing scorecard to include benchmark metrics such as time to fill, time to hire, negative attrition, and others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Field HR leadership and Operations to develop targeted sourcing solutions for expansion related staffing and hard to fill markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, train, develop, mentor, and lead a team of internal staffing program leads and specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executes a vision, based upon data, for a team/business and develops scalable strategies that capture the best talent and most diverse candidates at the on time and at target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive continuous improvement the workforce fulfillment process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the analysis of daily, weekly, and monthly business reporting of Field Staffing performance via Key Performance Indicators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and communicate individual and team metrics ensuring alignment of OKRs to company staffing goals and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipates future business needs and identifies investments needed, and builds the infrastructure to ensure optimization capability is geared toward (or even ahead of) business demand (e.g. VMS platform considerations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with regional operations leaders, Labor Planning experts, and Finance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influences and makes recommendations to key stakeholders and decision-makers on building appropriate systems processes, and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in an innovative, fast-paced environment, can roll up their sleeves, and get the job done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 7+ years management experience leading workforce staffing programs in a high-volume, hourly / non-exempt function (Preferably in the Distribution / Warehousing space)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of emerging talent attraction strategies, tools, platforms, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading grassroots programs and events focused on expanding talent pipelines across multiple geographical locations in the United States.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem solving skills. Agile and Tenacious with ability to lead effectively through rapidly changing organizational strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic planning ability, with creative solution orientation in managing forecasted hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization, time management, and follow-through skills; high sense of urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge and commitment to embedding a diversity, equity and inclusion lens into recruiting, selection and hiring practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in reporting out metrics to all levels of an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll get…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive hourly rate, 401K company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;match that vests immediately upon participation, &amp;amp; team bonus opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and flexible attendance policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits with options at $0 monthly, effective first day of employment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Up to 85% discount on subscriptions to HelloFresh meal plans (HelloFresh, Green Chef, Everyplate, and Factor_)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
